(202, 24, '【展会聚焦】秋叶原第八届全球新电商博览会，杭州之行圆满结束！', '助人为乐、博爱奉献”--- 秋叶原爱心基金正式成立！', '<section data-role=\"paragraph\" data-mpa-powered-by=\"yiban.io\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 17px; text-align: justify; white-space: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><p style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 0px; clear: both; max-width: 100%; min-height: 1em; text-align: justify; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 1.5px; text-align: justify; color: rgb(63, 63, 63);\">为期三天的“第八届（杭州）全球新电商博览会”，于7月31日在杭州国际博览中心完美落幕。</span><span style=\"font-size: 16px; text-align: justify; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); margin: 0px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; letter-spacing: 2px; text-indent: 30px; caret-color: rgb(255, 0, 0); overflow-wrap: break-word !important; box-sizing: border-box !important;\">此次博览会预计展出面积60000平方，3000个国际标准展位，20000家MCN机构、12万专业观众及采购商到场洽谈</span><span style=\"font-size: 16px; text-align: justify; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); margin: 0px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; letter-spacing: 2px; background-color: rgb(252, 251, 250); caret-color: rgb(255, 0, 0); overflow-wrap: break-word !important; box-sizing: border-box !important;\">。</span><br/></span></p><p style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 0px; clear: both; max-width: 100%; min-height: 1em; letter-spacing: 1.5px; line-height: 1.5em; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot