t; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"/></span></strong></span></p><p style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 0px; clear: both; max-width: 100%; min-height: 1em; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;;\"><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;; font-size: 16px; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; color: rgb(255, 104, 39); overflow-wrap: break-word !important; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><strong style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: 1.5px; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; box-sizing: border-box !important;\">【秋叶原】</span></strong></span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); letter-spacing: 2px; text-indent: 30px; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; box-sizing: border-box !important;\">携<span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;; font-size: 16px; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; letter-spacing: 0.544px; text-indent: 34px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); overflow-wrap: break-word !important; box-sizing: border-box !important;\">复合光纤第二代HDMI高清线、&nbsp;2.1版8K</span><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;; font-size: 16px; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; letter-spacing: 0.544px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-indent: 2em; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; box-sizing: border-box !important;\">高清</span><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;; font-size: 16px; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; letter-spacing: 0.544px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); overflow-wrap: break-word !important; box-sizing: border-box !important;\">HDMI等影音连接线</span><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;; font-size: 16px; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; letter-spacing: 0.544px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-indent: 2em; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; box-sizing: border-box !important;\">，5G系列6A与7类网线、7A、八类网线，无线投屏器、拓展坞等3C数码周边新锐技术产品</span>亮相展会，与全球优秀电商、网红博主、业界知名企业、人士等一起共襄盛会，共促产业创新升级。</span></span></p><p style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 0px; clear: both; max-width: 100%; min-height: 1em; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><br/></p></section><section data-role=\"paragraph\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 17px; text-align: justify; white-space: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><section data-role=\"paragraph\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><p style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 0px; clear: both; max-width: 100%; min-height: 1em; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; text-align: center;\"><img src=\"/ueditor/php/upload/image/20210804/1628071674736132.jpg\" title=\"1628071674736132.jpg\" alt=\"3.webp.jpg\"/></p></section><section data-role=\"paragraph\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><p style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 0px; clear: both; max-width: 100%; min-height: 1em; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><br/></p><p style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 0px; clear: both; max-width: 100%; min-height: 1em; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;;\"><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;; font-size: 16px; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; color: rgb(255, 104, 39); overflow-wrap: break-word !important; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><strong style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: 1.5px; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; box-sizing: border-box !important;\">【秋叶原】</span></strong></span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: 1.5px; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; box-sizing: border-box !important;\">展馆内人来人往，热闹非凡，吸引了众多客户与媒体的目光，广获赞誉。小伙伴们细心接待，</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: 1.5px; text-indent: 2em; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; box-sizing: border-box !important;\">用扎实的专业知识为每一位前来咨询的观展客户耐心解答，得到了客户的高度认可。</span></span></p><p style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 0px; clear: both; max-width: 100%; min-height: 1em; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); letter-spacing: 1.5px; text-indent: 2em; font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"/></span></p></section></section><section data-role=\"paragraph\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 17px; text-align: justify; white-space: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><p style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 0px; clear: both; max-width: 100%; min-height: 1em; text-align: center; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><img src=\"/ueditor/php/upload/image/20210804/1628071682248096.jpg\" title=\"1628071682248096.jpg\" alt=\"4.webp.jpg\"/></p></section><section data-role=\"paragraph\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 17px; text-align: justify; white-space: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><p style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 0px; clear: both; max-width: 100%; min-height: 1em; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"/></p></section><section data-role=\"paragraph\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 17px; text-align: justify; white-space: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><p style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 0px; clear: both; max-width: 100%; min-height: 1em; letter-spacing: 1.5px; line-height: 1.5em; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; box-sizing: border-box !important;\">此次在</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; font-size: 14px; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(255, 104, 39); overflow-wrap: break-word !important; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><strong style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; box-sizing: border-box !important;\">电商之都</strong></span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; box-sizing: border-box !important;\">为期三天的展会给秋叶原提供了广阔的平台，向所有客户展示秋叶原在行业的专业实力。同时，在<span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;; font-size: 16px; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; caret-color: rgb(255, 0, 0); overflow-wrap: break-word !important; box-sizing: border-box !important;\">零距离与客户沟通后更深入了解了客户群体对产品的使用体验及潜在需求。</span></span></span></p><p style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 0px; clear: both; max-width: 100%; min-height: 1em; letter-spacing: 1.5px; line-height: 1.5em; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><span style=\"caret-color: rgb(255, 0, 0); margin: 0px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"/></span></p><p style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 0px; clear: both; max-width: 100%; min-height: 1em; letter-spacing: 1.5px; line-height: 1.5em; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; text-align: center;\"><img src=\"/ueditor/php/upload/image/20210804/1628071693179610.png\" title=\"1628071693179610.png\" alt=\"5.png\"/></p></section><section data-role=\"paragraph\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 17px; text-align: justify; white-space: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><p style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 0px; clear: both; max-width: 100%; min-height: 1em; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"/></p></section><section data-role=\"paragraph\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 17px; text-align: justify; white-space: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><p style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 0px; clear: both; max-width: 100%; min-height: 1em; letter-spacing: 1.5px; line-height: 1.5em; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; caret-color: red; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; box-sizing: border-box !important;\">秋叶原是一家以线缆生态链与互联网+布局，集研发、生产与销售为一体的</span><span style=\"color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; caret-color: red; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; box-sizing: border-box !important;\">国家级高新技术企业，将<span style=\"color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; letter-spacing: 2px; text-indent: 30px; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; box-sizing: border-box !important;\">聚焦中国新消费窗口红利期带来的数字创新、渠道变革，全面解读数字化、直播平台和社群经济与新零售、新电商的整合趋势，</span>对产品的生产、流通与销售进行优化升级，在线上线下、各大直播社交等平台打造专属产品IP。</span></span></p></section><p><br/></p>', 1, 0, 10, 255, '2021-08-04 18:08:42', '2021-08-04 18:08:42', '2021-08-04 18:08:42', '2023-07-21 13:48:24', '/upload/image/20210804/610a6726d46a3.png', 'null', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'PC', 'zh-CN'),
(203, 24, '【科普】线材端子为什么要镀金', '助人为乐、博爱奉献”--- 秋叶原爱心基金正式成立！', '<section data-role=\"outer\" label=\"Powered by 135editor.com\" data-mpa-powered-by=\"yiban.io\" class=\"\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><section data-role=\"paragraph\"><section style=\"text-align: center;line-height: 1.5em;\" class=\"\"></section><p style=\"letter-spacing: 1.5px; line-height: 1.5em; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"text-align: left; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); letter-spacing: 1px; font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;;\">你有没有发现一些线材的导线和端子的材质是不同的，比如音视频连接线、网线等，它们的导体都是采用精炼铜芯或其他金属按照一定工艺来绕制，以达到最优信号传输性能。</span></p><p style=\"letter-spacing: 1.5px; line-height: 1.5em; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"text-align: left; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); letter-spacing: 1px; font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;;\"><br/></span></p><p style=\"letter-spacing: 1.5px; line-height: 1.5em; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"text-align: left; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); letter-spacing: 1px; font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;;\"><img src=\"/ueditor/php/upload/image/20210809/1628473049334457.jpg\" title=\"1628473049334457.jpg\" alt=\"3.5mm音频线公对公车载音频线.jpg\"/></span></p></section><section data-role=\"paragraph\"><p style=\"line-height: 1.5em; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 1px; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-size: 14px; text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"><br/></span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.5em; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 1px; font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 1px; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">而作为整段线材</span><span style=\"font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 1px; max-inline-size: 100%; cursor: text; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(255, 0, 0); outline: none 0px !important;\">的关键之处--</span><span style=\"font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 1px; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">终端接头和导线的材料却不一样，在它们的表面或接头中的触点部分会镀</span><span style=\"font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 1px; max-inline-size: 100%; cursor: text; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(255, 0, 0); text-indent: 28px; outline: none 0px !important;\">上一层薄薄的</span><span style=\"font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 1px; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">金子，也就是常说的镀金工艺。</span></span></p></section><section data-role=\"paragraph\" data-width=\"64%\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin-left: auto;margin-right: auto;width: 64%;flex: 0 0 64%;\"><section style=\"text-align: center;line-height: 1.5em;\"><br/></section></section><p style=\"text-align:justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;;\">Q:<span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;; font-size: 16px; caret-color: red;\">为什么导体和端子的材质不同?</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align:justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;;\"><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;; font-size: 16px; caret-color: red;\"><br/></span></span></p><p style=\"text-align:justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;;\">铜是应用最广泛的导体材料，导电性导热性很好，信号传输衰减小，但是端子在抗氧化、耐腐蚀性、耐插拔性等方面的要求高于导体。</span></p><p style=\"text-align:justify;\"><br/></p><p style=\"text-align:justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;;\">Q:<span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;; font-size: 16px; caret-color: red;\">为什么选择镀金，而不是其他金属?</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align:justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;;\"><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;; font-size: 16px; caret-color: red;\"><br/></span></span></p><p style=\"text-align:justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;;\">1.抗氧化</span></p><p style=\"text-align:justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;;\">金的抗氧化能力很强，作为一种过渡金属，它的第一电离能高达890.1kJ/mol，仅次于它右边的汞（1007.1kJ/mol），这意味着氧要想从金那里夺得一个电子的难度极大。金不仅电离能高于其它金属，由于它的6s轨道有不成对电子，其雾化焓也很高，金的雾化焓为368kJ/mol（汞仅为64kJ/mol），这意味着金有更强的金属结合力，金原子之间强烈吸引，不容易被其它原子钻空子。</span></p><p><br/></p><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/P5z9Rt3xHToFEFnkM4pJwIUhxCxhYPzjwLONPfGdyKrQcyXicZkq5OLWY31BvDiaY08iazWvqxTywmvLfoFicAHzdw/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\" data-type=\"jpeg\" data-ratio=\"0.9025316455696203\" data-w=\"790\"/><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;;\"><br/></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;;\">2.防止腐蚀</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;;\">金是活泼性很差的金属（在金属活泼性顺序表中排在最后），一般不与酸碱等具有腐蚀性的物质发生化学反应，所以不易被腐蚀如氧化、硫化等。</span></p><p><br/></p><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/P5z9Rt3xHToFEFnkM4pJwIUhxCxhYPzjTz40D40L0q1IVBrnYmCsZOsnVJnPSKibAyAtygA2M0jNNFHsGnu2QFw/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\" data-type=\"jpeg\" data-ratio=\"1.039240506329114\" data-w=\"790\"/><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;;\"><br/></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;;\">3.耐插拔性</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;;\">出色的耐插拔性能除了合理严谨的生产工艺之外，在镀金之后会提高其硬度和耐磨度，降低产品损耗，延长产品寿命。</span></p><p><br/></p><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/P5z9Rt3xHToFEFnkM4pJwIUhxCxhYPzjJCv9t46xuVZ4N6LMibiaA4JKKlGZNRpzy3Iu48w8EaiaYiaMUtCagzdTKg/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\" data-type=\"jpeg\" data-ratio=\"1.1379746835443039\" data-w=\"790\"/><section data-role=\"paragraph\"><section style=\"line-height: 1.5em;\"><br/></section></section><section data-role=\"paragraph\" class=\"\"><section style=\"line-height: 1.5em; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(68, 68, 68); text-indent: 28px; letter-spacing: 2px; font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;;\">金是惰性金属，在高温下都极难氧化变色，且纯度越高、越厚的镀金层就越难氧化，品质越好。</span></section><section style=\"line-height: 1.5em;\"><br/></section><section style=\"line-height: 1.5em; text-align: center;\" class=\"\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/P5z9Rt3xHToFEFnkM4pJwIUhxCxhYPzjvfibJLC7FLaWiaGnO6DDM3kEZ1GBlmicZykABOmeu2IibtNnmTTiawziaGoQ/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\" data-type=\"jpeg\" data-ratio=\"1.2658227848101267\" data-w=\"790\"/></section><section style=\"line-height: 1.5em;\"><br/></section><section style=\"line-height: 1.5em; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 2px; color: rgb(68, 68, 68); text-indent: 28px; font-size: 16px;\">如果你的端子是镀金的，一段时间之后有变黑的迹象，可以将稀释的洗洁精蘸在软纸巾上擦拭，便可恢复如初，否则，就是买到了山寨接头，或者镀的是装饰金或金的纯度不够，在性能和价格上远不如镀真金。</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 2px; color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-size: 14px; text-indent: 28px;\"></span></span><span style=\"color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: 1px; text-indent: 28px; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;\"></span></section><section style=\"line-height: 1.5em;\"><p style=\"color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: 1px; text-indent: 28px; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;\"><br/></p></section><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img js_insertlocalimg\" data-s=\"300,640\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/P5z9Rt3xHTpmbwUERF1yX9dcTia3b9F6EfCqejhlCmROKbswdV1pl8rx17icumTW9052n4bQ8017ChjZ2msrJ6pQ/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\" data-type=\"jpeg\" data-ratio=\"1.3936708860759495\" data-w=\"790\"/></p><section style=\"line-height: 1.5em;\"><p style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;\"><br/></p></section><section style=\"line-height: 1.5em;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(68, 68, 68); text-indent: 28px; letter-spacing: 2px; font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;;\"><strong style=\"white-space: normal;\"><span style=\"text-indent: 28px; letter-spacing: 2px; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; color: rgb(255, 76, 65);\">所以在购买产品时一定要选择可靠的品牌哦！</span></strong></span></section></section></section>', 1, 0, 10, 255, '2021-08-09 09:38:13', '2021-08-09 09:38:13', '2021-08-09 09:38:13', '2023-07-21 13:48:24', '/upload/image/20210809/611086f931c43.jpeg', 'null', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'PC', 'zh-CN'),
(204, 24, '【企业荣誉】秋叶原旗下新材料公司获评深圳市南山区“绿色通道”企业', '助人为乐、博爱奉献”--- 秋叶原爱心基金正式成立！', '<section data-role=\"outer\" label=\"Powered by 135editor.com\"><section style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\" data-mpa-powered-by=\"yiban.io\" class=\"\"><section data-support=\"96编辑器\" data-style-id=\"24505\"><section data-support=\"96编辑器\" data-style-id=\"24505\"><section><section><section><section data-support=\"96编辑器\" data-style-id=\"24505\"><section data-support=\"96编辑器\" data-style-id=\"24505\"><section><section><section><section><section><section><section data-width=\"100%\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;width: 100%;\"><section><section><section><section><section data-support=\"96编辑器\" data-style-id=\"24505\"><section data-support=\"96编辑器\" data-style-id=\"24505\"><section class=\"\"><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;; font-size: 16px;\"><img src=\"/ueditor/php/upload/image/20210812/1628761425827571.jpg\" title=\"1628761425827571.jpg\" alt=\"1.jpg\"/></span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;; font-size: 16px;\"><br/></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;; font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-size: 14px; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\">近日，<span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;; max-width: 100%; letter-spacing: 0.544px; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">经深圳市南山区人民政府核定，广东前海秋叶原集团</span><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;; text-align: center; caret-color: red;\">旗下全资子公司——</span></span><span style=\"font-size: 14px; text-align: center; caret-color: red; color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"><strong>深圳市前海秋叶原新材料科技有限公司成功<span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;; letter-spacing: 0.544px; text-align: justify;\">获评南山区<strong style=\"text-align: center; background-color: rgb(254, 254, 254);\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;; letter-spacing: 0.544px; text-align: justify;\">2021-2023年度</span></strong>“绿色通道”企业</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;; letter-spacing: 0.544px; text-align: justify;\">荣誉称号，<span style=\"font-size: 16px; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); letter-spacing: 1px; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Emoji Symbols Font&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;\"></span></span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 16px; text-align: justify; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); letter-spacing: 1px; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Emoji Symbols Font&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;\">为公司带来了一系列辖区内的优惠政策以及便捷服务。</span></span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p style=\"text-align:left;max-width: 100%; min-height: 1em; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><br/></p><section data-role=\"paragraph\" class=\"\"><p style=\"text-align:justify;text-indent: 0em;letter-spacing: 1.5px;line-height: 1.5em;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.5px; text-align: left; white-space: pre-wrap; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;; font-size: 16px;\">据悉，南山区从1998年起，在全区范围内开展评选“绿色通道”企业活动，并对获选企业颁发“绿色通行证”，使持证企业享受到更优惠的政策和更便捷的服务。“绿色通道”评定企业范围覆盖南山区纳税百强、工业百强、上市企业、独角兽企业等。</span></p><section data-role=\"paragraph\" class=\"\"><p><br/></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"/ueditor/php/upload/image/20210812/1628761441621165.png\" title=\"1628761441621165.png\" alt=\"2.png\"/></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"/ueditor/php/upload/image/20210812/1628761495753413.png\" title=\"1628761495753413.png\" alt=\"640.png\"/></p></section><p style=\"text-align: center; text-indent: 0em; letter-spacing: 1.5px; line-height: 1.5em;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.544px; caret-color: red; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;; font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"caret-color: red; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 1px; text-align: justify; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(241, 92, 25); font-size: 14px; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">”绿色通道“企业可享受服务政策（截取部分）</span><span style=\"caret-color: red; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 1px; text-align: justify; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(241, 92, 25); box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">&nbsp;</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align:justify;text-indent: 0em;letter-spacing: 1.5px;line-height: 1.5em;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.544px; caret-color: red; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;; font-size: 16px;\"><br/></span></p><p style=\"text-align:justify;text-indent: 0em;letter-spacing: 1.5px;line-height: 1.5em;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.544px; caret-color: red; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;; font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-size: 14px; caret-color: red; letter-spacing: 0.544px; font-family: 微软雅黑, sans-serif;\">此荣誉的获得，<span style=\"font-size: 14px; caret-color: red; color: rgb(54, 54, 54); letter-spacing: 0.544px; font-family: PingFangSC-Light, sans-serif;\">代表南山区政府对公司价值和贡献的支持与认可，</span></span>意味着公司可享受南山区包括人才扶持措施、纳税服务、知识产权保护、人才健康管理等111条服务措施，在出入境、户政、申报认定等涉及政府审批事项上，可享受“直通车”式的便利审批与跟踪协助，<span style=\"font-size: 14px; font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;; caret-color: red; color: rgb(54, 54, 54); letter-spacing: 0.544px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">为企业提供精准式服务。</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align:justify;text-indent: 0em;letter-spacing: 1.5px;line-height: 1.5em;\"><br/></p></section><section data-role=\"paragraph\" class=\"\"><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"/ueditor/php/upload/image/20210812/1628761515794662.jpg\" title=\"1628761515794662.jpg\" alt=\"3.jpg\"/></p></section><section data-role=\"paragraph\" class=\"\"><p style=\"text-align:justify;text-indent: 0em;letter-spacing: 1.5px;line-height: 1.5em;\"><span style=\"caret-color: red; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;; font-size: 16px;\"><br/></span></p><p style=\"text-align:justify;text-indent: 0em;letter-spacing: 1.5px;line-height: 1.5em;\"><span style=\"caret-color: red; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;; font-size: 16px;\">未来，<span style=\"caret-color: red; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;; letter-spacing: 0.5px; text-align: left; white-space: pre-wrap;\">在政府部门的保驾护航下，</span>在政策利好、行业向上的大环境下，秋叶原将继续保持<span style=\"color: rgb(63, 63, 63); caret-color: red; letter-spacing: 0.544px; font-family: PingFangSC-Light, sans-serif;\">行业领先的创效能力，<span style=\"color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;; caret-color: red; letter-spacing: 0.544px;\">在全球科技革命和产业变革中稳步高质量发展，继续发挥优秀企业的示范带动作用。</span></span></span></p><p style=\"caret-color: red;letter-spacing: 0.544px;\"><br/></p></section><section data-role=\"paragraph\" class=\"\"><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"/ueditor/php/upload/image/20210812/1628761527675606.jpg\" title=\"1628761527675606.jpg\" alt=\"4.jpg\"/></p></section><section style=\"margin-right: 0%; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0%; box-sizing: border-box; height: 0px; overflow: hidden;\"></section></section><section data-role=\"paragraph\" class=\"\"><p><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;; font-size: 16px;\"><strong><span style=\"caret-color: red; font-size: 13px; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"><br/></span></strong></span></p><p><font color=\"#3f3f3f\" face=\"Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"caret-color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;; font-size: 16px;\"><b>关于公司：</b></span></font></p><p><strong><span style=\"caret-color: red; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\">深圳市前海秋叶原新材料科技有限公司</span></strong><span style=\"caret-color: red; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\">成立于2015年9月，是</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.544px; text-align: center; caret-color: red; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\">广东前海秋叶原集团</span><span style=\"caret-color: red; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\">的全资子公司之一。主营业务大宗商品有色金属铜杆，电解铜，铝锭，锌锭，锌合金，铝棒，电解镍，铅锭现货批发贸易和期货的套期保值，同时还为客户提供包括订单代采，货物质押，仓储物流等业务。</span></p></section></section>', 1, 0, 10, 255, '2021-08-12 17:47:01', '2021-08-12 17:47:01', '2021-08-12 17:47:01', '2023-07-21 13:48:24', '/upload/image/20210812/6114ee125c48c.jpeg', 'null', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'PC', 'zh-CN');
INSERT INTO `news` (`id`, `news_cate_id`, `title`, `short_title`, `content`, `admin_id`, `count`, `is_show`, `sort`, `start_time`, `end_time`, `create_at`, `update_at`, `pic`, `pics`, `seo_title`, `seo_keyword`, `seo_description`, `platform`, `lang`) VALUES
(206, 24, '【科普】网络从1G到5G的演进历程', '助人为乐、博爱奉献”--- 秋叶原爱心基金正式成立！', '<p style=\"white-space: normal; text-align: justify; letter-spacing: 1.5px; line-height: 1.5em;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;;\"><span style=\"caret-color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">从20世纪80年代发展至今，移动通信技术由</span>1G的大哥大→2G王者诺基亚→3G CDMA→4G LTE→5G万物互联，<span style=\"caret-color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">经历了五代的变迁，每一代移动通信技术的发展都带来了时代的变迁，我们的生活也因此变得便捷丰富。</span></span></p><p style=\"white-space: normal; text-align: justify; letter-spacing: 1.5px; line-height: 1.5em;\"><br/></p><p style=\"white-space: normal; text-align: center; letter-spacing: 1.5px; line-height: 1.5em;\"><img src=\"http://www.choseal.cn/ueditor/php/upload/image/20210817/1629167053568609.jpeg\" title=\"1629167053568609.jpeg\" alt=\"0d2b99cdb0d9424c9aa58f95f40b1acd.jpeg\"/></p><p style=\"white-space: normal; text-align: justify; letter-spacing: 1.5px; line-height: 1.5em;\"><br/></p><p style=\"white-space: normal; text-align: justify; letter-spacing: 1.5px; line-height: 1.5em;\"><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;;\"><strong><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">这是一段怎样的通信旅程呢？</span></strong><strong><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"></span></strong></span></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;\"><br/></p><p></p><section data-role=\"paragraph\" class=\"\" style=\"white-space: normal;\"><p><br/></p></section><section data-role=\"paragraph\" class=\"\" style=\"white-space: normal;\"><p><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;;\">1G：模拟语音时代</span></p><section data-role=\"paragraph\" class=\"\"><p><br/></p></section><p style=\"text-align: justify; letter-spacing: 1.5px; line-height: 1.5em;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;;\">1G是第一代移动通信技术，<span style=\"text-indent: 28px;\">制定于上世纪80年代，<span style=\"caret-color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">它是</span><span style=\"max-inline-size: 100%; cursor: text; caret-color: rgb(255, 0, 0); box-sizing: border-box !important; outline: none 0px !important;\">以模拟技术为基础的蜂窝无线电话系统，如今已淘汰的模拟移动网，</span></span>在无线通信历史上，它坐上了第一把交椅。<span style=\"text-indent: 28px;\">1G无线系统在设计上只能传输语音流量，并受到</span>网络容量<span style=\"text-indent: 28px;\">的限制。</span>AMPS<span style=\"text-indent: 28px;\">为1G网络的典型代表。</span></span></p></section><section data-role=\"paragraph\" class=\"\" style=\"white-space: normal;\"><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><br/></p></section><p style=\"text-indent: 0em; white-space: normal; text-align: justify; letter-spacing: 1.5px; line-height: 1.5em;\"><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(63, 63, 63);\">1G时代 “最贵的仔<span style=\"letter-spacing: 1.5px;\">（售价贵、通讯贵）</span>”——</span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 76, 65);\"><strong>大哥大</strong></span><span style=\"color: rgb(63, 63, 63);\">，它只能进行语音传输，接打电话，<span style=\"letter-spacing: 1.5px; text-indent: 32px;\">还</span>有距离的限制<span style=\"text-indent: 32px;\">，容易出现串号、盗号的现象，不久就被淘汰了</span>，如今，只能成为很多人的回忆了。</span></span></p><p style=\"text-indent: 0em; white-space: normal; text-align: justify; letter-spacing: 1.5px; line-height: 1.5em;\"><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(63, 63, 63);\"><br/></span></span></p><p style=\"text-indent: 0em; white-space: normal; text-align: center;\"><img src=\"http://www.choseal.cn/ueditor/php/upload/image/20210817/1629167086731466.jpg\" title=\"1629167086731466.jpg\" alt=\"src=http___ztd00.photos.bdimg.com_ztd_w=700;q=50_sign=a01d923cfad3572c66e29edcba28121a_ca1349540923dd54fc8262bdd909b3de9d824876.jpg&amp;refer=http___ztd00.photos.bdimg.jpg\" style=\"text-align: center; white-space: normal;\"/></p><p style=\"text-indent: 0em; white-space: normal;\"><br/></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;;\"><strong>2G：数字语音时代</strong></span></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;\"><br/></p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 15px; text-indent: 0em; white-space: normal; text-align: justify; zoom: 1; letter-spacing: 1.5px; line-height: 1.5em;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;;\">2G是第二代手机通信技术规格，<span style=\"text-indent: 34px; caret-color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">一改模拟通信方式，</span>以数字语音传输技术为核心，开启了数字通信之路。<span style=\"max-inline-size: 100%; cursor: text; caret-color: rgb(255, 0, 0); text-indent: 32px; box-sizing: border-box !important; outline: none 0px !important;\">相较于第一代移动通信技术，第二代移动通信具备高度的保密性，系统的容量也大幅增加，同时比1G多了数据传输服务，手机从这一代开始可以上网了，最早的文字简讯也从此开始。</span></span></p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 15px; text-indent: 0em; white-space: normal; text-align: justify; zoom: 1; letter-spacing: 1.5px; line-height: 1.5em;\"><span style=\"text-indent: 0em; caret-color: red; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;;\">2G时代也是移动通信标准争夺的开始，由欧洲起家的GSM（Global System for Mobile Communication）脱颖而出，成为最广泛采用的移动通信制式。伴随着GSM的崛起，在欧洲起家的诺基亚和爱立信开始攻占全球市场，仅仅用了十年，诺基亚就成了全球最大的移动电话商。</span></p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 15px; text-indent: 0em; white-space: normal; text-align: justify; zoom: 1; letter-spacing: 1.5px; line-height: 1.5em;\"><span style=\"text-indent: 0em; caret-color: red; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;;\"><br/></span></p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 15px; text-indent: 0em; white-space: normal; text-align: justify; zoom: 1; letter-spacing: 1.5px; line-height: 1.5em;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-align: left; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-indent: 0em; caret-color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;;\"></span></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;;\"><strong>3G：CMDA大行其道的时代</strong></span></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;\"><br/></p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 15px; text-indent: 0em; white-space: normal; text-align: justify; zoom: 1; letter-spacing: 1.5px; line-height: 1.5em;\"><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(63, 63, 63); text-indent: 0em; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); caret-color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">3G是第三代移动通信技术</span><span style=\"color: rgb(63, 63, 63); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); caret-color: rgb(255, 0, 0); text-indent: 28px;\">，是指将无线通信与国际互联网等多媒体通信结合的新一代移动通信系统。</span><span style=\"color: rgb(63, 63, 63); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); caret-color: rgb(255, 0, 0); text-indent: 32px;\">2009年1月7日，中国发了三张3G牌照，分别是中国移动的TD-SCDMA，中国联通的W-CDMA和中国电信的WCDMA2000，中国进入了3G时代。</span></span></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;\"><br/></p><p style=\"white-space: normal; text-align: justify; letter-spacing: 1.5px; line-height: 1.5em;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;;\"><span style=\"text-indent: 32px;\">在3G 之下，我们有了更高频宽和稳定的传输，视频电话和大量数据传送更为普遍，移动通讯也有着更为多样化的应用。</span>由于无线通信和互联网的结合，智能手机和平板电脑得以迅猛发展，3G更是被视为是开启移动通讯新纪元的关键。</span></p><p style=\"white-space: normal; text-align: justify; letter-spacing: 1.5px; line-height: 1.5em;\"><br/></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;;\"><strong>4G：移动互联网新高度</strong></span></p><p></p><section data-role=\"paragraph\" class=\"\" style=\"white-space: normal;\"><p><br/></p></section><section data-role=\"paragraph\" style=\"white-space: normal;\"><p style=\"text-align: justify; letter-spacing: 1.5px; line-height: 1.5em;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;;\"><span style=\"text-indent: 28px;\">4G是第四代</span>移动通信技术<span style=\"letter-spacing: 0px; background: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">，是<span style=\"caret-color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">2013 年才开始正式挺进人们视线里的小鲜肉<span style=\"text-indent: 28px;\">，</span></span>能够传输高质量视频图像，以及高质量图像。进入4G时代后，全球移动通信标准呈现出进一步融合的趋势。从影响力上来看，4G可以说是专门为移动互联网设计的通信技术，不论是从网速、容量和稳定性上来看，4G相较于上一代3G技术都有了明显的提升，</span><span style=\"text-indent: 28px;\">并能够满足几乎所有用户对于无线服务的要求。</span></span></p></section><p></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;\"><br/></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;\"><br/></p><p style=\"white-space: normal; text-align: justify; letter-spacing: 1.5px; line-height: 1.5em;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;;\">4G网络通信速度的极大提高，高清图像和视频等数据得以快速传输，<span style=\"text-indent: 32px;\">移动互联网开启了一股新的浪潮，移动支付、滴滴、美团等新兴产业和应用的发展繁荣兴盛。</span></span></p><p style=\"white-space: normal; text-align: justify; letter-spacing: 1.5px; line-height: 1.5em;\"><br/></p><p style=\"white-space: normal; text-align: center; letter-spacing: 1.5px; line-height: 1.5em;\"><img src=\"http://www.choseal.cn/ueditor/php/upload/image/20210817/1629167105879049.jpg\" title=\"1629167105879049.jpg\" alt=\"0e2442a7d933c895dd287f63dd1373f082020057.jpg\" style=\"letter-spacing: 1.5px;\"/></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;\"><br/></p><p></p><section data-role=\"paragraph\" class=\"\" style=\"white-space: normal;\"><p><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;;\"><strong><br/></strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;;\"><strong>5G：万物互联的时代</strong></span></p><p><br/></p></section><section data-role=\"paragraph\" class=\"\" style=\"white-space: normal;\"><p style=\"text-align: justify; letter-spacing: 1.5px; line-height: 1.5em;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;;\"><span style=\"text-indent: 28px;\">5G是第五代</span>移动通信技术<span style=\"text-indent: 28px;\">，5G 网络主要有三大特点：</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify; letter-spacing: 1.5px; line-height: 1.5em;\"><br/></p><p style=\"text-align: justify; letter-spacing: 1.5px; line-height: 1.5em;\"><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;;\"><strong><span style=\"text-indent: 28px; color: rgb(63, 63, 63);\">高速率，</span></strong><span style=\"text-indent: 28px; color: rgb(63, 63, 63);\">不仅仅是3秒钟下载1部超高清电影这么简单，VR、AR、云技术将与生活无缝对接；</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify; letter-spacing: 1.5px; line-height: 1.5em;\"><br/></p><p style=\"text-align: justify; letter-spacing: 1.5px; line-height: 1.5em;\"><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;;\"><strong><span style=\"text-indent: 28px; color: rgb(63, 63, 63);\">高可靠低时延，</span></strong><span style=\"text-indent: 28px; color: rgb(63, 63, 63);\"><strong style=\"max-width: 100%; font-size: inherit; line-height: inherit; color: rgb(191, 54, 12); box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">毫秒级</strong>通信时延,让无人驾驶、远程手术不再遥远；</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify; letter-spacing: 1.5px; line-height: 1.5em;\"><br/></p><p style=\"text-align: justify; letter-spacing: 1.5px; line-height: 1.5em;\"><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;;\"><strong><span style=\"text-indent: 28px; color: rgb(63, 63, 63);\">超大数量终端网络，&nbsp;</span></strong><span style=\"text-indent: 28px; color: rgb(63, 63, 63);\">达到<strong style=\"max-width: 100%; font-size: inherit; line-height: inherit; color: rgb(191, 54, 12); box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">百万/平方公里</strong>&nbsp;的联网终端,将形成更广阔和开放的物联网，让智慧家居、智慧城市成为可能。</span></span></p></section><section data-role=\"paragraph\" class=\"\" style=\"white-space: normal;\"><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><br/></p></section><section data-role=\"paragraph\" style=\"white-space: normal;\"><p><br/></p></section><section data-role=\"paragraph\" class=\"\" style=\"white-space: normal;\"><p style=\"text-align: justify; letter-spacing: 1.5px; line-height: 1.5em;\"><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;;\"><strong><span style=\"text-align: left; color: rgb(255, 76, 65);\">信息随心至，万物触手及<strong style=\"font-size: inherit; letter-spacing: 1.5px; max-width: 100%; line-height: inherit; color: rgb(191, 54, 12); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">，</strong></span></strong><span style=\"text-align: left; color: rgb(63, 63, 63);\">在5G网络中，数据传输速率是惊人的，速率稳定维持在2Gbps以上， 也就是250MB/s。</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify; letter-spacing: 1.5px; line-height: 1.5em;\"><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;; text-align: left; color: rgb(63, 63, 63);\"><br/></span></p><p style=\"text-align: center; letter-spacing: 1.5px; line-height: 1.5em;\"><span style=\"text-align: left; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;;\"><img src=\"http://www.choseal.cn/ueditor/php/upload/image/20210817/1629167124582655.jpg\" title=\"1629167124582655.jpg\" alt=\"O1CN01kX6nFF1n0Pi2WgOO0_!!398685027.jpg\"/></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify; letter-spacing: 1.5px; line-height: 1.5em;\"><br/></p><p style=\"text-align: justify; letter-spacing: 1.5px; line-height: 1.5em;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 1px; font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;;\"><span style=\"text-align: left; color: rgb(63, 63, 63);\">为了匹配5G网络，需要新建和升级改造大量的5G基站和高速宽带环境的数据中心，需要数量巨大的高速通信网线。</span>因此对拥有万兆高速传输能力，满足5G时代高速率、大容量、低延时<span style=\"color: rgb(63, 63, 63); text-indent: 32px;\">的</span><span style=\"text-indent: 32px; color: rgb(255, 76, 65);\"><strong>秋叶原</strong></span><span style=\"color: rgb(63, 63, 63); text-indent: 32px;\">七类（CAT7）、超七类、四万兆八类（CAT8）网线的需求迎来了大爆发。</span></span></p><p style=\"letter-spacing: 1.5px; line-height: 1.5em;\"><br/></p><p style=\"letter-spacing: 1.5px; line-height: 1.5em; text-align: center;\"><img src=\"http://www.choseal.cn/ueditor/php/upload/image/20210817/1629167139780058.jpg\" title=\"1629167139780058.jpg\" alt=\"微信图片_20210303155316.jpg\"/></p><p style=\"letter-spacing: 1.5px; line-height: 1.5em;\"><br/></p><p style=\"text-align: justify; letter-spacing: 1.5px; line-height: 1.5em;\"><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(63, 63, 63); caret-color: rgb(255, 0, 0); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-indent: 32px; max-inline-size: 100%; cursor: text; letter-spacing: 1.5px; text-align: left; box-sizing: border-box !important; outline: none 0px !important;\">同时也需要对家用网线进行更新换代，</span><span style=\"max-inline-size: 100%; cursor: text; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); caret-color: rgb(255, 0, 0); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); max-width: 100%; letter-spacing: 0.544px; text-indent: 32px; box-sizing: border-box !important; outline: none 0px !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">具有</span><span style=\"max-inline-size: 100%; cursor: text; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); caret-color: rgb(255, 0, 0); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); max-width: 100%; letter-spacing: 0.544px; text-indent: 34px; box-sizing: border-box !important; outline: none 0px !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">10Gbps传输速率，<span style=\"max-inline-size: 100%; cursor: text; max-width: 100%; letter-spacing: 0.544px; text-align: left;\">500MHZ带宽的秋</span></span><strong><span style=\"text-align: left; max-inline-size: 100%; cursor: text; caret-color: rgb(255, 0, 0); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); max-width: 100%; letter-spacing: 0.544px; text-indent: 34px; color: rgb(255, 76, 65); box-sizing: border-box !important; outline: none 0px !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">叶原<span style=\"max-inline-size: 100%; cursor: text; max-width: 100%; letter-spacing: 0.544px; text-align: justify; text-indent: 32px;\">超六类（CAT6A）网线，</span></span></strong><span style=\"color: rgb(63, 63, 63); caret-color: rgb(255, 0, 0); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); max-inline-size: 100%; cursor: text; max-width: 100%; letter-spacing: 0.544px; text-indent: 32px; box-sizing: border-box !important; outline: none 0px !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">成为<span style=\"max-inline-size: 100%; cursor: text; max-width: 100%; text-indent: 34px; letter-spacing: 2px; text-align: left;\">家庭和企业办公5G万兆高速传输的<span style=\"max-inline-size: 100%; cursor: text; max-width: 100%; letter-spacing: 0.544px; text-align: justify; text-indent: 32px; box-sizing: border-box !important; outline: none 0px !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">首推<span style=\"max-inline-size: 100%; cursor: text; max-width: 100%; text-indent: 34px; letter-spacing: 2px; text-align: left;\">入门</span></span>网线。</span></span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify; letter-spacing: 1.5px; line-height: 1.5em;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(63, 63, 63); caret-color: rgb(255, 0, 0); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;; max-inline-size: 100%; cursor: text; max-width: 100%; text-indent: 34px; letter-spacing: 2px; text-align: left; box-sizing: border-box !important; outline: none 0px !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><br/></span></p></section><section data-role=\"paragraph\" class=\"\" style=\"white-space: normal;\"><p style=\"text-align: justify; letter-spacing: 1.5px; line-height: 1.5em;\"><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 2px; text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(255, 0, 0); color: rgb(63, 63, 63);\">历史的车轮是在泥泞中前进的，不是在高速路上前进的。<strong style=\"max-inline-size: 100%; cursor: text; font-size: inherit; max-width: 100%; text-align: justify; line-height: inherit; color: rgb(191, 54, 12); box-sizing: border-box !important; outline: none 0px !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"></strong>从1G到5G，主要区别在于速率、业务类型、传输时延，以及各种移动通讯等采用了不同的技术，遵循不同的通讯协议，<span style=\"color: rgb(62, 62, 62); text-align: justify;\">经历了</span></span><strong><span style=\"letter-spacing: 2px; text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(255, 0, 0); color: rgb(255, 76, 65);\">萌芽<span style=\"text-align: justify;\">、</span>成长<span style=\"text-align: justify;\">、</span>修正<span style=\"text-align: justify;\">、</span>提升<span style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</span></span></strong><span style=\"letter-spacing: 2px; text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(255, 0, 0); color: rgb(63, 63, 63);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(62, 62, 62); text-align: justify;\">一系列过程，</span>所以，让我们继续期待新未来吧！</span></span></p></section><p></p>', 1, 0, 10, 255, '2021-08-17 10:30:03', '2021-08-17 10:30:03', '2021-08-17 10:30:03', '2023-07-21 13:48:24', '/upload/image/20210817/611b1f2541e2a.jpeg', 'null', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'PC', 'zh-CN'),
(207, 24, '正义力量！秋叶原与市场监督管理局联手严惩商标侵权行为', '助人为乐、博爱奉献”--- 秋叶原爱心基金正式成立！', '<section data-role=\"outer\" label=\"Powered by 135editor.com\"><section data-mpa-powered-by=\"yiban.io\"><section class=\"\"><p style=\"text-align:justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; caret-color: red; letter-spacing: 1.5px; text-indent: 0em; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Emoji Symbols Font&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;\">近日，重庆市九龙坡市场监管局在辖区查获一起假冒“秋叶原”商标侵权案。</span></p><p style=\"text-align:justify;text-indent: 0em;letter-spacing: 1.5px;line-height: 1.5em;\"><br/></p><p style=\"text-align:justify;text-indent: 0em;letter-spacing: 1.5px;line-height: 1.5em;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: rgb(38, 38, 38); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\">九龙坡市场监管局执法人员在渝州五金机电城内<span style=\"letter-spacing: 1.5px;\">发现</span>售卖的网络线缆产品<span style=\"max-width: 100%;letter-spacing: 0.544px;text-indent: 34px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">在包装和实物上标注有“秋精叶品原”、“秋香叶港原”等字眼，且有意将“秋叶原”字体突出放大，误导消费者误认其“<span style=\"max-width: 100%;\">产品</span>”系我司“深圳市秋叶原实业有限公司”产品，强行与“秋叶原”品牌产生联系，使相关公众产生误认，利用“秋叶原”合法注册商标蒙骗消费者，<span style=\"max-width: 100%;\">对秋叶原品牌形象及经销网络造成损害，</span>扰乱市场秩序！</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align:justify;text-indent: 0em;letter-spacing: 1.5px;line-height: 1.5em;\"><br/></p><section style=\"opacity: 0.35;margin-right: 0%;margin-left: 0%;box-sizing: border-box;\" powered-by=\"135编辑器\" class=\"_135editor\"></section><section data-role=\"paragraph\" class=\"\"><p style=\"text-align:justify;text-indent: 0em;letter-spacing: 1.5px;line-height: 1.5em;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: rgb(38, 38, 38); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.544px;caret-color: red;max-width: 100%;text-indent: 34px;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">Choseal秋叶原作为线缆行业30+年的耕耘者，</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.544px;text-indent: 2em;caret-color: red;\">始终认为坚守品牌自主及变革创新是企业和产品成功的根本，公司从创立之日起，在科研创新方面投入未曾停歇，努力钻研。</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align:justify;text-indent: 0em;letter-spacing: 1.5px;line-height: 1.5em;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: rgb(38, 38, 38); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.544px;text-indent: 2em;caret-color: red;\"><br/></span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: center; text-indent: 0em; letter-spacing: 1.5px; line-height: 1.5em;\"><img src=\"/ueditor/php/upload/image/20210820/1629454338450865.jpg\" title=\"1629454338450865.jpg\" alt=\"微信图片_20210303155316.jpg\"/></p><p style=\"text-align: center; text-indent: 0em; letter-spacing: 1.5px; line-height: 1.5em;\"></p><p style=\"text-align:justify;text-indent: 0em;letter-spacing: 1.5px;line-height: 1.5em;\"><br/></p><p style=\"text-align:justify;text-indent: 0em;letter-spacing: 1.5px;line-height: 1.5em;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(38, 38, 38); font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: 0.544px; text-indent: 2em; caret-color: red; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\">先后成立“秋叶原电线电缆研究所”、“秋叶原电线电缆实验室”、2018年与国家副部级单位 — “</span><span style=\"color: rgb(38, 38, 38); font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: 0.544px; caret-color: red; max-width: 100%; text-indent: 34px; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\">中国兵工学会</span><span style=\"color: rgb(38, 38, 38); font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: 0.544px; caret-color: red; text-indent: 34px; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\">”合作成立“中国兵工学会军工安防研究院深圳分院”，为国家安防事业发展做出行业领域贡献，紧跟5G、8K等时代技术发展潮流，在万兆传输领域、8K音视频传输领域、接插件领域都取得卓越贡献。</span></p><p style=\"text-align:justify;text-indent: 0em;letter-spacing: 1.5px;line-height: 1.5em;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(38, 38, 38); font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: 0.544px; caret-color: red; text-indent: 34px; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"><br/></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(38, 38, 38); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: 0.544px; text-indent: 34px; caret-color: red; text-align: justify;\">并获得“中国驰名商标”、“国家级高新技术企业”、“中国电线电缆百强企业”、“国家电线电缆手册修订组专家成员”等多项代表着研发实力的殊荣。</span><br/></p><p style=\"letter-spacing: 0.544px;caret-color: red;text-indent: 34px;\"><br/></p><p><span style=\"letter-spacing: 1.5px; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0em; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(38, 38, 38); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\">品牌的美誉势必会招来市场上一些别有用心商家的觊觎，秋叶原对待这些商家也始终保持</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 1.5px; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0em; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(255, 76, 65); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"><strong>零容忍</strong></span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 1.5px; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0em; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(38, 38, 38); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\">的态度！自商标注册以来，秋叶原从未间断商标维权工作，以维护自身的合法权益。</span><br/></p></section><section style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\" powered-by=\"135编辑器\" class=\"_135editor\"><section style=\"display: flex;flex-flow: row nowrap;justify-content: center;isolation: isolate;margin: -10px 0% 10px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"box-sizing:border-box;display: inline-block;width: auto;vertical-align: top;flex: 0 0 0%;align-self: flex-start;height: auto;line-height: 1;\"><section style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\" powered-by=\"135编辑器\"><section style=\"box-sizing:border-box;display: inline-block;width: 15px;height: 15px;vertical-align: top;overflow: hidden;background-color: #ffffff;\"><section><svg viewbox=\"0 0 1 1\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;float:left;line-height:0;width:0;vertical-align:top;\" xml:space=\"default\"></svg></section></section></section></section></section></section><section data-tools=\"135编辑器\" data-id=\"105519\" class=\"_135editor\"><section style=\"text-align: center;margin: 10px auto;\"><section style=\"font-size: 28px;letter-spacing: 1.5px;color: #cf1512;line-height: 40px;text-shadow: 1px 1px 0px #f8ae04;\" hm_fix=\"344:734\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"><strong data-brushtype=\"text\">依法查处</strong></span></section><section style=\"display: flex;align-items: center;margin-top: 5px;\"><section style=\"box-sizing:border-box;width: 100%;height: 1px;background-image: linear-gradient(to right, #fcf0f0, #e37473);overflow: hidden;\" data-width=\"100%\"><br/></section><section style=\"box-sizing:border-box;width: 110px;margin-right: 10px;margin-left: 10px;\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/P5z9Rt3xHTohWv9bgiatN7LO5l3ATYvw4VRFY8XpYnMVIKhW5COu5H0iaiaRh9X4KKHYYxwiamCibJI8jozojR5FGSQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" data-type=\"png\" data-width=\"100%\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;width: 100%;display: block;\" data-ratio=\"0.3333333333333333\" data-w=\"84\"/></section><section style=\"box-sizing:border-box;width: 100%;height: 1px;background-image: linear-gradient(to left, #fcf0f0, #e37473);overflow: hidden;\" data-width=\"100%\"><br/></section></section></section></section><section data-role=\"paragraph\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"/ueditor/php/upload/image/20210820/1629454257281554.jpg\" style=\"\" title=\"1629454257281554.jpg\"/></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"/ueditor/php/upload/image/20210820/1629454257123503.jpg\" style=\"\" title=\"1629454257123503.jpg\"/></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"/ueditor/php/upload/image/20210820/1629454257319751.jpg\" style=\"\" title=\"1629454257319751.jpg\"/></p><p style=\"text-align:center;text-indent: 0em;letter-spacing: 1.5px;line-height: 1.5em;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;color: #ff4c41;\"><strong>查封侵权产品</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center;text-indent: 0em;letter-spacing: 1.5px;line-height: 1.5em;\"><br/></p></section><section data-role=\"paragraph\"><p style=\"text-align:justify;text-indent: 0em;letter-spacing: 1.5px;line-height: 1.5em;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: rgb(38, 38, 38); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\">执法人员现场对经营者进行宣传教育，要求涉嫌侵权的商品立即停止销售，将涉嫌侵权的商品进行没收、封存，并告知经营者等候调查处理，同时提供相关来源及授权证明等材料。</span></p><p style=\"text-align:justify;text-indent: 0em;letter-spacing: 1.5px;line-height: 1.5em;\"><br/></p></section><section data-role=\"paragraph\"><p style=\"text-indent: 0em; white-space: normal; max-inline-size: 100%; cursor: text; caret-color: rgb(255, 0, 0); letter-spacing: 1.5px; line-height: 1.5em; font-family: 微软雅黑, sans-serif; outline: none 0px !important; text-align: center;\"></p><p style=\"text-indent: 0em; white-space: normal; max-inline-size: 100%; cursor: text; caret-color: rgb(255, 0, 0); letter-spacing: 1.5px; line-height: 1.5em; font-family: 微软雅黑, sans-serif; outline: none 0px !important; text-align: center;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"/ueditor/php/upload/image/20210820/1629454294238991.jpg\" style=\"\" title=\"1629454294238991.jpg\"/></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"/ueditor/php/upload/image/20210820/1629454294227723.jpg\" style=\"\" title=\"1629454294227723.jpg\"/></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"/ueditor/php/upload/image/20210820/1629454294386424.jpg\" style=\"\" title=\"1629454294386424.jpg\"/></p><p style=\"text-indent: 0em; white-space: normal; max-inline-size: 100%; cursor: text; caret-color: rgb(255, 0, 0); letter-spacing: 1.5px; line-height: 1.5em; font-family: 微软雅黑, sans-serif; outline: none 0px !important; text-align: center;\"><br/></p></section><section data-role=\"paragraph\"><p><br/></p></section><section data-role=\"paragraph\"><p style=\"text-align:justify;text-indent: 0em;letter-spacing: 1.5px;line-height: 1.5em;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: rgb(38, 38, 38); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\">维护秋叶原品牌的市场声誉始终是我们对客户的严肃承诺，秋叶原将进一步加大维权力度，切实维护“秋叶原”商标的合法权益。<span style=\"caret-color: red;\">如果大家发现有类似的假冒、仿冒、未经授权侵犯秋叶原品牌和字号的行为，请积极、主动、及时地与当地<span style=\"letter-spacing: 1.5px;\">市场监管局</span>或秋叶原公司法务部门联系。让我们携手合作，共同监督，维护良好的市场环境。</span></span></p></section></section></section></section>', 1, 0, 10, 255, '2021-08-20 18:00:44', '2021-08-20 18:00:44', '2021-08-20 18:00:44', '2023-07-21 13:48:24', '/upload/image/20210820/611f7d3ae7b83.jpeg', 'null', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'PC', 'zh-CN'),
(208, 24, '【分析】如何选购水晶头', '助人为乐、博爱奉献”--- 秋叶原爱心基金正式成立！', '<p style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-mpa-powered-by=\"yiban.io\"><span style=\"color: rgb(63, 63, 63); letter-spacing: 1.5px; caret-color: red; font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;;\">在综合布线中，网线是传输环节的一个重要产品，常见的有超5类、6类、7类、8类之分，与之对应的水晶头也有超5类、6类、7类、8类之分。<br/></span></p><p><br/></p><section data-role=\"paragraph\" class=\"\"><p><br/></p></section><section data-role=\"paragraph\"><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"/ueditor/php/upload/image/20210903/1630635861612094.jpg\" title=\"1630635861612094.jpg\" alt=\"O1CN01wBd8tM1n0PeEWSfKH_!!398685027.jpg\"/></p></section><section data-role=\"paragraph\"><p><br/></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Emoji Symbols Font&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); letter-spacing: 1.5px; caret-color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">如果水晶头搭配不当，即使其他网络布线产品应用的很好，也可能会产生电磁干扰导致网速卡顿，甚至</span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Emoji Symbols Font&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); letter-spacing: 1.5px; caret-color: rgb(255, 0, 0); max-inline-size: 100%; cursor: text; outline: none 0px !important;\">整个链路都瘫痪。</span></span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(63, 63, 63); letter-spacing: 1.5px; caret-color: rgb(255, 0, 0); max-inline-size: 100%; cursor: text; font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;; outline: none 0px !important;\"><br/></span></p></section><section data-role=\"paragraph\"><p style=\"text-align:justify;letter-spacing: 1.5px;line-height: 1.75em;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 76, 65); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;;\"><strong><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 76, 65); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Emoji Symbols Font&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; caret-color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">那么，应该怎么选择水晶头呢？</span></strong></span></p><section data-tools=\"135编辑器\" data-id=\"93743\" class=\"_135editor\"><section style=\"text-align: center;\"><section style=\"width:6em;display: inline-block;\"></section></section></section></section><section data-role=\"paragraph\"><p style=\"letter-spacing: 1.5px;line-height: 1.75em;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Emoji Symbols Font&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; background-color: rgb(255, 76, 0); color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">&nbsp;1.看网线类别&nbsp;</span></strong></span></p><p style=\"letter-spacing: 1.5px;line-height: 1.75em;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Emoji Symbols Font&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; background-color: rgb(255, 76, 0); color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><br/></span></strong></span></p></section><section data-role=\"paragraph\"><p style=\"text-align:justify;letter-spacing: 1.5px;line-height: 1.75em;\"><span style=\"caret-color: rgb(255, 0, 0); color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;;\">水晶头类别和网线类别相匹配即可，如超五类网线用超五类水晶头，六类网线用六类水晶头，七类网线选七类专用带燕尾夹的屏蔽水晶头<span style=\"caret-color: rgb(255, 0, 0); color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Emoji Symbols Font&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.544px;\">。</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align:justify;letter-spacing: 1.5px;line-height: 1.75em;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.544px; caret-color: rgb(255, 0, 0); color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;;\"><br/></span></p><p style=\"text-align: center; letter-spacing: 1.5px; line-height: 1.75em;\"><img src=\"/ueditor/php/upload/image/20210903/1630635875767361.jpg\" title=\"1630635875767361.jpg\" alt=\"O1CN01yko23V1n0PeE00FAl_!!398685027.jpg\"/></p></section><section data-role=\"paragraph\"><p style=\"letter-spacing: 1.5px;line-height: 1.75em;\"><br/></p><p style=\"letter-spacing: 1.5px;line-height: 1.75em;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Emoji Symbols Font&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; background-color: rgb(255, 76, 0); color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">2.看屏蔽类型&nbsp;</span></strong></span></p><p style=\"letter-spacing: 1.5px;line-height: 1.75em;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Emoji Symbols Font&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; background-color: rgb(255, 76, 0); color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><br/></span></strong></span></p></section><section data-role=\"paragraph\"><p style=\"letter-spacing: 1.5px;line-height: 1.75em;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;;\">非屏蔽网线选非屏蔽水晶头即可，如果是屏蔽网线就选屏蔽水晶头（包括一些列配套器材都需要选屏蔽的，如网络面板、模块等），才会达到最佳屏蔽效果。</span></p><p style=\"letter-spacing: 1.5px;line-height: 1.75em;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;;\"><br/></span></p><p style=\"letter-spacing: 1.5px; line-height: 1.75em; text-align: center;\"><img src=\"/ueditor/php/upload/image/20210903/1630635888686414.jpg\" title=\"1630635888686414.jpg\" alt=\"O1CN01KEkw0k1n0PeEh6GZU_!!398685027.jpg\"/></p><p style=\"letter-spacing: 1.5px; line-height: 1.75em;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(63, 63, 63); letter-spacing: 1.5px; text-align: justify; font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;;\"><br/></span></p><p style=\"letter-spacing: 1.5px; line-height: 1.75em;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(63, 63, 63); letter-spacing: 1.5px; text-align: justify; font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;;\">目前市场上水晶头是多种多样的，很多不负责任的商家，为了获得销量，用降低产品质量、低价销售的方式，这样就导致他们采用回收料或者工业等级很低的材料作为水晶头的原材料进行生产，这些产品不仅性能达不到使用要求，同时还极大的污染环境。</span></p></section><p><br/></p><p style=\"text-align:justify;letter-spacing: 1.5px;line-height: 1.75em;\"><br/></p><p style=\"text-align:justify;letter-spacing: 1.5px;line-height: 1.75em;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 76, 65); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;;\"><strong>那什么样的水晶头才是高品质的呢？</strong></span></p><p><br/></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;;\"><strong>1.标识：</strong>优质的水晶头在塑料弹片上都有厂商的标注;</span></p><p><br/></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;;\"><strong>2.芯片：</strong>这是最关键的一点，优质的水晶头上芯片会采用镀金工艺，颜色纯正光亮，比较粗厚，可以降低链路传输损耗，保证传输的稳定性；</span></p><p><br/></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;;\"><strong>3.可塑性：</strong>用线钳压制时可塑性差的水晶头会发生碎裂等现象;</span></p><p><br/></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;;\"><strong>4.弹片弹性：</strong>质量好的水晶头用手指拨动弹片会听到铮铮的声音，将弹片向前拨动到90度，弹片也不会折断，而且会恢复原状并且弹性不会改变!将做好的水晶头插入集线设备或者网卡中的时候能听到清脆的&quot;咔&quot;的响声;</span></p><p><br/></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;;\"><strong>5.透明度：</strong>好的水晶头是晶莹透亮的，就跟它的名字一样，边角光滑无瑕疵。</span></p><p style=\"text-align:justify;\"><br/></p><p><br/></p><section style=\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 15px; zoom: 1; font-size: 14px; text-indent: 0em; letter-spacing: 1.5px; line-height: 1.75em; font-family: arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"text-align: left; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); letter-spacing: 1px; font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;;\">大家可以按照这些小技巧去选购水晶头哦~</span></section><section style=\"text-align: center; margin-bottom: 15px; zoom: 1; font-size: 14px; text-indent: 0em; letter-spacing: 1.5px; line-height: 1.75em; font-family: arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"text-align: left; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); letter-spacing: 1px; font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;;\"><img src=\"/ueditor/php/upload/image/20210903/1630635912219762.jpg\" title=\"1630635912219762.jpg\" alt=\"O1CN01HMAwxB1n0PVMmJsLV_!!398685027.jpg\"/></span></section><section style=\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 15px; zoom: 1; font-size: 14px; text-indent: 0em; letter-spacing: 1.5px; line-height: 1.75em; font-family: arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(63, 63, 63); letter-spacing: 1.5px; font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;;\">虽说在网络传输产品中，水晶头可以说是最小的设备之一，但它却起着非常大的作用，在选购时切不可大意，也不可贪图小便宜，最终酿成大祸。</span></section><p><br/></p><p style=\"text-align:justify;letter-spacing: 1.5px;line-height: 1.75em;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Emoji Symbols Font&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; color: rgb(63, 63, 63);\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Emoji Symbols Font&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; caret-color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">其实想要找到好的水晶头也不难，</span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Emoji Symbols Font&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; max-inline-size: 100%; cursor: text; caret-color: rgb(255, 0, 0); text-align: left; outline: none 0px !important;\">可登陆</span></span><strong><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Emoji Symbols Font&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; max-inline-size: 100%; cursor: text; caret-color: rgb(255, 0, 0); text-align: left; color: rgb(255, 76, 65); outline: none 0px !important;\">秋叶原</span></strong><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Emoji Symbols Font&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); max-inline-size: 100%; cursor: text; caret-color: rgb(255, 0, 0); text-align: left; outline: none 0px !important;\">各大官方商城或线下授权体验店购买：水晶头<span style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Emoji Symbols Font&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.544px; text-indent: 28px;\">种类齐全，选用的材质均为优质PVC料制作，</span>晶莹透亮，镀金芯片传输更稳定。</span></span></p><p><br/></p>', 1, 0, 10, 255, '2021-09-03 10:53:23', '2021-09-03 10:53:23', '2021-09-03 10:53:23', '2023-07-21 13:48:24', '/upload/image/20210903/613187af919ee.jpeg', 'null', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'PC', 'zh-CN');
INSERT INTO `news` (`id`, `news_cate_id`, `title`, `short_title`, `content`, `admin_id`, `count`, `is_show`, `sort`, `start_time`, `end_time`, `create_at`, `update_at`, `pic`, `pics`, `seo_title`, `seo_keyword`, `seo_description`, `platform`, `lang`) VALUES
(209, 24, '【科普】HDMI线有方向性分正反吗', '助人为乐、博爱奉献”--- 秋叶原爱心基金正式成立！', '<section data-role=\"outer\" label=\"Powered by 135editor.com\"><section style=\"white-space: normal;\" data-mpa-powered-by=\"yiban.io\"><section style=\"border-width: 0px; border-style: none; border-color: initial; font-family: 微软雅黑; box-sizing: border-box;\"><section class=\"\"><section style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1.75em; height: 0px; overflow: hidden;\" class=\"\"></section><section style=\"text-align: justify;letter-spacing: 1.5px;line-height: 1.75em;\" class=\"\"><p style=\"letter-spacing: 1.5px; line-height: 1.75em;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(63, 63, 63); letter-spacing: 1px; font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;;\"><span style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: red;\">自HDMI标准诞生以来，以其出色的性能实现了音频视频讯号的高效传输，</span><span style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: red; text-indent: 28px;\">广泛应用于机顶盒、DVD播放机、个人计算机、电视、游戏主机、综合扩大机、数字音响与电视机等设备，势头如日中天。</span></span></p></section><section style=\"text-align: justify;letter-spacing: 1.5px;line-height: 1.75em;\" class=\"\"><p style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 1px; font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;;\"><span style=\"max-inline-size: 100%; cursor: text; caret-color: rgb(255, 0, 0); text-indent: 28px; text-align: left; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); outline: none 0px !important;\"><br/></span></span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 1px; font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;;\"><span style=\"max-inline-size: 100%; cursor: text; caret-color: rgb(255, 0, 0); text-indent: 28px; text-align: left; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); outline: none 0px !important;\">常用的HDMI高清线分为</span><span style=\"max-inline-size: 100%; cursor: text; caret-color: rgb(255, 0, 0); text-indent: 28px; text-align: left; background-color: rgb(255, 76, 65); color: rgb(255, 255, 255); outline: none 0px !important;\">普通HDMI线和光纤HDMI线</span><span style=\"max-inline-size: 100%; cursor: text; caret-color: rgb(255, 0, 0); text-indent: 28px; text-align: left; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); outline: none 0px !important;\">两种，因两端都是一模一样的接头，让不少用户发出疑惑：HDMI线在使用时有方向性吗？有正反之分吗？</span></span></p></section><section data-role=\"paragraph\" class=\"\"><p style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\"><br/></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\"><strong><span style=\"caret-color: red; font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;;\">普通HDMI线</span></strong></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\"><span style=\"caret-color: red; font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;;\"><br/></span></p></section><section style=\"text-align: justify;letter-spacing: 1.5px;line-height: 1.75em;\" class=\"\"><p style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\"><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;;\"><span style=\"max-inline-size: 100%; cursor: text; caret-color: rgb(255, 0, 0); text-indent: 28px; text-align: left; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); letter-spacing: 1px; outline: none 0px !important;\">普通HDMI线也就是铜缆HDMI线，传输距离在</span><span style=\"max-inline-size: 100%; cursor: text; caret-color: rgb(255, 0, 0); text-indent: 28px; text-align: left; letter-spacing: 1px; background-color: rgb(255, 76, 65); color: rgb(255, 255, 255); outline: none 0px !important;\">30米以内的</span><span style=\"max-inline-size: 100%; cursor: text; caret-color: rgb(255, 0, 0); text-indent: 28px; text-align: left; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); letter-spacing: 1px; outline: none 0px !important;\">是目前最为普及的HDMI产品，不论是日常游戏、办公、打造家庭影院还是在工程应用中都是很常见的。</span></span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\"><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;;\"><span style=\"max-inline-size: 100%; cursor: text; caret-color: rgb(255, 0, 0); text-indent: 28px; text-align: left; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); letter-spacing: 1px; outline: none 0px !important;\"><br/></span></span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.75em; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;;\"><span style=\"max-inline-size: 100%; cursor: text; caret-color: rgb(255, 0, 0); text-indent: 28px; text-align: left; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); letter-spacing: 1px; outline: none 0px !important;\"><img src=\"/ueditor/php/upload/image/20210906/1630894234410478.jpg\" title=\"1630894234410478.jpg\" alt=\"O1CN01NqvaIW1n0PgSDAOAs_!!398685027.jpg\"/></span></span></p></section><section style=\"text-align: justify;letter-spacing: 1.5px;line-height: 1.75em;\"><p style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 1px; font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;;\"><span style=\"max-inline-size: 100%; cursor: text; caret-color: rgb(255, 0, 0); text-indent: 28px; text-align: left; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); outline: none 0px !important;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><br/></span></span></span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 1px; font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;;\"><span style=\"max-inline-size: 100%; cursor: text; caret-color: rgb(255, 0, 0); text-indent: 28px; text-align: left; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); outline: none 0px !important;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">铜缆HDMI传输的是纯弱电信号，输入端到输出端的传输信号都是直接互通不需要调解，</span>所以</span><span style=\"max-inline-size: 100%; cursor: text; caret-color: rgb(255, 0, 0); text-indent: 28px; text-align: left; background-color: rgb(255, 76, 65); color: rgb(255, 255, 255); outline: none 0px !important;\">没有方向性不分正反</span><span style=\"max-inline-size: 100%; cursor: text; caret-color: rgb(255, 0, 0); text-indent: 28px; text-align: left; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); outline: none 0px !important;\">。线缆的两端可以任意连接<span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">输入端</span>或<span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">输出端</span>，均不会对传输信号效果产生影响。</span></span></p></section><section style=\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 15px; letter-spacing: 1.5px; line-height: 1.75em; height: 0px; overflow: hidden;\"></section><p style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\"><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;;\"><strong>注意</strong></span></p><p><br/></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\"><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;;\">要实现铜缆HDMI信号远距离传输，厂家为保证较长距离信号的强度和稳定性，会在接口处添加信号放大器，这种加有信号放大器的长米数铜缆HDMI线就需要分正反方向（如有的产品标注<strong style=\"outline: 0px; letter-spacing: 2px; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;\">TV</strong>端的必须连接电视等显示设备），在使用时要注意线身的标志。</span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\"><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;;\"><br/></span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.75em; text-align: center;\"><img src=\"/ueditor/php/upload/image/20210906/1630894292798878.jpg\" title=\"1630894292798878.jpg\" alt=\"微信图片_20210805164225.jpg\"/></p><p style=\"text-align:justify; margin-bottom: 15px; letter-spacing: 1.5px; line-height: 1.75em;\"><strong><span style=\"caret-color: red; font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;;\"><br/></span></strong></p><p style=\"text-align:justify; margin-bottom: 15px; letter-spacing: 1.5px; line-height: 1.75em;\"><strong><span style=\"caret-color: red; font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;;\">光纤HDMI线</span></strong></p><section style=\"text-align: justify;letter-spacing: 1.5px;line-height: 1.75em;\" class=\"\"><p style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\"><span style=\"max-inline-size: 100%; cursor: text; caret-color: rgb(255, 0, 0); text-indent: 28px; text-align: left; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); letter-spacing: 1px; font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;; outline: none 0px !important;\">HDMI线传输载体不断变化，以光纤作为载体的HDMI高清线火了起来，<span style=\"max-inline-size: 100%; cursor: text; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); outline: none 0px !important;\">它和铜缆HDMI的传输特性不同，</span><span style=\"max-inline-size: 100%; cursor: text; text-indent: 0em; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); outline: none 0px !important;\">中间线身部分为光纤传输介质，需要通过两次光电转换才能实现信号传输。</span><br/></span></p></section><section style=\"text-align: justify; outline: 0px; text-indent: 0em; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 1.5px; line-height: 1.75em; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Arial, sans-serif; height: 0px; overflow: hidden;\"></section><section style=\"text-align: justify; outline: 0px; text-indent: 0em; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 1.5px; line-height: 1.75em; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Arial, sans-serif;\" class=\"\"><br/></section><section style=\"outline: 0px; letter-spacing: 0.544px; text-indent: 0em; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); line-height: 1.75em; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Arial, sans-serif;\"><section style=\"letter-spacing: 1.5px;line-height: 1.75em;\"><p style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(63, 63, 63); letter-spacing: 1px; font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;;\"><span style=\"text-indent: 0em; caret-color: red; outline-style: initial;\">首先需先将信号源端发射出来的电信号经过输入端调制芯片转化为高速光信号，由光信号经过中间的光纤部分耦合传递至信号输出端；</span><span style=\"text-indent: 0em; caret-color: red;\">再由输出端经过光电转换调制芯片,将光信号调解成播放端可识别的数字电信号，才算完成整个视听信号传输的完整过程。</span></span></p></section></section><section style=\"outline: 0px; letter-spacing: 0.544px; text-indent: 0em; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-align: center; line-height: 1.75em; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Arial, sans-serif;\"><br/></section><section style=\"outline: 0px; letter-spacing: 0.544px; text-indent: 0em; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); line-height: 1.75em; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Arial, sans-serif;\"><section style=\"letter-spacing: 1.5px;line-height: 1.75em;\" class=\"\"><p style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 1px; font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(63, 63, 63); outline: 0px;\">两次光电转换的过程不可逆，因此光纤HDMI线使用时是</span><span style=\"outline: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 76, 65); color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">有方向性区分正反的</span><span style=\"color: rgb(63, 63, 63);\"><span style=\"outline: 0px;\">，</span><span style=\"text-indent: 0em; caret-color: red;\">必须正确对应连接插口。</span></span></span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 1px; font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(63, 63, 63);\"><span style=\"text-indent: 0em; caret-color: red;\"><br/></span></span></span></p></section></section><section><section style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\" class=\"\"><p style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\"></p></section></section><section style=\"outline: 0px; letter-spacing: 0.544px; text-indent: 0em; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); line-height: 1.75em; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Arial, sans-serif;\"><section style=\"letter-spacing: 1.5px;line-height: 1.75em;\"><p style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 1px; font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(63, 63, 63); outline: 0px;\">标记着</span><span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 76, 65); color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span style=\"outline: 0px;\">“</span><strong style=\"outline: 0px;\"><span style=\"outline: 0px;\">SOURCE</span></strong><span style=\"outline: 0px;\">”为信号输入端</span></span><span style=\"color: rgb(63, 63, 63);\"><span style=\"outline: 0px;\">，</span><span style=\"text-indent: 0em; caret-color: red;\">插在电脑主机、DVD等设备上；</span></span></span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 1px; font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(63, 63, 63);\"><span style=\"text-indent: 0em; caret-color: red;\"><br/></span></span></span></p></section></section><section style=\"outline: 0px; letter-spacing: 0.544px; text-indent: 0em; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); line-height: 1.75em; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Arial, sans-serif;\"><section style=\"letter-spacing: 1.5px;line-height: 1.75em;\" class=\"\"><p style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 1px; font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(63, 63, 63); outline: 0px;\">标记着</span><span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 76, 65); color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span style=\"outline: 0px;\">“</span><strong style=\"outline: 0px;\"><span style=\"outline: 0px;\">DISPLAY</span></strong><span style=\"outline: 0px;\">”为信号输出端</span></span><span style=\"color: rgb(63, 63, 63); outline: 0px;\">，插在电视等各种高清显示设备上即可。</span></span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 1px; font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(63, 63, 63); outline: 0px;\"><br/></span></span></p></section></section><section class=\"\"><p style=\"text-align:center; line-height: 1.75em;\"></p></section><section style=\"text-align: center; letter-spacing: 1.5px; line-height: 1.75em;\" class=\"\"><img src=\"/ueditor/php/upload/image/20210906/1630894327409402.jpg\" title=\"1630894327409402.jpg\" alt=\"微信图片_202108051642253.jpg\"/></section><section style=\"text-align: justify;letter-spacing: 1.5px;line-height: 1.75em;\" class=\"\"><p style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\"><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 1px;\"><br/></span></span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\"><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 1px;\">HDMI光纤线堪称长距离传输的未来。</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 1px; background-color: rgb(255, 76, 65); color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">秋叶原第三代复合光纤HDMI高清线，</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 1px; text-align: start;\">150米超长光电智慧</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 1px;\">，领衔新标杆，不受外部电磁干扰，<span style=\"caret-color: red;\">信号传输衰减几乎为零，不需要担心传输带宽问题，可以尽情的享受音质效果和绚丽多彩的高清画面。</span></span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section>', 1, 0, 10, 255, '2021-09-06 10:13:05', '2021-09-06 10:13:05', '2021-09-06 10:13:05', '2023-07-21 13:48:24', '/upload/image/20210906/6135791e6a9d0.jpeg', 'null', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'PC', 'zh-CN'),
(210, 24, '【秋叶原成功承办】——全国第四届电线电缆制造工（检验工）职业技能竞赛第八赛区（通讯线缆检验组）预选赛', '助人为乐、博爱奉献”--- 秋叶原爱心基金正式成立！', '<section data-role=\"paragraph\" data-mpa-powered-by=\"yiban.io\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 17px; text-align: justify; white-space: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><p style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 0px; clear: both; max-width: 100%; min-height: 1em; letter-spacing: 1.5px; line-height: 1.75em; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 1px; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; white-space: break-spaces; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-size: 14px; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; box-sizing: border-box !important;\">9月10日，2021年“湾缆杯”广东线缆行业职业技能竞赛暨全国第四届电线电缆制造工（检验工）职业技能竞赛第八赛区（通讯线缆检验组）预选赛，在</span><strong style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 1px; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; white-space: break-spaces; background-color: rgb(255, 76, 65); font-size: 14px; color: rgb(255, 255, 255); overflow-wrap: break-word !important; box-sizing: border-box !important;\">秋叶原惠州产业园区</span></strong><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 1px; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; white-space: break-spaces; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-size: 14px; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; box-sizing: border-box !important;\">落下帷幕。</span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 1px; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); white-space: break-spaces; font-size: 14px; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; box-sizing: border-box !important;\">秋叶原作为线缆行业著名品牌，同时也是本次大赛东道主，在</span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 1px; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-size: 14px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); overflow-wrap: break-word !important; box-sizing: border-box !important;\">激烈的角逐中，创造佳绩！</span></p><p style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 0px; clear: both; max-width: 100%; min-height: 1em; letter-spacing: 1.5px; line-height: 1.75em; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 1px; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-size: 14px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); overflow-wrap: break-word !important; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><br/></span></p><p style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 0px; clear: both; max-width: 100%; min-height: 1em; text-align: center; letter-spacing: 1.5px; line-height: 1.75em; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;\"><strong style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; font-size: 13px; color: rgb(255, 76, 65);\"><img src=\"/ueditor/php/upload/image/20210910/1631266759554490.jpg\" title=\"1631266759554490.jpg\" alt=\"10.webp.jpg\"/></span></strong></span></p></section><p><section data-role=\"paragraph\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 17px; text-align: justify; white-space: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><p style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 0px; clear: both; max-width: 100%; min-height: 1em; line-height: 1.75em; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"></p></section></p><p><section data-role=\"paragraph\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 17px; text-align: justify; white-space: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><p style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 0px; clear: both; max-width: 100%; min-height: 1em; letter-spacing: 1.5px; line-height: 1.75em; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; outline: 0px; text-indent: 32px; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: 1px; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; outline: 0px; color: rgb(38, 38, 38); text-indent: 28px; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); overflow-wrap: break-word !important; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; outline: 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; box-sizing: border-box !important;\">“全国第四届电线电缆制造工(检验工)职业技能竞赛”</span>是由中国机械工业联合会、中国就业培训技术指导中心、中国机械冶金建材工会全国委员会主办的，是国家级二类竞赛，</span>也是本行业国家级的第四次竞赛，今年的参与单位数量在疫情影响下仍超过了往届。</span></p><p style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 0px; clear: both; max-width: 100%; min-height: 1em; letter-spacing: 1.5px; line-height: 1.75em; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"/></p><p style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 0px; clear: both; max-width: 100%; min-height: 1em; letter-spacing: 1.5px; line-height: 1.75em; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; text-align: center;\"><img src=\"/ueditor/php/upload/image/20210910/1631266771644563.jpg\" title=\"1631266771644563.jpg\" alt=\"2.webp.jpg\"/></p><p style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 0px; clear: both; max-width: 100%; min-height: 1em; letter-spacing: 1.5px; line-height: 1.75em; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"/></p><p style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 0px; clear: both; max-width: 100%; min-height: 1em; letter-spacing: 1.5px; line-height: 1.75em; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: 1px; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); overflow-wrap: break-word !important; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; outline: 0px; text-indent: 32px; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; text-indent: 28px; caret-color: rgb(255, 0, 0); overflow-wrap: break-word !important; box-sizing: border-box !important;\">本届技能</span>竞赛分为13个赛区，</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; text-indent: 2em; caret-color: red; outline-style: initial; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; box-sizing: border-box !important;\">首次增加学生组同台竞技。</span></span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; caret-color: red; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); outline-style: initial; text-indent: 32px; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; max-inline-size: 100%; outline-style: initial; cursor: text; caret-color: red; text-indent: 2em; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; outline-color: initial !important; outline-width: 0px !important;\">在根据地域划分的全国13个赛区内进行预赛后，<span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; max-inline-size: 100%; outline-style: initial; cursor: text; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; box-sizing: border-box !important;\">11月将在上海宝山进行决赛</span></span>。</span></span></p></section><section data-role=\"paragraph\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 17px; text-align: justify; white-space: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><p style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 0px; clear: both; max-width: 100%; min-height: 1em; line-height: 1.75em; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"/></p></section><section data-role=\"paragraph\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 17px; text-align: justify; white-space: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><p style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 0px; clear: both; max-width: 100%; min-height: 1em; line-height: 1.75em; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; text-align: center;\"><img src=\"/ueditor/php/upload/image/20210910/1631266787594018.jpg\" title=\"1631266787594018.jpg\" alt=\"3.webp.jpg\"/></p><p style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 0px; clear: both; max-width: 100%; min-height: 1em; text-align: center; line-height: 1.75em; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; color: rgb(255, 76, 65); font-size: 13px; letter-spacing