x !important; text-align: center; line-height: 1.75em;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; letter-spacing: 1px; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;\"><strong style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; font-size: 13px; color: rgb(255, 76, 65); overflow-wrap: break-word !important; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"/></span></strong></span></section><p style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 0px; clear: both; max-width: 100%; min-height: 1em; text-align: center; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><img src=\"/ueditor/php/upload/image/20210910/1631266869677803.jpg\" title=\"1631266869677803.jpg\" alt=\"9.webp.jpg\"/></p></section><section data-role=\"paragraph\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 17px; text-align: justify; white-space: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><section style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; line-height: 1.75em;\"><br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"/></section></section><section data-role=\"paragraph\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 17px; text-align: justify; white-space: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><section style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; line-height: 1.75em; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); letter-spacing: 1px; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;\">此次技能竞赛旨在发现、选拔和培养技能人才，调动电线电缆人员立足本职，学习理论，钻研技术，精通技能，增强责任感，全面提高综合素质，增强行业企业科技创新能力、提高产业工人队伍综合素质、提升电线电缆产品质量及电线电缆检测装备水平。</span></section></section></p>', 1, 0, 10, 255, '2021-09-10 17:49:39', '2021-09-10 17:49:39', '2021-09-10 17:49:39', '2023-07-21 13:48:24', '/upload/image/20210910/613b284b17075.jpeg', 'null', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'PC', 'zh-CN');
INSERT INTO `news` (`id`, `news_cate_id`, `title`, `short_title`, `content`, `admin_id`, `count`, `is_show`, `sort`, `start_time`, `end_time`, `create_at`, `update_at`, `pic`, `pics`, `seo_title`, `seo_keyword`, `seo_description`, `platform`, `lang`) VALUES
(211, 24, '秋叶原热烈祝贺国家安防行业标准《安防线缆产品认证实施规则》修订稿评审会圆满召开！', '助人为乐、博爱奉献”--- 秋叶原爱心基金正式成立！', '<section data-role=\"outer\" label=\"Powered by 135editor.com\"><section data-role=\"paragraph\" data-mpa-powered-by=\"yiban.io\" class=\"\"><section style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1.5em; height: 0px; overflow: hidden;\"></section><section style=\"text-align: justify;letter-spacing: 1.5px;line-height: 1.5em;\" class=\"\"><p style=\"font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: 0.5px; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;; font-size: 16px;\">9月13日，《安防线缆产品认证实施规则》修订稿评审会在广东省惠州市博罗县罗浮山嘉宝田酒店圆满召开！<br/></span></p></section><section style=\"text-align: justify;letter-spacing: 1.5px;line-height: 1.5em;\"><p style=\"font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: 0.5px; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;\"><br/></p></section><section style=\"text-align: center; letter-spacing: 1.5px; line-height: 1.5em;\"><img src=\"/ueditor/php/upload/image/20210915/1631697127481070.jpg\" title=\"1631697127481070.jpg\" alt=\"640.webp.jpg\"/></section><p style=\"text-align: justify;letter-spacing: 1.5px;line-height: 1.5em;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.5px; font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;;\"><br/></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;letter-spacing: 1.5px;line-height: 1.5em;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.5px; font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;;\">此次针对安防线缆认证规则，增加了安防线缆接插件认证检验项目，明确型式试验检测样品要求，监督检测抽样的办法，确定所生产的产品符合规定要求的检验试验仪器设备。</span></p><section style=\"text-align: justify;letter-spacing: 1.5px;line-height: 1.5em;\" class=\"\"><p style=\"font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: 0.5px; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;\"><br/></p></section><section style=\"text-align: center; letter-spacing: 1.5px; line-height: 1.5em; height: 0px; overflow: hidden;\" class=\"\"></section><section style=\"text-align: justify;letter-spacing: 1.5px;line-height: 1.5em;\"><p style=\"font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: 0.5px; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; text-align: center;\"><img src=\"/ueditor/php/upload/image/20210915/1631697137682994.jpg\" title=\"1631697137682994.jpg\" alt=\"2.webp.jpg\"/></p></section><p style=\"text-align: justify;letter-spacing: 1.5px;line-height: 1.5em;\"><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\"><br/></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;letter-spacing: 1.5px;line-height: 1.5em;\"><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">中国安全技术防范认证中心、公安部第一研究所、深圳市秋叶原实业有限公司、深圳市南士科技股份有限公司、上海爱谱华顿集团电子科技有限公司、浙江万马通信线缆有限公司、广州宇洪科技股份有限公司等国家标准化技术委员会及相关行业领导企业共同参加会议并参与标准审议。</span></p><section style=\"text-align: justify;letter-spacing: 1.5px;line-height: 1.5em;\" class=\"\"><p style=\"font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: 0.5px; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;\"><br/></p><p style=\"font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: 0.5px; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; text-align: center;\"><img src=\"/ueditor/php/upload/image/20210915/1631697148633200.jpg\" title=\"1631697148633200.jpg\" alt=\"30.webp.jpg\"/></p></section><section style=\"text-align: center; letter-spacing: 1.5px; line-height: 1.5em; height: 0px; overflow: hidden;\" class=\"\"></section><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><br/></p></section><p style=\"text-align:justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;;\">《安全技术防范产品自愿性认证实施规则 安防线缆产品》（编号：CSP-V06-001:2017)是由中国安全技术防范认证中心组织制订，经公安部科信局批准实施中国公共安全产品认证（GA认证）的安防产品认证实施规则。自颁布以来，对推动安防线缆标准的贯彻实施，改进产品质量发挥了积极作用。目前，修订后的GA/T 1297-2021《安防线缆》和GA/T 1351-2018《安防线缆接插件》已发布实施，为满足视频监控等安防系统工程对提升线缆和接插件产品质量的需要，组织对安防线缆产品认证实施规则进行了修订，增加了安防线缆接插件产品的认证要求。</span></p><section data-role=\"paragraph\"><p style=\"line-height: 1.5em;\"><br/></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.5em; text-align: center;\"><img src=\"/ueditor/php/upload/image/20210915/1631697160373242.jpg\" title=\"1631697160373242.jpg\" alt=\"4.webp.jpg\"/></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.5em;\"><br/></p></section><section data-role=\"paragraph\"><section style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1.5em; height: 0px; overflow: hidden;\" class=\"\"></section><section style=\"line-height: 1.5em;\" class=\"\"><br/></section></section><section data-role=\"paragraph\"><p style=\"text-align: justify; letter-spacing: 1.5px; line-height: 1.5em;\"><span style=\"line-height: 1.5em; letter-spacing: 0.5px; font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;;\">此次召开<span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.5px; font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;; line-height: 1.5em; caret-color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">的</span>《安防线缆产品认证实施规则》修订稿评审会强化了安防线缆接插件产品安全质量监管，对<span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.5px; font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;; line-height: 1.5em; caret-color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">信号传输线缆产品的选用、安装等规定了一些原则性的要求，对提升安防线缆接插件产品将有章可循、有标准可依、有设计原则，</span>推动了安防线缆行业健康、可持续发展，对规范安防线缆市场行为起到划时代意义。</span></p><p style=\"letter-spacing: 1.5px; line-height: 1.5em;\"><span style=\"line-height: 1.5em; letter-spacing: 0.5px; font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;;\"><br/></span></p><p style=\"letter-spacing: 1.5px; line-height: 1.5em; text-align: center;\"><img src=\"/ueditor/php/upload/image/20210915/1631697172825354.jpg\" title=\"1631697172825354.jpg\" alt=\"5.webp.jpg\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: 0.5px; text-align: left; text-indent: 28px; white-space: pre-wrap;\"/></p><section style=\"text-align: justify;letter-spacing: 1.5px;line-height: 1.5em;\" class=\"\"><p style=\"text-indent: 28px; white-space: pre-wrap; line-height: 1.5em; font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: 0.5px; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;\"><br/></p></section><section style=\"text-align: justify;letter-spacing: 1.5px;line-height: 1.5em;\" class=\"\"><span style=\"line-height: 1.5em; letter-spacing: 0.5px; font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.5px; font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;; line-height: 24px; text-indent: 28px; white-space: pre-wrap;\">秋叶原</span>作为国内安防线缆企业的杰出代表，全程参与了此次标准审议，将不遗余力，努力做好安防线缆产品认证实施规则的推进者和践行者，成为实施规则的一大助力。</span></section></section><section data-role=\"paragraph\"><p style=\"line-height: 1.5em;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.5px; text-align: justify; font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;;\"><br/></span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.5em; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.5px; text-align: justify; font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;;\"><img src=\"/ueditor/php/upload/image/20210915/1631697228146293.jpg\" title=\"1631697228146293.jpg\" alt=\"6.webp.jpg\"/></span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.5em;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.5px; text-align: justify; font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;;\"><br/></span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.5em;\"><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;; letter-spacing: 0.5px; text-align: justify;\">随着中国安防行业蓬勃发展，安防线缆产品作为重要的信号传输介质，被广泛应用于各大安防系统的连接，并发挥着重要的作用。未来，相信在企业、行业、权威机构共同努力下，秋叶原与整个安防工程线缆行业将会迈向设计专业性、系统可靠性、用户保障性的领域，促进安防系统的稳定性及市场的良性发展。<br/></span></p></section><section data-role=\"paragraph\" class=\"\"><section style=\"text-align: justify;letter-spacing: 1.5px;line-height: 1.5em;\"><br/></section></section><section style=\"line-height: 1.5em; height: 0px; overflow: hidden;\" class=\"\"></section><section style=\"line-height: 1.5em; height: 0px; overflow: hidden;\" class=\"\"></section></section><p><br/></p>', 1, 0, 10, 255, '2021-09-15 17:14:15', '2021-09-15 17:14:15', '2021-09-15 17:14:15', '2023-07-21 13:48:24', '/upload/image/20210915/6141b95f9d28e.jpeg', 'null', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'PC', 'zh-CN'),
(213, 24, '【科普】什么是DP接口', '助人为乐、博爱奉献”--- 秋叶原爱心基金正式成立！', '<section data-role=\"paragraph\" data-mpa-powered-by=\"yiban.io\" class=\"\" style=\"white-space: normal;\"><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Emoji Symbols Font&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 2px; caret-color: red;\">随着显示器技术的不断发展，</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 2px;\">高带宽和高刷新率的线材大受追捧</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 2px; caret-color: red;\">，DP高清线就成了极致影音爱好者首选，电竞发烧友至爱！</span><br/></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Emoji Symbols Font&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 2px; caret-color: red;\"><br/></span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: center; letter-spacing: 1.5px; line-height: 1.75em;\"><img src=\"http://www.choseal.cn/ueditor/php/upload/image/20210926/1632619590636324.jpg\" title=\"1632619590636324.jpg\" alt=\"微信图片_20210926092613.jpg\"/></p></section><p><section data-role=\"paragraph\" class=\"\" style=\"white-space: normal;\"><p style=\"text-align: justify; letter-spacing: 1.5px; line-height: 1.75em;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Emoji Symbols Font&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;\"><strong><span style=\"text-indent: 28px;\"><br/></span></strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify; letter-spacing: 1.5px; line-height: 1.75em;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Emoji Symbols Font&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;\"><strong><span style=\"text-indent: 28px;\">DP（DisplayPort）</span></strong><span style=\"text-indent: 28px;\">是一种高清数字显示接口标准，可以连接电脑和显示器，也可以连接电脑和</span>家庭影院<span style=\"text-indent: 28px;\">，是第一个依赖数据包化数据传输技术的显示通信端口。</span></span></p></section><section data-role=\"paragraph\" style=\"white-space: normal;\"><p><br/></p></section><section data-role=\"paragraph\" class=\"\" style=\"white-space: normal;\"><p style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: 1.75em; letter-spacing: 1.5px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Emoji Symbols Font&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"caret-color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">DP接口作为DVI的继任者，也</span><span style=\"max-inline-size: 100%; cursor: text; caret-color: rgb(255, 0, 0); letter-spacing: 1px; outline: none 0px !important;\">可以简单理解成HDMI的加强版。它</span><span style=\"caret-color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">在传输视频信号的同时加入对高清音频信号传输的支持，同时支持更高的分辨率和刷新率。在数据传输上，DP使用了“micro-packetised”格式，并具备高度的可扩展性，可以在今后不断加入更多新内容。</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: 1.75em; letter-spacing: 1.5px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Emoji Symbols Font&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"caret-color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"><br/></span></span></p></section><section data-role=\"paragraph\" class=\"\" style=\"white-space: normal;\"><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"http://www.choseal.cn/ueditor/php/upload/image/20210926/1632619550225347.jpg\" title=\"1632619550225347.jpg\" alt=\"O1CN010iIXwb2BiQSyuQvwQ_!!407628372_看图王.jpg\" style=\"letter-spacing: 1.5px; text-align: justify;\"/></p></section><section data-role=\"paragraph\" class=\"\" style=\"white-space: normal;\"><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Emoji Symbols Font&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;\"><strong style=\"caret-color: red;\"><br/></strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Emoji Symbols Font&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;\"><strong style=\"caret-color: red;\">DP版本发展</strong><br/></span></p></section><section data-role=\"paragraph\" class=\"\" style=\"white-space: normal;\"><p><br/></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Emoji Symbols Font&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;\">1.1 带宽10.8Gbps，最高支持 2560*1600 (2K）分辨率（已基本淘汰）</span></p><p><br/></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Emoji Symbols Font&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;\">1.2 带宽21.6Gbps，最高支持 4K（4096*2160）60Hz&nbsp;（最常用）</span></p><p><br/></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Emoji Symbols Font&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;\">1.3 带宽32.4Gbps，最高支持 4K（3840X2160）120hz、5K（5120X2880）60hz、8K（7680X4320）30hz 输出。</span></p><p><br/></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Emoji Symbols Font&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;\">1.4 带宽32.4Gbps，最高支持 8K 级别（7680x4320）的 60Hz 输出，4K 的话则可以上到120Hz。（最新版本）</span></p></section><section data-role=\"paragraph\" style=\"white-space: normal;\"><p><br/></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"http://www.choseal.cn/ueditor/php/upload/image/20210926/1632619887952053.jpg\" title=\"1632619887952053.jpg\" alt=\"O1CN018pZrDJ1n0PiV18jPa_!!398685027.jpg\"/></p><p><br/></p></section><section data-role=\"paragraph\" class=\"\" style=\"white-space: normal;\"><p style=\"text-align: justify; letter-spacing: 1.5px; line-height: 1.75em;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Emoji Symbols Font&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"caret-color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">我们在购买DP线的时候会发现DP线的种类很多，按大小分为<strong><span style=\"letter-spacing: 1px;\">DP接口和苹果开发的mini DP接口</span></strong>，它们之间又有</span><span style=\"max-inline-size: 100%; outline: 0px; cursor: text; caret-color: rgb(255, 0, 0); letter-spacing: 0.544px;\">公对公、公对母之分。</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify; letter-spacing: 1.5px; line-height: 1.75em;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Emoji Symbols Font&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"max-inline-size: 100%; outline: 0px; cursor: text; caret-color: rgb(255, 0, 0); letter-spacing: 0.544px;\"><br/></span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify; letter-spacing: 1.5px; line-height: 1.75em;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Emoji Symbols Font&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"caret-color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">常见的是DP公对公高清线，</span><span style=\"max-inline-size: 100%; cursor: text; caret-color: red; outline: none 0px !important;\">一般用作设备互连用的直连线，也叫视频线，比如电脑输出端接电视输入端；公对母一般用作数据延长线或特殊设备连接线，所以也叫转换线。</span></span></p></section><section data-role=\"paragraph\" style=\"white-space: normal;\"><p><br/></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"http://www.choseal.cn/ueditor/php/upload/image/20210926/1632619909144046.jpg\" title=\"1632619909144046.jpg\" alt=\"O1CN01latyhh1n0PiV19OzU_!!398685027.jpg\"/></p><p><br/></p></section><section data-role=\"paragraph\" class=\"\" style=\"white-space: normal;\"><p style=\"text-align: justify; letter-spacing: 1.5px; line-height: 1.75em;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Emoji Symbols Font&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;\">其实选择正确的DP线并不难，<span style=\"caret-color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">根据自家设备配置情况及自身对游戏、视频输出效果的要求，确认DP线标准即可。如想体验</span><span style=\"caret-color: red;\">8K超清视界，游戏操作如行云流水就选这款<strong>秋叶原1.4版DP高清线</strong>。</span></span></p></section><section data-role=\"paragraph\" class=\"\" style=\"white-space: normal;\"><section style=\"text-align: justify; letter-spacing: 1.5px; line-height: 1.75em;\"><span style=\"outline: 0px; letter-spacing: 1px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Emoji Symbols Font&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;\">精炼铜芯，多层屏蔽抗干扰，高带宽，满足8K@60Hz、4K@144Hz、2K@165Hz多种刷新率，消除画质撕裂，让画面清晰动人，玩游戏制霸全场。</span></section><p style=\"text-align: justify; letter-spacing: 1.5px; line-height: 1.75em;\"><br/></p><p style=\"text-align: justify; letter-spacing: 1.5px; line-height: 1.75em;\"><span style=\"caret-color: red; outline: 0px; letter-spacing: 0.544px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Emoji Symbols Font&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;\">镀金接口具有抗腐蚀、耐拔插、防生锈的效果，<span style=\"outline: 0px; letter-spacing: 0.544px;\">让多次拔插得到有效保护</span>。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify; letter-spacing: 1.5px; line-height: 1.75em;\"><span style=\"caret-color: red; outline: 0px; letter-spacing: 0.544px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Emoji Symbols Font&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;\"><br/></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify; letter-spacing: 1.5px; line-height: 1.75em;\"><span style=\"outline: 0px; letter-spacing: 0.544px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Emoji Symbols Font&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;\">多屏拼接模式、复制模式、拓展模式玩转大屏。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify; letter-spacing: 1.5px; line-height: 1.75em;\"><span style=\"outline: 0px; letter-spacing: 0.544px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Emoji Symbols Font&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;\"><br/></span></p></section><section style=\"white-space: normal;\"><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"http://www.choseal.cn/ueditor/php/upload/image/20210926/1632619935263544.jpg\" title=\"1632619935263544.jpg\" alt=\"微信图片_20210908172801.jpg\"/></p><p><br/></p></section><section data-role=\"paragraph\" style=\"white-space: normal;\"><section data-role=\"paragraph\" class=\"\"><p style=\"letter-spacing: 1.5px; line-height: 1.75em;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Emoji Symbols Font&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;\"><strong style=\"caret-color: red;\">使用DP转接器/转换线注意事项：</strong><br/></span></p><p><br/></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Emoji Symbols Font&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;\">当你要连接的输入设备和输出设备中只有一端是DP接口，那在使用转接器/转换线进行连接时就要注意：</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Emoji Symbols Font&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\"><br/></span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Emoji Symbols Font&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\">DP转HDMI可以实现双向转接，传输画面不会失真；</span><br/></p><p><br/></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Emoji Symbols Font&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;\">DP转DVI是单向转接，DP转DVI产品只能DP向DVI转换，DP端接电脑主机显卡，DVI接显示器，反过来用则没有显示；</span></p><p><br/></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Emoji Symbols Font&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;\">DP转VGA，这两种接口不能直接转接，转接器需要添加芯片，但是一般售卖转接器中都是加了芯片的，所以一般不用担心这个问题。</span></p></section></section></p>', 1, 0, 10, 255, '2021-09-26 09:35:55', '2021-09-26 09:35:55', '2021-09-26 09:35:55', '2023-07-21 13:48:24', '/upload/image/20210926/614fce77d475b.jpeg', 'null', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'PC', 'zh-CN'),
(215, 24, '【分析】如何挑选网络面板', '助人为乐、博爱奉献”--- 秋叶原爱心基金正式成立！', '<section data-role=\"outer\" label=\"Powered by 135editor.com\"><section data-role=\"outer\" label=\"Powered by 135editor.com\" data-mpa-powered-by=\"yiban.io\" class=\"\"><p style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: 1.75em;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Emoji Symbols Font&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 1px;\"><strong><span style=\"caret-color: red; color: rgb(255, 76, 65);\">网络面板</span></strong><span style=\"caret-color: red; color: rgb(63, 63, 63);\">是指应用于工作区布线子系统，<span style=\"text-align: start; text-indent: 28px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">适合多类型模块安装的一类布线产品，</span></span></span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 1px; color: rgb(63, 63, 63);\">它的主要作用是用以固定模块，保护信息出口处的线缆。</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: 1.75em;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Emoji Symbols Font&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(63, 63, 63); letter-spacing: 1px;\"><br/></span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 1px; color: rgb(63, 63, 63);\"></span><span style=\"text-align: start; text-indent: 28px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">网络面板对于布线系统来说，不是主要影响性能的产品部件，</span>但却<span style=\"letter-spacing: 1px; text-align: start; text-indent: 28px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">是仅有的几个外露在墙体</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 1px;\">表面</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 1px; text-align: start; text-indent: 28px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">的产品之一，其性能与美观直接影响着整体布线的效果。</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: 1.75em;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Emoji Symbols Font&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 1px; text-align: start; text-indent: 28px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><br/></span></span></p><section style=\"text-align: center; letter-spacing: 1.5px; line-height: 1.75em;\"><img src=\"http://www.choseal.cn/ueditor/php/upload/image/20210930/1632970374135400.jpg\" title=\"1632970374135400.jpg\" alt=\"微信图片_20210922161335.jpg\"/></section><p style=\"text-align: justify; letter-spacing: 1.5px; line-height: 1.75em;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(63, 63, 63); letter-spacing: 1px; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Emoji Symbols Font&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;\"><br/></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify; letter-spacing: 1.5px; line-height: 1.75em;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(63, 63, 63); letter-spacing: 1px; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Emoji Symbols Font&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;\">如今人们对家的期待延伸到对装修近乎完美的苛刻，要求无差别融入整体装修风格，才能看得舒心，用得舒心，在<span style=\"caret-color: red;\">选择网络面板时对外观和其质量性能都有着高要求。</span></span></p><section style=\"text-align: justify; letter-spacing: 1.5px; line-height: 1.75em;\"><p style=\"caret-color: red; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); letter-spacing: 1px; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;\"><br/></p><p style=\"caret-color: red; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); letter-spacing: 1px; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; text-align: center;\"><img src=\"http://www.choseal.cn/ueditor/php/upload/image/20210930/1632970392681648.jpg\" title=\"1632970392681648.jpg\" alt=\"O1CN011n0PUTttbgnrX5o_!!398685027.jpg\"/></p><p style=\"caret-color: red; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); letter-spacing: 1px; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;\"><br/></p></section><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/P5z9Rt3xHTqiaibN4icJN1iaCR0wB5zW3I7fVk0icicwmJmC3arZBwcVjZXycicS6VaRnRoyheq27icXtDibKYIgOzCdq9A/640?wx_fmt=png\" data-type=\"png\" data-width=\"100%\" data-ratio=\"0.6216216216216216\" data-w=\"37\"/><p><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Emoji Symbols Font&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;\"><strong>那网络面板应该怎么选呢？</strong></span></p><section data-role=\"paragraph\"><section style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\"><br/></section></section><section style=\"text-align: justify; letter-spacing: 1.5px; line-height: 1.75em;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 1px; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Emoji Symbols Font&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;\"><strong><span style=\"caret-color: rgb(255, 0, 0); color: rgb(63, 63, 63); text-shadow: rgb(255, 0, 0) 2px 2px 10px;\">风格：</span></strong></span></section><section style=\"text-align: justify; letter-spacing: 1.5px; line-height: 1.75em;\"><span style=\"caret-color: rgb(255, 0, 0); color: rgb(63, 63, 63); letter-spacing: 1px; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Emoji Symbols Font&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;\">网络面板主要和布线的美观有关，在选择款式和颜色应该与装修风格相符合，如果装修风格整体色调是浅色，可以选择白色、香槟金等浅色的网络面板。</span></section><section style=\"text-align: justify; letter-spacing: 1.5px; line-height: 1.75em;\"><br/></section><section style=\"text-align: justify; letter-spacing: 1.5px; line-height: 1.75em;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 1px; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Emoji Symbols Font&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;\"><strong><span style=\"color: rgb(63, 63, 63); text-shadow: rgb(255, 0, 0) 2px 2px 10px;\">外表：</span></strong></span></section><section style=\"text-align: justify; letter-spacing: 1.5px; line-height: 1.75em;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(63, 63, 63); letter-spacing: 1px; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Emoji Symbols Font&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;\">表面光滑，摸起来没有凹凸不平的感觉，开关拨动的手感轻巧且不紧涩。</span></section><section style=\"text-align: justify; letter-spacing: 1.5px; line-height: 1.75em;\"><br/></section><section style=\"text-align: justify; letter-spacing: 1.5px; line-height: 1.75em;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 1px; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Emoji Symbols Font&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;\"><strong><span style=\"color: rgb(63, 63, 63); text-shadow: rgb(255, 0, 0) 2px 2px 10px;\">性能：</span></strong></span></section><section style=\"text-align: justify; letter-spacing: 1.5px; line-height: 1.75em;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 1px; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Emoji Symbols Font&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;\">在网络面板之下的网络模块是连接网线的核心，可以影响到整个布线系统的性能。选用金属屏蔽模块的网络面板，经过特殊抗氧化处理，耐腐蚀性强，有效抵抗电磁干扰，经久耐用，保证信号传输长效稳定。<br/></span></section><section style=\"text-align: justify; letter-spacing: 1.5px; line-height: 1.75em;\"><br/></section><section style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: 1.75em;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(63, 63, 63); letter-spacing: 1px; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Emoji Symbols Font&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;\"><strong><span style=\"text-shadow: rgb(255, 0, 0) 2px 2px 10px;\">类别：</span></strong></span></section><p style=\"text-align: justify; letter-spacing: 1.5px; line-height: 1.75em;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 1px; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Emoji Symbols Font&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;\">在确定好装修布线方案后要根据网线类别来选择与之对应的网络面板，才能达到其最佳传输性能。</span></p><section style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: 1.75em;\"><br/></section><section class=\"\" style=\"text-align: justify; letter-spacing: 1.5px; line-height: 1.75em;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 1px; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Emoji Symbols Font&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;\"><strong><span style=\"color: rgb(63, 63, 63); text-shadow: rgb(255, 0, 0) 2px 2px 10px;\">品牌：</span></strong><br/></span></section><p style=\"text-align: justify; letter-spacing: 1.5px; line-height: 1.75em;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Emoji Symbols Font&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 1px; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); text-indent: 0em; caret-color: red;\">产品的质量会对家庭的安全问题、设备的正常使用、甚至生活的便利程度造成影响，无论是网线、<span style=\"text-align: left;\">网络面板还是其他产品</span>，都应该选用可靠性高的知名品牌，如</span><span style=\"text-indent: 0em; caret-color: red; letter-spacing: 1px; color: rgb(255, 76, 65);\"><strong>秋叶原</strong></span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 1px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(63, 63, 63); text-indent: 0em; caret-color: red;\">作为传输行业著名品牌，</span><span style=\"caret-color: red; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); text-indent: 0em; outline-style: initial;\">在售后、质量、价格都是值得信赖的。</span></span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify; letter-spacing: 1.5px; line-height: 1.75em;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Emoji Symbols Font&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 1px;\"><span style=\"caret-color: red; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); text-indent: 0em; outline-style: initial;\"><br/></span></span></span></p><section class=\"\" style=\"text-align: center; letter-spacing: 1.5px; line-height: 1.75em;\"></section><section style=\"text-align: justify; letter-spacing: 1.5px; line-height: 1.75em;\"><span style=\"caret-color: red; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); text-indent: 0em; outline-style: initial; text-align: left; letter-spacing: 1px; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Emoji Symbols Font&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;\">以上就是选择网络面板应该注意的地方，同时，<span style=\"text-indent: 0em; outline-style: initial;\">网络面板</span>的位置和数量对于室内装修的便捷性和美观性起着重要的作用，大家购买之前一定要根据网点和家具的<span style=\"text-indent: 0em; outline-style: initial;\">位置</span>规划来确认进行。</span></section></section></section><p><br/></p>', 1, 0, 10, 255, '2021-09-30 10:54:44', '2021-09-30 10:54:44', '2021-09-30 10:54:44', '2023-07-21 13:48:24', '/upload/image/20210930/615526f047419.jpeg', 'null', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'PC', 'zh-CN'),
(217, 24, '【分析】怎样延长HDMI传输距离', '助人为乐、博爱奉献”--- 秋叶原爱心基金正式成立！', '<section data-role=\"outer\" label=\"Powered by 135editor.com\" data-mpa-powered-by=\"yiban.io\" class=\"\"><p style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: 1.75em; letter-spacing: 1.5px;\"><span style=\"caret-color: red; letter-spacing: 0.544px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\">HDMI作为当前最主流的音视频接口，势头如日中天，但<span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.544px;\">一</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.544px;\">般的HDMI线</span>传输距离在30米以内，而在实际部署中，受场地布局及设备体积影响，经常会出现用线距离超出30米的情况，那怎样延长HDMI的传输距离呢？</span><br/></p><section data-role=\"paragraph\"><p><br/></p></section><p><strong data-original-title=\"\" title=\"\">1.</strong><strong style=\"caret-color: red;\">HDMI 延长器</strong></p><p><br/></p><section data-role=\"paragraph\" class=\"\"><p style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: 1.75em; letter-spacing: 1.5px;\"><span style=\"text-indent: 28px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\">HDMI延长器是用来延长信号的器件，具有<span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.544px;\">一个发射端，一个接收端，</span><span style=\"caret-color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">通常用于长距离直连线材无法满足传输要求的情况，一般是为了确保信号长距离无衰减的传输而设计，因此多是有源的。</span></span></p></section><section data-role=\"paragraph\" class=\"\"><p><br/></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"http://www.choseal.cn/ueditor/php/upload/image/20211013/1634089866455593.jpg\" title=\"1634089866455593.jpg\" alt=\"O1CN01Y0YvEU1n0Pc1pM9YE_!!398685027 (1).jpg\"/></p><p><br/></p></section><section data-role=\"paragraph\" class=\"\"><p style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: 1.75em; letter-spacing: 1.5px;\"><span style=\"outline: 0px; letter-spacing: 0.544px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\">HDMI延长器发射端与接收端之间采用【网线、无线、电力、网桥、同轴、光纤】等传输介质进行连接。<span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.544px;\">目前用途最广的一种是</span><strong style=\"letter-spacing: 0.544px; white-space: normal;\"><span style=\"outline: 0px; letter-spacing: 0.544px; background-color: rgb(255, 0, 0); color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">&nbsp;HDMI网线延长器&nbsp;</span></strong><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.544px;\">，在</span><span style=\"max-inline-size: 100%; cursor: text; text-indent: 28px; caret-color: rgb(255, 0, 0); letter-spacing: 1px;\">发射端与接收端中间使用Cat6/Cat6A网线连接延伸，</span><span style=\"max-inline-size: 100%; outline: 0px; cursor: text; text-indent: 28px; caret-color: red; letter-spacing: 1px;\">确保信号长距离无衰减传输</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 1.5px; text-indent: 28px; caret-color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">。</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: 1.75em; letter-spacing: 1.5px;\"><br/></p><p style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: 1.75em; letter-spacing: 1.5px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); outline: 0px; letter-spacing: 0.544px; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\">常见的</span><strong><span style=\"outline: 0px; letter-spacing: 0.544px; background-color: rgb(255, 76, 65); font-size: 14px; color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\">&nbsp;<strong style=\"letter-spacing: 1.5px; white-space: normal;\"><span style=\"outline: 0px; letter-spacing: 0.544px;\">秋</span></strong>叶原HDMI网线延长器&nbsp;</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); outline: 0px; letter-spacing: 0.544px; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\">有60米、120米、150米<span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.544px; caret-color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">的</span>规格，<span style=\"letter-spacing: 1px; caret-color: rgb(255, 0, 0); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">在成本上与HDMI线材对比价格更低，是长距离传输中经济实惠之选。且容错成本低，整条传输线路中单独一个配件损坏都可以更新替换使用。</span></span><span style=\"color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: 0.544px; caret-color: red; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"></span></p></section><section data-role=\"paragraph\"><p><br/></p></section><p><strong data-original-title=\"\" title=\"\">2.</strong><strong style=\"caret-color: red;\">HDMI 光纤线&nbsp;</strong></p><p><br/></p><section data-role=\"paragraph\" class=\"\"><p style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: 1.75em; letter-spacing: 1.5px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 1px;\">HDMI光纤线堪称长距离传输的未来，它</span>以光纤作为传输介质，<span style=\"letter-spacing: 1px;\">不受外部电磁干扰，</span><span style=\"outline: 0px; letter-spacing: 1px; caret-color: red;\">信号传输衰减几乎为零，可以轻松做到百米级的超长距离传输。</span></span><span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); outline: 0px; letter-spacing: 1px; caret-color: red; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: 1.75em; letter-spacing: 1.5px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"outline: 0px; letter-spacing: 1px; caret-color: red;\"><br/></span></span></p></section><section data-role=\"paragraph\" class=\"\"><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"http://www.choseal.cn/ueditor/php/upload/image/20211013/1634089807104719.jpg\" title=\"1634089807104719.jpg\" alt=\"微信图片_20211012135817.jpg\"/></p></section><section data-role=\"paragraph\" class=\"\"><p style=\"text-align: justify; outline: 0px; line-height: 1.75em; letter-spacing: 1.5px; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"outline: 0px; letter-spacing: 1px; caret-color: red;\"><br/></span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify; outline: 0px; line-height: 1.75em; letter-spacing: 1.5px; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"outline: 0px; letter-spacing: 1px; caret-color: red;\">秋叶原</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 1.5px; color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><strong><span style=\"outline: 0px; letter-spacing: 1px; caret-color: red; background-color: rgb(255, 76, 65);\">&nbsp;第三代光纤复合HDMI高清线&nbsp;</span></strong></span></span><span style=\"font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: 1.5px; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"outline: 0px; letter-spacing: 1px; caret-color: red;\">,开创</span></span><span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"outline: 0px; letter-spacing: 1px; caret-color: red;\">150米超长光电智慧，领衔新标杆！但它</span>不同于铜线HDMI两端可以任意连接，光纤HDMI线是有方向性的，发射端（source）和接收端（display）不能弄反，在布线的时候一定要注意。</span></p></section><section data-role=\"paragraph\" class=\"\"><p><br/></p></section><p><strong data-original-title=\"\" title=\"\">3.</strong><strong style=\"caret-color: red;\">HDMI 延长线&nbsp;</strong></p><p><br/></p><section data-role=\"paragraph\" class=\"\"><p style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: 1.75em; letter-spacing: 1.5px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\">短线加长，不受“线”制。HDMI公对母延长线可以用来延长传输距离，另外，针对居家壁挂电视机及带有HDMI接口的台式机插拔不方便的问题，可以将HDMI母口延伸出来，使用更加简单方便！</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: 1.75em; letter-spacing: 1.5px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"><br/></span></p></section><section data-role=\"paragraph\" class=\"\"><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"http://www.choseal.cn/ueditor/php/upload/image/20211013/1634089823894270.jpg\" title=\"1634089823894270.jpg\" alt=\"TB2_nImAf9TBuNjy1zbXXXpepXa_!!398685027.jpg\"/></p></section><section data-role=\"paragraph\" class=\"\"><p style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: 1.75em; letter-spacing: 1.5px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: rgb(63, 63, 63);\"><br/></span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: 1.75em; letter-spacing: 1.5px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: rgb(63, 63, 63);\">以上就是延长HDMI传输距离的3种方法，</span><span style=\"font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: 0.544px; caret-color: red;\">大家可以根据设备和自身需求制定合理的方案<span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.544px;\">来选</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.544px;\">择</span>产品</span><span style=\"color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-size: 14px; caret-color: red;\">哦~</span></span></p></section></section>', 1, 0, 10, 255, '2021-10-13 09:53:38', '2021-10-13 09:53:38', '2021-10-13 09:53:38', '2023-07-21 13:48:24', '/upload/image/20211013/61663c1954022.jpeg', 'null', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'PC', 'zh-CN'),
(219, 24, '【新品首发】秋叶原新型石墨烯屏蔽HDMI线即将震撼来袭', '助人为乐、博爱奉献”--- 秋叶原爱心基金正式成立！', '<p data-track=\"1\" data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\">随着科技和互联网的发展，大量的电子设备在工作时会产生大量不同波长、不同频率的电磁波，造成干扰，这对设备自身和信号传输线材的电磁屏蔽材料提出了更高的要求。</p><p data-track=\"1\" data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\"><br/></p><p data-track=\"2\">而HDMI作为当前最主流的音视频数字接口，其线材的优劣会直接影响信号的传输效果，因此，HDMI高清线的电磁屏蔽材料至关重要。</p><p data-track=\"2\"><br/></p><p data-track=\"2\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"/ueditor/php/upload/image/20211020/1634692790580483.jpg\" title=\"1634692790580483.jpg\" alt=\"微信图片_202110191731592.jpg\"/></p><p data-track=\"2\"><br/></p><p data-track=\"3\">作为高性能音视频线材和配件的著名品牌，<strong>秋叶原</strong>为了能够把HDMI线的音频和视频传输性能提升到另一个新高度，在线材的设计上会不断地进行细节上的改良，敢为行业先，特别采用<strong>新材料之王石墨烯</strong>加码HDMI技术研发生产了<strong>新型石墨烯屏蔽HDMI线</strong>。</p><p data-track=\"3\"><br/></p><p data-track=\"3\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"/ueditor/php/upload/image/20211020/1634692832164584.jpg\" title=\"1634692832164584.jpg\" alt=\"640.webp (1).jpg\"/></p><p data-track=\"4\"><br/></p><p data-track=\"4\">（如图）线材外护套内壁那层薄薄黑色就是石墨烯屏蔽层，虽然很薄，但是能达到优于传统金属编织的屏蔽效果，而且因为石墨烯的自身特性线身可以做的更细，更软，提高线材的弯曲性能和柔韧性，从而延长HDMI线的使用寿命。</p><p data-track=\"4\"><br/></p><p data-track=\"5\"><strong>什么是石墨烯</strong></p><p data-track=\"5\"><strong><br/></strong></p><p data-track=\"6\">石墨烯是作为一种具有颠覆性、革命性的新材料，是一种碳六元环组成的蜂窝状二维纳米材料，sp²杂化碳原子贡献的可自由移动的电子赋予了石墨烯优异的导电性和导热性，能有效降低材料密度并增强电磁屏蔽性能，在电磁屏蔽领域拥有广泛的应用价值。</p><p data-track=\"6\"><br/></p><p data-track=\"6\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"/ueditor/php/upload/image/20211020/1634692854653297.png\" title=\"1634692854653297.png\" alt=\"t01f09d21b6b0e159c9.png\"/></p><p data-track=\"6\"><br/></p><p data-track=\"7\">单片48.3μm 的蜂窝状多孔石墨烯材料，在10 GHz时的电磁屏蔽性能大约是40dB，此时它能屏蔽 99.99% 的入射电磁波；<strong>当把该材料堆叠到 6 层后，电磁屏蔽性能可达80dB，并能衰减 99.999999% 的入射电磁波。</strong></p><p data-track=\"8\">其优异的光学、电学、力学特性，在材料学、微纳加工、能源、生物医学和药物传递等方面具有重要的应用前景，被认为是一种未来革命性的材料。</p><p data-track=\"9\"><strong><br/></strong></p><p data-track=\"9\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong><img src=\"/ueditor/php/upload/image/20211020/1634692872844319.jpg\" title=\"1634692872844319.jpg\" alt=\"微信图片_20211019173159.jpg\"/></strong></p><p data-track=\"9\"><strong><br/></strong></p><p data-track=\"9\"><strong>新型石墨烯屏蔽HDMI线产品特点</strong></p><p data-track=\"10\">1、带宽扩充到了18Gbps，支持即插即用和热插拔，支持3840×2160分辨率。</p><p data-track=\"11\">2、在音频方面支持最多32个声道，以及最高1536kHz采样率。</p><p data-track=\"12\">3、对HDR格式传输的支持，能够显著增强图像质量。</p><p data-track=\"13\">4、采用新型石墨烯屏蔽材料替代传统编织加铝箔屏蔽降低人工成本的同时屏蔽性能更佳。</p><p data-track=\"14\">5、采用新型石墨烯屏蔽材料的产品相较传统编织加铝箔屏蔽，线身更柔软，手感更佳。</p><p data-track=\"15\">6、石墨烯屏蔽材料生产的线材比编织生产的线材在高频800MHz时EMI余量更大，差距明显（如图）。</p><p data-track=\"15\"><br/></p><p data-track=\"15\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"/ueditor/php/upload/image/20211020/1634692923592389.jpg\" title=\"1634692923592389.jpg\" alt=\"640.webp (2).jpg\"/></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\" data-track=\"16\"><strong>秋叶原新型石墨烯屏蔽材料样品测试</strong></p><p data-track=\"16\"><strong><br/></strong></p><p data-track=\"16\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong><img src=\"/ueditor/php/upload/image/20211020/1634692933533449.jpg\" title=\"1634692933533449.jpg\" alt=\"6401.webp.jpg\"/></strong></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\" data-track=\"17\"><strong>秋叶原传统屏蔽材料样品测试</strong></p><p data-track=\"17\"><strong><br/></strong></p><p data-track=\"18\">经过进一步的研发，不断提高技术壁垒，新型石墨烯屏蔽HDMI线相比传统的HDMI线均有显著的优势，不断带给人们新的惊喜，而且线材可以做的更细，更软，有着广阔的前景。</p><p data-track=\"18\"><br/></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\" data-track=\"19\"><strong>秋叶原新型石墨烯屏蔽HDMI线即将震撼上市</strong></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\" data-track=\"20\"><strong>敬请期待！</strong></p><p data-track=\"20\"><strong><br/></strong></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"/ueditor/php/upload/image/20211020/1634692947462567.jpg\" title=\"1634692947462567.jpg\" alt=\"微信图片_202110191731591.jpg\"/></p><p><br/></p>', 1, 0, 10, 255, '2021-10-20 09:23:40', '2021-10-20 09:23:40', '2021-10-20 09:23:40', '2023-07-21 13:48:24', '/upload/image/20211020/616f6f9842d69.jpeg', 'null', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'PC', 'zh-CN');
INSERT INTO `news` (`id`, `news_cate_id`, `title`, `short_title`, `content`, `admin_id`, `count`, `is_show`, `sort`, `start_time`, `end_time`, `create_at`, `update_at`, `pic`, `pics`, `seo_title`, `seo_keyword`, `seo_description`, `platform`, `lang`) VALUES
(220, 24, '【企业荣誉】秋叶原入选“2021深圳500强企业榜单”！', '助人为乐、博爱奉献”--- 秋叶原爱心基金正式成立！', '<section data-role=\"outer\" label=\"Powered by 135editor.com\"><section data-mpa-powered-by=\"yiban.io\"><section style=\"font-size: 15px;line-height: 2;\" powered-by=\"135编辑器\" class=\"_135editor\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\"></p><p style=\"text-align:justify;white-space: normal;letter-spacing: 1.5px;line-height: 1.75em;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; caret-color: red; letter-spacing: 1.5px;\">10月29日，由深圳市企业联合会、深圳市企业家协会举办的“奋进双区建设 勇当质量先锋”——2021深圳500强企业榜单发布暨第四届“深圳百名行业领军人物”颁奖盛典在在深圳落下帷幕。</span><span style=\"color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-size: 14px; caret-color: red; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; letter-spacing: 1px; font-family: 微软雅黑; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">中国企联常务副会长兼理事长朱宏任，深圳市委常委、市政府常务副市长黄敏，深圳市委原书记厉有为，深圳市政协原副主席许扬，深圳市政协原副主席、深圳企联荣誉功勋会长吴井田<span style=\"caret-color: red; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%;\">等</span><span style=\"caret-color: red; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%;\"><span style=\"caret-color: red; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">常务副会长单位企业家、世界</span>500强、中国500强、深圳500强企业代表、百名行业领军人物、新闻界朋友近600人齐聚一堂、共话发展。</span></span><br/></p><p style=\"text-align:justify;white-space: normal;letter-spacing: 1.5px;line-height: 1.75em;\"><br/></p><p style=\"text-align:justify;white-space: normal;letter-spacing: 1.5px;line-height: 1.75em;\"><span style=\"caret-color: red; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-size: 14px; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"caret-color: red; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; letter-spacing: 1px; font-family: 微软雅黑; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><span style=\"caret-color: red; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%;\"><img src=\"/ueditor/php/upload/image/20211101/1635732498496844.jpg\" title=\"1635732498496844.jpg\" alt=\"微信图片_20211029154039.jpg\"/></span></span></span></p><section data-role=\"title\" data-tools=\"135编辑器\" data-id=\"106219\" class=\"_135editor\"><section style=\"text-align: center;margin: 10px auto;\"><section style=\"display: inline-block;\"><section style=\"background-image: url(&quot;https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/P5z9Rt3xHTrY3G2SEzqYOBBY4XDMCeogVZto4MpxWwz16Pkg0d6WVxTnsLSrB6J83TC5mEm1ZibhxE16azz8KZA/640?wx_fmt=png&quot;);background-position: center center;background-repeat: no-repeat;background-attachment: initial;background-origin: initial;background-clip: initial;background-size: 110px 50px;padding: 27px 18px 19px 38px;\"><section data-brushtype=\"text\" style=\"font-size: 16px;letter-spacing: 1.5px;color: #8abbfd;\" hm_fix=\"345:299\"><span style=\"color: #FF4C41;\"><strong>第96名的荣誉</strong></span></section></section></section></section></section><p style=\"text-align:justify;white-space: normal;letter-spacing: 1.5px;line-height: 1.75em;\"><span style=\"caret-color: red; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-size: 14px; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"caret-color: red; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; letter-spacing: 1px; font-family: 微软雅黑; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><span style=\"caret-color: red; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%;\">本次活动重磅发布2021深圳500强企业榜单和《2021深圳500强企业发展报告》，<span style=\"letter-spacing: 1.5px; caret-color: red; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"caret-color: red;color: #FF0000;\">深圳市秋叶原实业有限公司与中国平安、腾讯、华为、顺丰、比亚迪等企业一齐入选“2021深圳500强企业榜单”</span></span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 1.5px; outline: 0px; caret-color: red; color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;\">，<strong>深圳市秋叶原实业有限公司获得96名！</strong></span><span style=\"caret-color: red; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"></span></span></span></span></p></section><section data-role=\"paragraph\"><p><br/></p></section><section data-role=\"paragraph\"><p><img src=\"/ueditor/php/upload/image/20211101/1635732490428804.jpg\" title=\"1635732490428804.jpg\" alt=\"微信图片_20211029155140.jpg\"/></p></section><section data-role=\"paragraph\" class=\"\"><p style=\"text-align:justify; outline: 0px; font-size: 17px; letter-spacing: 0.544px; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Arial, sans-serif;\"><br/></p><p style=\"text-align:justify; outline: 0px; font-size: 17px; letter-spacing: 0.544px; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: 1.5px; max-inline-size: 100%; cursor: text; caret-color: rgb(255, 0, 0); outline: none 0px !important; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;\">“2021深圳500强企业名单”由深圳市企业联合会、深圳市企业家协会根据国际通行规则整理发布。</span><span style=\"color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: 1.5px; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;\">榜单以参选企业的各项生产经营指标为主要依据，全面、系统、真实地反映了在过去一年全市企业发展的现状、取得的成就和未来发展趋势，是目前对深圳企业具有较高影响力的权威性评选榜单。</span></p><p style=\"text-align:justify; outline: 0px; font-size: 17px; letter-spacing: 0.544px; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Arial, sans-serif;\"><br/></p><section data-id=\"98767\" class=\"_135editor\"><section style=\"margin:10px auto;\"><section style=\"background-image: url(&quot;https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/UH19PdPjIicsKWpSlR7rOV0o28ZeD5xBkBB2zg6aJYicBoRUCxGaiaelibP6BpqNnq797KZDTuVCCwicahkc5B0ib81A/640?wx_fmt=gif&quot;);background-size: cover;background-repeat: no-repeat;background-position: center top;padding: 3px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"background-color: #ffffff;padding: 1em;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"line-height: 1.75em;letter-spacing: 1.5px;font-size: 14px;\"><section data-autoskip=\"1\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\"><section data-role=\"title\" data-tools=\"135编辑器\" data-id=\"106349\" class=\"_135editor\"><section style=\"text-align: center;margin: 10px auto;\"><section style=\"display:flex;align-items: center;\"><section style=\"display: inline-block;margin-right: 10px;\"><section style=\"background-color: #f84541;padding: 5px 15px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section data-brushtype=\"text\" style=\"font-size: 16px;color: #ffffff;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>集团公司</strong></span></section></section></section><section style=\"flex: 1;\"><section data-brushtype=\"text\" style=\"font-size: 12px;color: #f84541;text-align: left;margin-left: 5px;\"><br/></section><section style=\"box-sizing:border-box;width: 100%;height: 1px;background-color: #f96a67;margin-top: 3px;overflow: hidden;\" data-width=\"100%\"><br/></section></section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align: justify;text-indent: 0em;line-height: 1.5em;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(63, 63, 63); letter-spacing: 2px; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\">广东前海秋叶原集团是一家以线缆生态链、产业园投资运营与互联网+布局，集研发、生产、销售及园区运营服务于一体的<span style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">国家级高新技术企业集团，</span>“Choseal秋叶原”是中国驰名商标，主营智能工程线缆、高品质影音线缆、IT数码周边配套智能连接产品，为“现代品味生活、智能家居以及智慧城市”用户提供工程项目系统集成解决方案以及上下游产品供应服务。</span><span style=\"color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"></span></section><p style=\"text-align:justify;text-indent: 0em;line-height: 1.5em;\"><br/></p><p style=\"text-align:justify;text-indent: 0em;line-height: 1.5em;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\">旗下前海中融国际投资控股集团专业进行产业园投资、运营管理及服务于实体经济的平台打造，运营 “梦科园”系列新兴产业园及产业综合体项目。</span></p><p style=\"text-align:justify;text-indent: 0em;line-height: 1.5em;\"><br/></p><p style=\"text-align:justify;text-indent: 0em;line-height: 1.5em;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(63, 63, 63); text-indent: 0em; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\">秋叶原始终凭借优质的产品与服务，完善的管理体系，坚持“以科技和服务创造美好生活”和“塑造秋叶原百年品牌”的发展理念，让企业得到了长足的发展，在未来，秋叶原将不断努力耕耘，向全世界展现秋叶原集团的成长风采。</span><span style=\"color: rgb(63, 63, 63); text-indent: 0em; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section data-role=\"paragraph\"><p><br/></p></section><p style=\"text-align:justify; outline: 0px; font-size: 17px; letter-spacing: 1.5px; line-height: 1.5em; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 1.5px;\">深圳，作为中国改革开放的前沿阵地，“深圳500强企业”榜单的发布，对深圳全面建设粤港澳大湾区和中国特色社会主义先行示范区有着极强的示范效应和积极影响。<span style=\"letter-spacing: 1.5px;\">此次入选“2021深圳500强企业”，是深圳市委市政</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 1.5px;\">府及社会各界对秋叶原</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.544px; text-indent: 34px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">积极开拓创新、砥砺奋进的重要见证和高度认可</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 1.5px;\">。</span></span></span></p><p style=\"text-align:justify; outline: 0px; font-size: 17px; letter-spacing: 1.5px; line-height: 1.5em; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Arial, sans-serif;\"><br/></p><p style=\"text-align:justify; outline: 0px; font-size: 17px; letter-spacing: 0.544px; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Arial, sans-serif;\"><img src=\"/ueditor/php/upload/image/20211101/1635732464667441.jpg\" title=\"1635732464667441.jpg\" alt=\"微信图片_20211029155118.jpg\"/></p><p style=\"text-align:justify; outline: 0px; font-size: 17px; letter-spacing: 1.5px; line-height: 1.5em; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Arial, sans-serif;\"><br/></p><p style=\"text-align:justify; outline: 0px; font-size: 17px; letter-spacing: 1.5px; line-height: 1.5em; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-size: 14px; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;\">在新的历史时期，秋叶原将<span style=\"outline: 0px; font-size: 14.6667px; letter-spacing: 0.533333px; text-indent: 34px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;;\">继续秉承</span><span style=\"font-size: 14.6667px; letter-spacing: 0.533333px; text-indent: 34px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;;\">“以科技和服务创造美好生活”的企业使命，</span>不断开拓创新，锐意进取，进一步提升核心竞争力，勇当科技排头兵，积极投身于粤港澳大湾区建设和深圳先行示范区建设的热潮中，为推进深圳经济发展作出更大贡献。</span></p></section></section></section>', 1, 0, 10, 255, '2021-11-01 10:08:55', '2021-11-01 10:08:55', '2021-11-01 10:08:55', '2023-07-21 13:48:24', '/upload/image/20211101/617f4c33942f5.jpeg', 'null', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'PC', 'zh-CN'),
(222, 24, '【分析】线材光纤化有什么优势', '助人为乐、博爱奉献”--- 秋叶原爱心基金正式成立！', '<section data-role=\"paragraph\" class=\"\" style=\"white-space: normal;\"><p style=\"text-align: justify; vertical-align: inherit; letter-spacing: 1.5px; line-height: 1.75em;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 1px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-size: 14px; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\">随着8K/4K影音应用与数码相机、摄影机相继挑战超高分辨率记录功能，对于现有的传输接口性能要求也越来越高，</span><span style=\"color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-size: 14px; caret-color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\">高速传输接口承载的资料传输量持续挑战铜缆线材的物理极限。</span><br/></span></p><section data-role=\"paragraph\" class=\"\"><p style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><br/></p></section><section data-role=\"paragraph\" class=\"\"><p style=\"text-align: justify; vertical-align: inherit; letter-spacing: 1.5px; line-height: 1.75em;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 1px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"caret-color: red;\">因此影音产品对于由8K/4K UHDTV带起的高速传输接口集成风潮，如HDMI/DP等，</span>虽在传输效能获得跃进式地大幅改善，</span><span style=\"color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-size: 14px; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\">但在长距离布设应用状况下，常用的</span><span style=\"color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-size: 14px; max-inline-size: 100%; cursor: text; caret-color: red; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; outline: none 0px !important;\">铜芯特性并不利于长距离高速传送！</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify; vertical-align: inherit; letter-spacing: 1.5px; line-height: 1.75em;\"><br/></p><p style=\"text-align: justify; vertical-align: inherit; letter-spacing: 1.5px; line-height: 1.75em;\"><img src=\"http://www.choseal.cn/ueditor/php/upload/image/20211108/1636335218576936.jpg\" title=\"1636335218576936.jpg\" alt=\"O1CN01dMrSkz1n0Pb52bJZi_!!398685027.jpg\"/></p><p style=\"text-align: justify; vertical-align: inherit; letter-spacing: 1.5px; line-height: 1.75em;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-size: 14px; caret-color: red; letter-spacing: 1px; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"><br/></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify; vertical-align: inherit; letter-spacing: 1.5px; line-height: 1.75em;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-size: 14px; caret-color: red; letter-spacing: 1px; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\">铜缆传输速度与信号的辨识度都会因为距离拉长而受影响，如果搭配中继器等设备改善信号质量，会使传输成本暴增，同时对接口传输质量与稳定性也会造成影响！因此，<span style=\"caret-color: red; text-align: left;\">要求兼具传输距离与传输性能，AOC线材解决方案才能满足应用需求。</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify; vertical-align: inherit; letter-spacing: 1.5px; line-height: 1.75em;\"><br/></p></section></section><p><section data-role=\"paragraph\" style=\"white-space: normal;\"><p style=\"text-align: justify; vertical-align: inherit; outline: 0px; letter-spacing: 1.5px; line-height: 1.75em; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 1px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-size: 14px; outline: 0px; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\">秋叶原作为影音连接线行业领军企业，下设秋叶原线缆研究院特研发出以光纤为传输介质，完美化解困扰业界远距离高速传输问题，实现</span><span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: rgb(255, 76, 65); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"><strong style=\"outline: 0px;\"><span style=\"outline: 0px;\">百米级以上</span></strong></span><span style=\"color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-size: 14px; outline: 0px; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"outline: 0px;\">超长距离传输视频信号的</span><span style=\"outline: 0px;\">秋叶原新一代光纤系列产品隆重面市，一起来看看吧！</span></span></span></p></section><section data-role=\"paragraph\" class=\"\" style=\"white-space: normal;\"><p style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><br/></p></section></p><p style=\"white-space: normal; vertical-align: inherit;\"><strong>第三代光纤复合HDMI高清线</strong></p><p><section data-role=\"paragraph\" class=\"\" style=\"white-space: normal;\"><p style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><br/></p></section><section data-role=\"paragraph\" class=\"\" style=\"white-space: normal; height: 0px; overflow: hidden;\"></section><section data-role=\"paragraph\" style=\"white-space: normal;\"><p style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><img src=\"http://www.choseal.cn/ueditor/php/upload/image/20211108/1636335189237358.jpg\" title=\"1636335189237358.jpg\" alt=\"微信图片_20211014160757.jpg\"/></p></section><section data-role=\"paragraph\" style=\"white-space: normal;\"><p style=\"text-align: justify; vertical-align: inherit; letter-spacing: 1.5px; line-height: 1.75em;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: 1px; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"><br/></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify; vertical-align: inherit; letter-spacing: 1.5px; line-height: 1.75em;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: 1px; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\">具有18Gbps的传输带宽，支持真4K、给你震撼3D视效，<span style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Arial, sans-serif;\">画面显示时能做到色彩自然，明亮鲜明，细节层次感清晰，<span style=\"color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\">实现150米近乎0衰减，</span></span>打破超长距离信号传输衰减束缚。匠心呈现，“光”耀未来！</span></p></section><section data-role=\"paragraph\" style=\"white-space: normal;\"><p style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><br/></p></section></p><p style=\"white-space: normal; vertical-align: inherit;\"><strong>蓝光系列光纤DP高清线</strong></p><p><section data-role=\"paragraph\" style=\"white-space: normal;\"><p style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><br/></p></section><section data-role=\"paragraph\" style=\"white-space: normal; height: 0px; overflow: hidden;\"></section><section data-role=\"paragraph\" style=\"white-space: normal;\"><p style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><img src=\"http://www.choseal.cn/ueditor/php/upload/image/20211108/1636335169313439.jpg\" title=\"1636335169313439.jpg\" alt=\"微信图片_20211019165646.jpg\"/></p></section><section data-role=\"paragraph\" style=\"white-space: normal;\"><p style=\"text-align: justify; vertical-align: inherit; letter-spacing: 1.5px; line-height: 1.75em;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: 1px; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"><br/></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify; vertical-align: inherit; letter-spacing: 1.5px; line-height: 1.75em;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: 1px; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\">光电DP1.4 模组/AOC 产品采用光纤传输高速音视频信号，电子线传输低速控制信号，线材整体轻便，产品抗电磁干扰好，产品符合 DP1.4 协议规范，满足 8K 高清连接需求,传输距离最高可达150米无损耗传输。</span></p></section><section data-role=\"paragraph\" style=\"white-space: normal;\"><p style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><br/></p></section></p><p style=\"white-space: normal; vertical-align: inherit;\"><strong>蓝光系列光纤DVI高清线</strong></p><p><section data-role=\"paragraph\" style=\"white-space: normal;\"><p style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><br/></p></section><section data-role=\"paragraph\" class=\"\" style=\"white-space: normal; height: 0px; overflow: hidden;\"></section><section data-role=\"paragraph\" style=\"white-space: normal;\"><p style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><img src=\"http://www.choseal.cn/ueditor/php/upload/image/20211108/1636335137916469.jpg\" title=\"1636335137916469.jpg\" alt=\"微信图片_202106181046314.jpg\"/></p></section><section data-role=\"paragraph\" class=\"\" style=\"white-space: normal;\"><p style=\"text-align: justify; vertical-align: inherit; letter-spacing: 1.5px; line-height: 1.75em;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); letter-spacing: 1px; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"><br/></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify; vertical-align: inherit; letter-spacing: 1.5px; line-height: 1.75em;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); letter-spacing: 1px; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\">光电DVI模组/AOC解决传统铜缆在DVI信号传输过程中信号衰减兼容性等问题，支持1080P，传输距离最高可达200米无损耗传输，高速信号通过4条多模光纤进行传输，具有良好的抗干扰性能，线材整体轻便，支持热插拔，低功耗，无需外部电源驱动。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify; vertical-align: inherit; letter-spacing: 1.5px; line-height: 1.75em;\"><br/></p></section><section data-role=\"paragraph\" class=\"\" style=\"white-space: normal;\"><section data-role=\"paragraph\"><p style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><strong>蓝光系列光纤HDMI-DVI转换线</strong></p></section><section data-role=\"paragraph\" class=\"\"><br/></section><section data-role=\"paragraph\" class=\"\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 1px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); outline: 0px; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\">同时，秋叶原线缆研究院还攻破了200米超长距离</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 1px; outline: 0px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(255, 76, 65); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"><strong style=\"outline: 0px;\">光纤</strong><strong style=\"outline: 0px;\">HDMI-DVI<strong style=\"outline: 0px;\">、</strong><strong style=\"outline: 0px;\"><strong style=\"outline: 0px;\">DVI-HDMI</strong></strong>转换线</strong></span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 1px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); outline: 0px; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\">，可切实实现多接口不同使用需求，真正摆脱传输接口的限制。</span></section><section data-role=\"paragraph\" class=\"\"><br/></section><section data-role=\"paragraph\" class=\"\"><span style=\"color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: 1px; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"></span></section></section><section data-role=\"paragraph\" class=\"\" style=\"white-space: normal;\"><img src=\"http://www.choseal.cn/ueditor/php/upload/image/20211108/1636335089450287.jpg\" title=\"1636335089450287.jpg\" alt=\"HDMI.jpg\"/></section></p><p style=\"white-space: normal; vertical-align: inherit;\"><strong><br/></strong></p><p style=\"white-space: normal; vertical-align: inherit;\"><strong>蓝光系列光纤DVI-HDMI转换线</strong></p><p><section data-role=\"paragraph\" class=\"\" style=\"white-space: normal;\"><p style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><br/></p></section><section data-role=\"paragraph\" class=\"\" style=\"white-space: normal;\"><p style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><img src=\"http://www.choseal.cn/ueditor/php/upload/image/20211108/1636335050823970.jpg\" title=\"1636335050823970.jpg\" alt=\"dvi.jpg\"/></p></section><section data-role=\"paragraph\" class=\"\" style=\"white-space: normal;\"><p style=\"text-align: justify; vertical-align: inherit; letter-spacing: 1.5px; line-height: 1.75em;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); letter-spacing: 1px; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"outline: 0px; color: rgb(255, 76, 65);\"><strong style=\"outline: 0px;\"><br/></strong></span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify; vertical-align: inherit; letter-spacing: 1.5px; line-height: 1.75em;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); letter-spacing: 1px; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"outline: 0px; color: rgb(255, 76, 65);\"><strong style=\"outline: 0px;\">光纤</strong><strong style=\"outline: 0px;\">HDMI-DVI<strong style=\"outline: 0px;\">、</strong><strong style=\"outline: 0px;\"><strong style=\"outline: 0px;\">DVI-HDMI</strong></strong>转换线</strong></span>，支持1080P视频格式并向下兼容1080i/720P，最高传输速率1.65Gbps.传输距离最高可达200米无损耗传输，高速信号通过4条多模光纤进行传输，具有良好的抗干扰性能，线材整体轻便，低功耗，无需外部电源驱动。</span></p></section><section data-role=\"paragraph\" class=\"\" style=\"white-space: normal;\"><p style=\"text-align: justify; vertical-align: inherit; letter-spacing: 1.5px; line-height: 1.75em;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(63, 63, 63); letter-spacing: 1px; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"outline: 0px; font-size: 14px;\">光纤与铜是两种常见的传输介质，两者都具备抗干扰性和良好的保密性，但对比之下，</span><span style=\"outline: 0px; font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: 0.1px;\">光纤具有传输速率高、传输距离长、能耗低、使用方便等诸多优点，对于传输线缆光纤化需求也在逐渐增强。</span></span></p></section></p>', 1, 0, 10, 255, '2021-11-08 09:51:35', '2021-11-08 09:51:35', '2021-11-08 09:51:35', '2023-07-21 13:48:24', '/upload/image/20211108/6188829786a03.jpeg', 'null', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'PC', 'zh-CN');
INSERT INTO `news` (`id`, `news_cate_id`, `title`, `short_title`, `content`, `admin_id`, `count`, `is_show`, `sort`, `start_time`, `end_time`, `create_at`, `update_at`, `pic`, `pics`, `seo_title`, `seo_keyword`, `seo_description`, `platform`, `lang`) VALUES
(223, 24, '【分析】家装网络布线需要哪些器材', '助人为乐、博爱奉献”--- 秋叶原爱心基金正式成立！', '<section data-role=\"outer\" label=\"Powered by 135editor.com\" data-mpa-powered-by=\"yiban.io\"><section class=\"\"><section data-role=\"paragraph\" class=\"\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><p style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: 1.75em;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 1px; caret-color: red; font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">随着移动网络技术的发展，家庭网络系统成为了未来智能生活的基础，如何构建一个稳定可靠高速的家庭网络系统就成为了很多人所关心的问题。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: 1.75em;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 1px; caret-color: red; font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><br/></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: 1.75em;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 1px; caret-color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">而在实际网络布线时大部分人对网络布线常用器材不了解，甚至完全不知道要准备哪些器材，以至于忽略了许多细节，甚至使用劣质的器材等，这样不仅会对网络使用体验造成影响，也会给之后的维修工作带来很大的困难。</span><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;; letter-spacing: 1px; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); caret-color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"></span><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;; caret-color: transparent; letter-spacing: 1px; color: rgb(255, 76, 65);\"><strong>那么，家装布线都需要准备哪些器材呢？</strong></span></span><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; caret-color: transparent; letter-spacing: 1px; color: rgb(255, 76, 65);\"></span><span style=\"font-size: 14px; caret-color: transparent; letter-spacing: 1px; color: rgb(255, 76, 65);\"></span></span><span style=\"font-size: 14px; caret-color: transparent; letter-spacing: 1px; color: rgb(255, 76, 65); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;\"><br/></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: 1.75em;\"><span style=\"caret-color: transparent; letter-spacing: 1px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;;\"><strong><br/></strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: 1.75em;\"><span style=\"caret-color: transparent; letter-spacing: 1px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;;\"></span></p><p><img src=\"/ueditor/php/upload/image/20211117/1637113955241316.jpg\" title=\"1637113955241316.jpg\" alt=\"640.webp.jpg\"/></p><p><br/></p><section style=\"text-align: center;margin: 10px auto;line-height: 1.75em;\"><section style=\"display: inline-block;\"><section style=\"display: flex;justify-content: center;align-items: center;\"><section style=\"background-color: #fff;padding: 5px;border-radius: 50%;transform: rotate(0deg);-webkit-transform: rotate(0deg);-moz-transform: rotate(0deg);-ms-transform: rotate(0deg);-o-transform: rotate(0deg);\"><section style=\"box-sizing:border-box;background-color: rgb(254, 78, 61);width: 30px;height: 30px;border-radius: 50%;\"><section style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 1.5px;color: #fff;line-height: 30px;margin-left: 2px;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 1px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;;\">01</span></section></section></section><section style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 233, 232); padding: 5px 15px 5px 30px; margin-left: -15px; box-sizing: border-box;\" hm_fix=\"380:380\"><section data-brushtype=\"text\" style=\"letter-spacing: 1.5px; color: rgb(255, 64, 62);\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 1px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;;\">网线</span></section></section></section></section></section></section><section data-role=\"paragraph\"><section style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\"><br/></section></section><section data-role=\"paragraph\"><p style=\"text-align: justify;letter-spacing: 1.5px;line-height: 1.75em;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 1px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;;\">网线是必备品，现在布线系统基本都是暗装工程，这块翻修升级成本绝对是比前期正常使用投入成本高非常多倍的，所以必须根据情况做好充足准备。如只需满足3年内使用，选择六类千兆网络即可。如需考虑到未来3到10年或更长的使用及网络发展情况，强烈建议选择超六类万兆及以上网线进行预埋。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;letter-spacing: 1.5px;line-height: 1.75em;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 1px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;;\"><br/></span></p><p style=\"text-align: center; letter-spacing: 1.5px; line-height: 1.75em;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 1px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;;\"><img src=\"/ueditor/php/upload/image/20211117/1637114178965379.jpg\" title=\"1637114178965379.jpg\" alt=\"微信图片_20210303155316.jpg\"/></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;letter-spacing: 1.5px;line-height: 1.75em;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 1px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;;\"><br/></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;letter-spacing: 1.5px;line-height: 1.75em;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 1px; caret-color: rgb(255, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;;\">一般来说，家装布线不是掩藏在地板之下，就是埋在墙体之中，用水泥覆盖后，才会进行表面装潢。在这种全封闭的情况下，就特别需要重视网线的质量，不然会给之后的维修工作带来很大的困难。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;letter-spacing: 1.5px;line-height: 1.75em;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 1px; caret-color: rgb(255, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;;\"><br/></span></p></section><section data-role=\"paragraph\"><section data-role=\"title\" data-tools=\"135编辑器\" data-id=\"105224\" class=\"_135editor\"><section style=\"text-align: center;margin: 10px auto;line-height: 1.75em;\"><section style=\"display: inline-block;\"><section style=\"display: flex;justify-content: center;align-items: center;\"><section style=\"background-color: #fff;padding: 5px;border-radius: 50%;transform: rotate(0deg);-webkit-transform: rotate(0deg);-moz-transform: rotate(0deg);-ms-transform: rotate(0deg);-o-transform: rotate(0deg);\"><section style=\"box-sizing:border-box;background-color: rgb(254, 78, 61);width: 30px;height: 30px;border-radius: 50%;\"><section style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 1.5px;color: #fff;line-height: 30px;margin-left: 2px;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 1px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;;\">02</span></section></section></section><section style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 233, 232); padding: 5px 15px 5px 30px; margin-left: -15px; box-sizing: border-box;\"><section data-brushtype=\"text\" style=\"letter-spacing: 1.5px; color: rgb(255, 64, 62);\" hm_fix=\"352:563\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 1px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;;\">水晶头</span></section></section></section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align: justify;letter-spacing: 1.5px;line-height: 1.75em;\"><br/></section><p style=\"text-align: justify;letter-spacing: 1.5px;line-height: 1.75em;\"><span style=\"caret-color: red; letter-spacing: 1px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;;\">箱线是没有水晶头的，所以还要另外购买水晶头。选择水晶头时，可以根据网线来选择，如果网线是六类非屏蔽的，那选择六类非屏蔽水晶头即可，六类双屏蔽及以上的就需搭配专用屏蔽带燕尾夹的水晶头。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;letter-spacing: 1.5px;line-height: 1.75em;\"><span style=\"caret-color: red; letter-spacing: 1px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;;\"><br/></span></p><p style=\"text-align: center; letter-spacing: 1.5px; line-height: 1.75em;\"><span style=\"caret-color: red; letter-spacing: 1px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;;\"><img src=\"/ueditor/php/upload/image/20211117/1637114152163776.jpg\" title=\"1637114152163776.jpg\" alt=\"O1CN01yko23V1n0PeE00FAl_!!398685027.jpg\"/></span></p><p style=\"letter-spacing: 1.5px; line-height: 1.75em;\"><span style=\"caret-color: red; letter-spacing: 1px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;;\"><br/></span></p></section><section data-role=\"title\" data-tools=\"135编辑器\" data-id=\"105224\" class=\"_135editor\"><section style=\"text-align: center;margin: 10px auto;line-height: 1.75em;\"><section style=\"display: inline-block;\"><section style=\"display: flex;justify-content: center;align-items: center;\"><section style=\"background-color: #fff;padding: 5px;border-radius: 50%;transform: rotate(0deg);-webkit-transform: rotate(0deg);-moz-transform: rotate(0deg);-ms-transform: rotate(0deg);-o-transform: rotate(0deg);\"><section style=\"box-sizing:border-box;background-color: rgb(254, 78, 61);width: 30px;height: 30px;border-radius: 50%;\"><section style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 1.5px;color: #fff;line-height: 30px;margin-left: 2px;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 1px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;;\">03</span></section></section></section><section style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 233, 232); padding: 5px 15px 5px 30px; margin-left: -15px; box-sizing: border-box;\"><section data-brushtype=\"text\" style=\"letter-spacing: 1.5px; color: rgb(255, 64, 62);\" hm_fix=\"334:560\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 1px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;;\">跳线</span></section></section></section></section></section></section><section data-role=\"paragraph\"><section style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\"><br/></section></section><section data-role=\"paragraph\"><p style=\"text-align: justify;letter-spacing: 1.5px;line-height: 1.75em;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 1px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;;\">网络跳线<span style=\"font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 1px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">也称为成品网线，指的是网线两头接有水晶头的网线，是任何网络不可分割的组成部分，<span style=\"font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 1px; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); caret-color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">一般用于</span><span style=\"font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 1px; max-inline-size: 100%; cursor: text; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); caret-color: rgb(255, 0, 0); outline: none 0px !important;\">路由器和交换机等<span style=\"font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 1px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); max-inline-size: 100%; cursor: text; outline: none 0px !important;\">终端设备之间。</span></span></span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;letter-spacing: 1.5px;line-height: 1.75em;\"><span style=\"max-inline-size: 100%; cursor: text; caret-color: rgb(255, 0, 0); letter-spacing: 1px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;; outline: none 0px !important;\"><br/></span></p><p style=\"text-align: center; letter-spacing: 1.5px; line-height: 1.75em;\"><span style=\"max-inline-size: 100%; cursor: text; caret-color: rgb(255, 0, 0); letter-spacing: 1px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;; outline: none 0px !important;\"><img src=\"/ueditor/php/upload/image/20211117/1637114004577395.jpg\" title=\"1637114004577395.jpg\" alt=\"跳线.jpg\"/></span></p><p style=\"letter-spacing: 1.5px; line-height: 1.75em;\"><span style=\"max-inline-size: 100%; cursor: text; caret-color: rgb(255, 0, 0); letter-spacing: 1px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;; outline: none 0px !important;\"><br/></span></p></section><section data-role=\"title\" data-tools=\"135编辑器\" data-id=\"105224\" class=\"_135editor\"><section style=\"text-align: center;margin: 10px auto;line-height: 1.75em;\"><section style=\"display: inline-block;\"><section style=\"display: flex;justify-content: center;align-items: center;\"><section style=\"background-color: #fff;padding: 5px;border-radius: 50%;transform: rotate(0deg);-webkit-transform: rotate(0deg);-moz-transform: rotate(0deg);-ms-transform: rotate(0deg);-o-transform: rotate(0deg);\"><section style=\"box-sizing:border-box;background-color: rgb(254, 78, 61);width: 30px;height: 30px;border-radius: 50%;\"><section style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 1.5px;color: #fff;line-height: 30px;margin-left: 2px;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 1px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;;\">04</span></section></section></section><section style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 233, 232); padding: 5px 15px 5px 30px; margin-left: -15px; box-sizing: border-box;\"><section data-brushtype=\"text\" style=\"letter-spacing: 1.5px; color: rgb(255, 64, 62);\" hm_fix=\"369:558\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 1px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;;\">网络模块</span></section></section></section></section></section></section><section data-role=\"paragraph\"><section style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\"><br/></section></section><section data-role=\"paragraph\"><section style=\"text-align: justify;letter-spacing: 1.5px;line-height: 1.75em;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 1px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 1px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-indent: 28px;\">它属于一个中间</span>连接器<span style=\"font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 1px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-indent: 28px;\">，可以安装在墙面或桌面上，需要使用时只需用一条直通</span>双绞线<span style=\"font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 1px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-indent: 28px;\">即可与信息模块另一端通过双绞线所连接的设备连接，非常灵活。</span></span></section></section><section data-role=\"paragraph\"><p style=\"text-align: justify;letter-spacing: 1.5px;line-height: 1.75em;\"><span style=\"text-indent: 28px; letter-spacing: 1px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;;\"><br/></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;letter-spacing: 1.5px;line-height: 1.75em;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 1px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;; font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 1px; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-indent: 28px;\">它就像是房间墙上的闭路电视插口一样，将</span>网线<span style=\"letter-spacing: 1px; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-indent: 28px;\">插入</span>信息模块<span style=\"letter-spacing: 1px; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-indent: 28px;\">即可连网使用，美化了整个网络布线环境。</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 1px; font-size: 14px; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-indent: 28px;\"></span><span style=\"text-indent: 28px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); letter-spacing: 0.544px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;\"></span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;letter-spacing: 1.5px;line-height: 1.75em;\"><span style=\"text-indent: 28px; letter-spacing: 1px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;;\"><br/></span></p><p style=\"text-align: center; letter-spacing: 1.5px; line-height: 1.75em;\"><span style=\"text-indent: 28px; letter-spacing: 1px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;;\"><img src=\"/ueditor/php/upload/image/20211117/1637114025668656.jpg\" title=\"1637114025668656.jpg\" alt=\"O1CN01NeCqyy1n0PjHL7fDg_!!398685027.jpg\"/></span></p></section><section data-role=\"paragraph\"><section style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\"><br/></section></section><section data-role=\"title\" data-tools=\"135编辑器\" data-id=\"105224\" class=\"_135editor\"><section style=\"text-align: center;margin: 10px auto;line-height: 1.75em;\"><section style=\"display: inline-block;\"><section style=\"display: flex;justify-content: center;align-items: center;\"><section style=\"background-color: #fff;padding: 5px;border-radius: 50%;transform: rotate(0deg);-webkit-transform: rotate(0deg);-moz-transform: rotate(0deg);-ms-transform: rotate(0deg);-o-transform: rotate(0deg);\"><section style=\"box-sizing:border-box;background-color: rgb(254, 78, 61);width: 30px;height: 30px;border-radius: 50%;\"><section style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 1.5px;color: #fff;line-height: 30px;margin-left: 2px;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 1px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;;\">05</span></section></section></section><section style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 233, 232); padding: 5px 15px 5px 30px; margin-left: -15px; box-sizing: border-box;\" hm_fix=\"352:549\"><section data-brushtype=\"text\" style=\"letter-spacing: 1.5px; color: rgb(255, 64, 62);\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 1px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;;\">网络面板</span></section></section></section></section></section></section><section data-role=\"paragraph\"><section style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\"><br/></section></section><section data-role=\"paragraph\" class=\"\"><p style=\"text-align: justify;letter-spacing: 1.5px;line-height: 1.75em;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;; font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); outline: 0px; letter-spacing: 1px; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;\"><strong style=\"outline: 0px;\"><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;; outline: 0px; caret-color: red; color: rgb(255, 76, 65);\">网络面板</span></strong><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;; outline: 0px; caret-color: red; color: rgb(63, 63, 63);\">是指应用于工作区布线子系统，<span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); outline: 0px; text-align: start; text-indent: 28px;\">适合多类型模块安装的一类布线产品，</span></span></span><span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); outline: 0px; letter-spacing: 1px; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;\">它的主要作用是用以固定模块，保护信息出口处的线缆。</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;letter-spacing: 1.5px;line-height: 1.75em;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); outline: 0px; letter-spacing: 1px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;;\"><br/></span></p><p style=\"text-align: center; letter-spacing: 1.5px; line-height: 1.75em;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); outline: 0px; letter-spacing: 1px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;;\"><img src=\"/ueditor/php/upload/image/20211117/1637114117569911.jpg\" title=\"1637114117569911.jpg\" alt=\"微信图片_20210922161335.jpg\"/></span></p><p style=\"vertical-align: inherit; outline: 0px; letter-spacing: 0.544px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); line-height: 1.75em; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"text-indent: 28px; outline: 0px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;;\"><br/></span></p><p style=\"vertical-align: inherit; outline: 0px; letter-spacing: 0.544px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); line-height: 1.75em; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"outline: 0px; font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;; font-size: 16px; outline: 0px; text-indent: 28px;\">网络面板对于布线系统来说，不是主要影响性能的产品部件，</span>但却<span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;; font-size: 16px; outline: 0px; letter-spacing: 1px; text-indent: 28px;\">是仅有的几个外露在墙体</span><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;; font-size: 16px; outline: 0px; letter-spacing: 1px;\">表面</span><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;; font-size: 16px; outline: 0px; letter-spacing: 1px; text-indent: 28px;\">的产品之一，其性能与美观直接影响着整体布线的效果，要<span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;; font-size: 16px; outline: 0px;\">根据网线类别来选择与之对应的网络面板，才能达到其最佳传输性能。</span></span></span></p><p style=\"vertical-align: inherit; outline: 0px; letter-spacing: 0.544px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); line-height: 1.75em; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;\"><br/></p></section><section data-role=\"paragraph\"><section data-role=\"title\" data-tools=\"135编辑器\" data-id=\"105224\" class=\"_135editor\"><section style=\"text-align: center;margin: 10px auto;line-height: 1.75em;\"><section style=\"display: inline-block;\"><section style=\"display: flex;justify-content: center;align-items: center;\"><section style=\"background-color: #fff;padding: 5px;border-radius: 50%;transform: rotate(0deg);-webkit-transform: rotate(0deg);-moz-transform: rotate(0deg);-ms-transform: rotate(0deg);-o-transform: rotate(0deg);\"><section style=\"box-sizing:border-box;background-color: rgb(254, 78, 61);width: 30px;height: 30px;border-radius: 50%;\"><section style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 1.5px;color: #fff;line-height: 30px;margin-left: 2px;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 1px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;;\">06</span></section></section></section><section style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 233, 232); padding: 5px 15px 5px 30px; margin-left: -15px; box-sizing: border-box;\" class=\"\"><section data-brushtype=\"text\" style=\"letter-spacing: 1.5px; color: rgb(255, 64, 62);\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 1px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;;\">其他器材</span></section></section></section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align: justify;letter-spacing: 1.5px;line-height: 1.75em;\" class=\"\"><br/></section></section><section data-role=\"paragraph\"><section data-role=\"paragraph\"><p style=\"text-align: justify;letter-spacing: 1.5px;line-height: 1.75em;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 1px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 1px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); outline: 0px; border-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial;\"><strong>网线钳</strong></span>功能都比较齐全，一般都带有压电话线和网线的口，而且带有剥网线刀口和剪刀，方便进行切断、压线、剥线等操作，能制作RJ45网络线接、RJ11电话线接头、4P电话线接头。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;letter-spacing: 1.5px;line-height: 1.75em;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 1px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;;\"><br/></span></p><p style=\"text-align: center; letter-spacing: 1.5px; line-height: 1.75em;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 1px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;;\"><img src=\"/ueditor/php/upload/image/20211117/1637114090947998.png\" title=\"1637114090947998.png\" alt=\"微信图片_20211104114608.png\"/></span></p></section><section data-role=\"paragraph\" class=\"\"><section data-role=\"paragraph\" style=\"white-space: normal;\"><p style=\"letter-spacing: 1.5px;line-height: 1.75em;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 1px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;;\"><strong style=\"caret-color: red;\"><br/></strong></span></p><p style=\"letter-spacing: 1.5px;line-height: 1.75em;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 1px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;;\"><strong style=\"caret-color: red;\">网络测试仪：</strong><span style=\"font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 1px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); caret-color: red;\">接完网线之后，如果想测试网线是否接通，可以用网络测试仪进行测试，将做好的水晶头插在仪器上以后指示灯会提示每根线是否正常通讯。</span></span></p><p style=\"letter-spacing: 1.5px;line-height: 1.75em;\"><span style=\"caret-color: red; letter-spacing: 1px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;;\"><br/></span></p><p style=\"letter-spacing: 1.5px; line-height: 1.75em; text-align: center;\"><img src=\"/ueditor/php/upload/image/20211117/1637114454537594.png\" title=\"1637114454537594.png\" alt=\"微信图片_20211104114646.png\"/></p></section><p style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 1px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;;\"><br/></span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 1px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;;\">如果是大型机房、监控中心、广播电视传输等使用场景，还需搭配理线架、配线架使用，便于线缆固定整理，理顺杂乱线材，保护线缆不受损，另外，网络维护也更方便，每个网口对应一台电脑，方便机柜管理维护，网络出问题时，减少查错时间，提升维护效率，打造更顺畅的局域网络数据中心。</span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 1px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;;\"><br/></span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.75em; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 1px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;;\"><img src=\"http://www.choseal.cn/ueditor/php/upload/image/20211117/1637114057772400.jpg\" title=\"1637114057772400.jpg\" alt=\"O1CN01RJzfxd1n0Pj8CnhWg_!!398685027.jpg\" style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;; letter-spacing: 1px; text-align: center; white-space: normal; caret-color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"/></span></p><section style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\"><p style=\"vertical-align: inherit; font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: 1px; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;\"><br/></p></section></section></section><section data-role=\"paragraph\"><p style=\"letter-spacing: 1.5px;line-height: 1.75em;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 1px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;;\">以上就是家庭装修预埋布线需要准备的器材，当然，知道需要什么器材的同时也需要选好材才能构建一个稳定可靠高速的家庭网络系统。</span></p><p style=\"letter-spacing: 1.5px;line-height: 1.75em;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 1px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;;\"><br/></span></p><section style=\"letter-spacing: 1.5px;line-height: 1.75em;\"><p style=\"vertical-align: inherit; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: 1px; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;;\"><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;; font-size: 16px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); caret-color: rgb(255, 0, 0); outline: 0px; text-indent: 28px; line-height: 25.5px;\"><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;; font-size: 16px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); outline: 0px; text-align: justify;\">秋叶原</span><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;; font-size: 16px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); outline: 0px; text-align: justify; text-indent: 34px;\">作为智能工程线缆技术领先企业及智能</span><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;; font-size: 16px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); outline: 0px; text-align: justify; cursor: text;\">工程项目系统集成解决方案提供商</span><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;; font-size: 16px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); outline: 0px; text-align: justify;\">，历经30+载耕耘，已具备卓越经验和超群自主研发生产实力，能<span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;; font-size: 16px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); outline: 0px; text-align: left;\">提供</span></span></span><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;; font-size: 16px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: justify; caret-color: red; outline: 0px;\">上下游高品质产品供应服务、</span><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;; font-size: 16px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); caret-color: red; outline: 0px; text-indent: 28px; line-height: 25.5px;\">专业的</span><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;; font-size: 16px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: justify; caret-color: red; outline: 0px;\">工程项目系统集成解决方案</span><span style=\"font-size: 16px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); caret-color: red; outline: 0px; text-indent: 28px; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\">等多项服务，值得信赖！</span></span></p></section></section></section></section>', 1, 0, 10, 255, '2021-11-17 09:56:54', '2021-11-17 09:56:54', '2021-11-17 09:56:54', '2023-07-21 13:48:24', '/upload/image/20211117/6194615ff39e6.jpeg', 'null', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'PC', 'zh-CN'),
(224, 24, '【再获专利】秋叶原石墨烯屏蔽HDMI新品获国家实用新型专利证书', '助人为乐、博爱奉献”--- 秋叶原爱心基金正式成立！', '<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;;\">强化科技创新</span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;;\">锤炼专业技能</span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;;\">近日</span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;;\">秋叶原石墨烯屏蔽HDMI新品</span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;;\">获国家实用新型专利证书</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;;\"><br/></span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;;\"><img src=\"/ueditor/php/upload/image/20211124/1637734379945845.jpg\" title=\"1637734379945845.jpg\" alt=\"微信图片_20211124141248.jpg\"/></span></p><p></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;;\"><br/></span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;;\">为实现科技兴企</span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;;\">再添强劲动力</span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"></span><br/></p><p data-track=\"1\" data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"/ueditor/php/upload/image/20211124/1637734343972938.jpg\" title=\"1637734343972938.jpg\" alt=\"微信图片_20211124140918.jpg\"/></p><p data-track=\"1\" data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"/ueditor/php/upload/image/20211124/1637734357114261.jpg\" title=\"1637734357114261.jpg\" alt=\"微信图片_20211124140922.jpg\"/></p><p data-track=\"1\" data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\"><br/></p><p data-track=\"1\" data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\">随着科技和互联网的发展，大量的电子设备在工作时会产生大量不同波长、不同频率的电磁波，造成干扰，这对设备自身和信号传输线材的电磁屏蔽材料提出了更高的要求。</p><p data-track=\"1\" data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\"><br/></p><p data-track=\"2\">而HDMI作为当前最主流的音视频数字接口，其线材的优劣会直接影响信号的传输效果，因此，HDMI高清线的电磁屏蔽材料至关重要。</p><p data-track=\"2\"><br/></p><p data-track=\"2\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"http://www.choseal.cn/ueditor/php/upload/image/20211020/1634692790580483.jpg\" title=\"1634692790580483.jpg\" alt=\"微信图片_202110191731592.jpg\"/></p><p data-track=\"2\"><br/></p><p data-track=\"3\">作为高性能音视频线材和配件的著名品牌，<strong>秋叶原</strong>为了能够把HDMI线的音频和视频传输性能提升到另一个新高度，在线材的设计上会不断地进行细节上的改良，敢为行业先，特别采用<strong>新材料之王石墨烯</strong>加码HDMI技术研发生产了<strong>新型石墨烯屏蔽HDMI线</strong>。</p><p data-track=\"3\"><br/></p><p data-track=\"3\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"http://www.choseal.cn/ueditor/php/upload/image/20211020/1634692832164584.jpg\" title=\"1634692832164584.jpg\" alt=\"640.webp (1).jpg\"/></p><p data-track=\"4\"><br/></p><p data-track=\"4\">（如图）线材外护套内壁那层薄薄黑色就是石墨烯屏蔽层，虽然很薄，但是能达到优于传统金属编织的屏蔽效果，而且因为石墨烯的自身特性线身可以做的更细，更软，提高线材的弯曲性能和柔韧性，从而延长HDMI线的使用寿命。</p><p data-track=\"4\"><br/></p><p data-track=\"5\"><strong>什么是石墨烯</strong></p><p data-track=\"5\"><strong><br/></strong></p><p data-track=\"6\">石墨烯是作为一种具有颠覆性、革命性的新材料，是一种碳六元环组成的蜂窝状二维纳米材料，sp²杂化碳原子贡献的可自由移动的电子赋予了石墨烯优异的导电性和导热性，能有效降低材料密度并增强电磁屏蔽性能，在电磁屏蔽领域拥有广泛的应用价值。</p><p data-track=\"6\"><br/></p><p data-track=\"6\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"http://www.choseal.cn/ueditor/php/upload/image/20211020/1634692854653297.png\" title=\"1634692854653297.png\" alt=\"t01f09d21b6b0e159c9.png\"/></p><p data-track=\"6\"><br/></p><p data-track=\"7\">单片48.3μm 的蜂窝状多孔石墨烯材料，在10 GHz时的电磁屏蔽性能大约是40dB，此时它能屏蔽 99.99% 的入射电磁波；<strong>当把该材料堆叠到 6 层后，电磁屏蔽性能可达80dB，并能衰减 99.999999% 的入射电磁波。</strong></p><p data-track=\"8\">其优异的光学、电学、力学特性，在材料学、微纳加工、能源、生物医学和药物传递等方面具有重要的应用前景，被认为是一种未来革命性的材料。</p><p data-track=\"9\"><strong><br/></strong></p><p data-track=\"9\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong><img src=\"http://www.choseal.cn/ueditor/php/upload/image/20211020/1634692872844319.jpg\" title=\"1634692872844319.jpg\" alt=\"微信图片_20211019173159.jpg\"/></strong></p><p data-track=\"9\"><strong><br/></strong></p><p data-track=\"9\"><strong>新型石墨烯屏蔽HDMI线产品特点</strong></p><p data-track=\"9\"><strong><br/></strong></p><p data-track=\"10\">1、带宽扩充到了18Gbps，支持即插即用和热插拔，支持3840×2160分辨率。</p><p data-track=\"11\">2、在音频方面支持最多32个声道，以及最高1536kHz采样率。</p><p data-track=\"12\">3、对HDR格式传输的支持，能够显著增强图像质量。</p><p data-track=\"13\">4、采用新型石墨烯屏蔽材料替代传统编织加铝箔屏蔽降低人工成本的同时屏蔽性能更佳。</p><p data-track=\"14\">5、采用新型石墨烯屏蔽材料的产品相较传统编织加铝箔屏蔽，线身更柔软，手感更佳。</p><p data-track=\"15\">6、石墨烯屏蔽材料生产的线材比编织生产的线材在高频800MHz时EMI余量更大，差距明显（如图）。</p><p data-track=\"15\"><br/></p><p data-track=\"15\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"/ueditor/php/upload/image/20211124/1637734128316274.jpg\" title=\"1637734128316274.jpg\" alt=\"11.jpg\"/></p><p data-track=\"16\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>秋叶原新型石墨烯屏蔽材料样品测试</strong></p><p data-track=\"16\"><strong><br/></strong></p><p data-track=\"16\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong><img src=\"/ueditor/php/upload/image/20211124/1637734136931739.jpg\" title=\"1637734136931739.jpg\" alt=\"22.jpg\"/></strong></p><p data-track=\"17\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>秋叶原传统屏蔽材料样品测试</strong></p><p data-track=\"17\"><strong><br/></strong></p><p data-track=\"18\">经过进一步的研发，不断提高技术壁垒，新型石墨烯屏蔽HDMI线相比传统的HDMI线均有显著的优势，不断带给人们新的惊喜，而且线材可以做的更细，更软，有着广阔的前景。</p><p data-track=\"19\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><br/></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"http://www.choseal.cn/ueditor/php/upload/image/20211020/1634692947462567.jpg\" title=\"1634692947462567.jpg\" alt=\"微信图片_202110191731591.jpg\"/></p>', 1, 0, 10, 255, '2021-11-24 14:21:06', '2021-11-24 14:21:06', '2021-11-24 14:21:06', '2023-07-21 13:48:24', '/upload/image/20211124/619dd9c28a333.jpeg', 'null', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'PC', 'zh-CN');
INSERT INTO `news` (`id`, `news_cate_id`, `title`, `short_title`, `content`, `admin_id`, `count`, `is_show`, `sort`, `start_time`, `end_time`, `create_at`, `update_at`, `pic`, `pics`, `seo_title`, `seo_keyword`, `seo_description`, `platform`, `lang`) VALUES
(225, 24, '凝心聚力，奋勇拼搏！广东前海秋叶原集团第十三届“秋叶原·杯”男子篮球联赛圆满收官', '助人为乐、博爱奉献”--- 秋叶原爱心基金正式成立！', '<section data-role=\"outer\" label=\"Powered by 135editor.com\"><section data-role=\"paragraph\" data-mpa-powered-by=\"yiban.io\" class=\"\"><p style=\"text-align:justify;vertical-align:inherit;\"><span style=\"caret-color: red; -webkit-text-stroke-color: rgb(50, 51, 51); outline-style: initial; letter-spacing: 2px; font-kerning: none; text-indent: 34px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;\">11月25日，广东前海秋叶原集团第十三届“秋叶原·杯”男子篮球联赛在秋叶原惠州产业园区圆满收官。</span><span style=\"caret-color: red; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: 2px; text-indent: 34px; -webkit-text-stroke-color: rgb(50, 51, 51); font-kerning: none; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"caret-color: red; outline-style: initial; font-kerning: none;\">历经9天</span>的</span><span style=\"caret-color: red; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: 2px; text-indent: 34px; -webkit-text-stroke-color: rgb(50, 51, 51); font-kerning: none; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;\">激烈角逐，</span><span style=\"caret-color: red; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: 2px; text-indent: 34px; -webkit-text-stroke-color: rgb(50, 51, 51); outline-style: initial; font-kerning: none; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;\">一场速度与激情的</span><span style=\"caret-color: red; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: 2px; text-indent: 34px; outline-style: initial; -webkit-text-stroke-color: rgb(249, 118, 19); font-kerning: none; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;\">体育盛宴</span><span style=\"caret-color: red; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: 2px; text-indent: 34px; -webkit-text-stroke-color: rgb(50, 51, 51); outline-style: initial; font-kerning: none; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;\">落下帷幕。</span><br/></p></section><section data-role=\"paragraph\" class=\"\"><p style=\"vertical-align:inherit;\"><br/></p><p style=\"vertical-align:inherit;\"></p></section><section data-role=\"paragraph\" class=\"\"><section data-role=\"paragraph\" style=\"white-space: normal;\"><p style=\"text-align:center;vertical-align: inherit;line-height: normal;\"><img src=\"/ueditor/php/upload/image/20211126/1637920065893661.jpg\" title=\"1637920065893661.jpg\" alt=\"1.webp.jpg\"/></p></section><p style=\"text-align:justify;vertical-align: inherit;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); letter-spacing: 1px; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;\"><br/></span></p><p style=\"text-align:justify;vertical-align: inherit;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); letter-spacing: 1px; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;\">闭幕式伊始，参加本次赛事的全体球员、裁判、拉拉队员在庄严的国旗和集团旗的引领下，在庄严激昂的义勇军进行曲中迈着矫健的步伐入场。</span></p><p style=\"text-align:justify;vertical-align: inherit;\"><br/></p><p style=\"text-align: center; vertical-align: inherit;\"><img src=\"/ueditor/php/upload/image/20211126/1637920074668594.jpg\" title=\"1637920074668594.jpg\" alt=\"2.webp.jpg\"/></p><p style=\"text-align:justify;vertical-align: inherit;\"></p><p style=\"text-align:justify;vertical-align: inherit;\"><br/></p><p style=\"text-align:justify;vertical-align: inherit;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); letter-spacing: 1px; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;\">惠秋总经理&amp;秋叶原研究院执行院长张涛先生代表集团公司为本届赛事闭幕致辞，首先<span style=\"max-inline-size: 100%; cursor: text; caret-color: rgb(255, 0, 0); text-indent: 34px; outline: none 0px !important;\">向所有的参赛运动员表示热烈的祝贺，</span><span style=\"max-inline-size: 100%; cursor: text; text-indent: 34px; caret-color: rgb(255, 0, 0); outline: none 0px !important;\">同时也向所有辛勤付出的裁判员和工作人员表示感谢。&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); max-inline-size: 100%; cursor: text; text-indent: 34px; caret-color: rgb(255, 0, 0); outline: none 0px !important; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;\"></span></p><p style=\"text-align:justify;vertical-align: inherit;\"><br/></p><p style=\"text-align: center; vertical-align: inherit;\"><img src=\"/ueditor/php/upload/image/20211126/1637920084508793.jpg\" title=\"1637920084508793.jpg\" alt=\"3.webp.jpg\"/></p><section data-role=\"paragraph\" style=\"white-space: normal;\"><p style=\"text-align:center;vertical-align: inherit;\"></p></section><section data-role=\"paragraph\" style=\"white-space: normal;\"><p style=\"text-align:center;vertical-align: inherit;line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;\"><strong style=\"outline: 0px; letter-spacing: 0.544px; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 12px;color: #FF0000;\">惠秋总经理&amp;秋叶原研究院执行院长张涛先生</span></strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center;vertical-align: inherit;line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;\"><strong style=\"outline: 0px; letter-spacing: 0.544px; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 12px;color: #FF0000;\">为本次闭幕式致辞</span></strong></span></p></section><section data-role=\"paragraph\"><p style=\"text-align:center;vertical-align:inherit;line-height: normal;\"><br/></p></section><section data-role=\"paragraph\"><p style=\"vertical-align:inherit;\"><span style=\"caret-color: red; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;\">他表示参赛队员们工作、比赛两不误，经历了将近十天十几场的激烈角逐，完成了每一场比赛，充分展现了秋叶原人的精神风貌，每个队员敢于拼搏、奋勇向前的精神，都是可嘉的，都是值得称赞的。虽然比赛结果有名次，但是坚持到最后的每一个队员都是冠军，都拥有了强健的体魄和良好的心态，也是人生赛场上的冠军。&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"vertical-align:inherit;\"><span style=\"caret-color: red; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;\"><br/></span></p><p style=\"vertical-align:inherit;\"><span style=\"caret-color: red; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;\"></span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"/ueditor/php/upload/image/20211126/1637920112421217.jpg\" style=\"\" title=\"1637920112421217.jpg\"/></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"/ueditor/php/upload/image/20211126/1637920112876583.jpg\" style=\"\" title=\"1637920112876583.jpg\"/></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"/ueditor/php/upload/image/20211126/1637920112257202.jpg\" style=\"\" title=\"1637920112257202.jpg\"/></p><p style=\"vertical-align:inherit;\"><span style=\"caret-color: red; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;\"><br/></span></p></section><p style=\"vertical-align:inherit;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;\">篮球比赛是一项强身健体的运动，希望通过活动比赛带动大家平时多注重锻炼身体，因为有身体才有事业，有健康才有幸福。</span></p><p style=\"vertical-align:inherit;\"><br/></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"/ueditor/php/upload/image/20211126/1637920143365993.jpg\" style=\"\" title=\"1637920143365993.jpg\"/></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"/ueditor/php/upload/image/20211126/1637920143863334.jpg\" style=\"\" title=\"1637920143863334.jpg\"/></p><p style=\"vertical-align:inherit;\"><br/></p><p style=\"vertical-align:inherit;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;\">篮球运动也是一个团体运动，每场球赛都要有组织、有策划，每个球员都有分工、有配合，只有团结合作才有可能赢得比赛的胜利。在工作中也是一样的，企业的各个部门，各个成员，缺一不可，通过团结互助，分工协作，才能共同完成各项经营指标和任务。&nbsp;</span></p><section><section style=\"display: flex;flex-flow: row nowrap;margin: 10px 0%;\"><section style=\"box-sizing:border-box;display: inline-block;vertical-align: bottom;width: auto;flex: 100 100 0%;height: auto;align-self: flex-end;margin-left: 10px;\"><section style=\"text-align: center;margin-right: 0%;margin-left: 0%;justify-content: center;\"><br/></section></section></section></section><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"/ueditor/php/upload/image/20211126/1637920159753590.jpg\" style=\"\" title=\"1637920159753590.jpg\"/></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"/ueditor/php/upload/image/20211126/1637920159467614.jpg\" style=\"\" title=\"1637920159467614.jpg\"/></p><p style=\"vertical-align:inherit;\"><br/></p><p style=\"vertical-align:inherit;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;color: #3F3F3F;\">比赛结束了，但我们全年的工作任务还没有结束，在最后一个多月的时间里，我们要把在这次球赛中表现出来的饱满的激情、昂扬的斗志、拼搏的精神用到我们接下来的工作当中，冲刺最后一个月，圆满完成甚至超额完成全年的经营目标，将快乐，健康，拼搏，敬业的理念落实到生活和工作中，实现个人和企业的价值双赢。</span></span></p><p style=\"vertical-align:inherit;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;color: #3F3F3F;\">&nbsp;</span></span></p><p style=\"vertical-align:inherit;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"><strong>恭喜获奖队伍</strong></span></p><p style=\"vertical-align:inherit;\"><br/></p></section><section style=\"margin-top: -10px;margin-right: 0%;margin-left: 0%;\"><section style=\"text-align: center;color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\" class=\"\"><p style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;\"><strong><span style=\"background-color: #ff8124;\">&nbsp; 冠军：仓储物流、行政、采购&nbsp;</span></strong></span></p><p style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;\"><strong><span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 129, 36);\">&nbsp;宝盛公司、水电工程联队&nbsp;</span></strong></span></p></section></section><section data-role=\"paragraph\" class=\"\"><p style=\"vertical-align:inherit;\"><br/></p></section><section data-role=\"paragraph\" class=\"\"><p style=\"vertical-align: inherit; text-align: center;\"><img src=\"/ueditor/php/upload/image/20211126/1637920175394932.jpg\" title=\"1637920175394932.jpg\" alt=\"11.webp.jpg\"/></p><p style=\"text-align:center;vertical-align: inherit;line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 13px; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;\"><strong><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">惠秋总经理&amp;秋叶原研究院执行院长张涛先生</span></strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center;vertical-align: inherit;line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 13px; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;\"><strong><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">为“冠军”获得队颁奖</span></strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center;vertical-align:inherit;\"><br/></p></section><section style=\"margin-top: -10px;margin-right: 0%;margin-left: 0%;\"><section style=\"text-align: center;color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\" class=\"\"><p style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;\"><strong><span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 129, 36);\"><span style=\"caret-color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"max-inline-size: 100%; cursor: text; outline: none 0px !important;\">亚</span></span>军：铜业公司代表队&nbsp;</span></strong><br/></span></p></section></section><section data-role=\"paragraph\"><p style=\"vertical-align:inherit;\"><br/></p></section><section data-role=\"paragraph\" class=\"\"><p style=\"vertical-align: inherit; text-align: center;\"><img src=\"/ueditor/php/upload/image/20211126/1637920208125433.jpg\" title=\"1637920208125433.jpg\" alt=\"12.webp.jpg\"/></p></section><section data-role=\"paragraph\" class=\"\"><p style=\"text-align:center;vertical-align: inherit;line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 13px; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;\"><strong><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">深秋财务中心总监林贵平先生</span></strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center;vertical-align: inherit;line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 13px; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;\"><strong style=\"font-size: 12px;caret-color: red;\"><span style=\"font-size: 13px;color: #FF0000;\">为“亚军”获得队 颁奖</span></strong></span></p></section><section data-role=\"paragraph\" class=\"\"><p style=\"vertical-align:inherit;\"><br/></p></section><section style=\"margin-top: -10px;margin-right: 0%;margin-left: 0%;\"><section style=\"text-align: center;color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\" class=\"\"><p style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;\"><strong><span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 129, 36);\">&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"caret-color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">季</span>军：电线一部、物控联队&nbsp;</span></strong><br/></span></p></section></section><section data-role=\"paragraph\" class=\"\"><p style=\"vertical-align:inherit;\"><br/></p></section><section data-role=\"paragraph\" class=\"\"><p style=\"vertical-align: inherit; text-align: center;\"><img src=\"/ueditor/php/upload/image/20211126/1637920220719687.jpg\" title=\"1637920220719687.jpg\" alt=\"13.webp.jpg\"/></p></section><section data-role=\"paragraph\"><p style=\"text-align:center;vertical-align: inherit;line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 13px; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;\"><strong><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">惠秋铜业发展有限公司总经理杨志鸿先生</span></strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center;vertical-align: inherit;line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 13px; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;\"><strong><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">为“季军”获得队颁奖</span></strong></span></p></section><section data-role=\"paragraph\" class=\"\"><p style=\"vertical-align:inherit;\"><br/></p></section><section style=\"text-align: center;color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\" class=\"\"><p style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;