7327496822.jpg\" title=\"1638497327496822.jpg\" alt=\"640.webp (2).jpg\"/></span></p></section><section data-role=\"paragraph\"><p style=\"text-align:center;vertical-align: inherit;letter-spacing: 1.5px;line-height: 1.75em;\"><br/></p></section><section data-role=\"paragraph\"><p style=\"text-align:center;vertical-align: inherit;letter-spacing: 1.5px;line-height: 1.75em;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;\">别着急！</span></p></section><section data-role=\"paragraph\"><p style=\"text-align:center;vertical-align: inherit;letter-spacing: 1.5px;line-height: 1.75em;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;\">只需这几步，让你网速快到飞起</span></p></section><section data-role=\"paragraph\"><p style=\"text-align:center;vertical-align: inherit;letter-spacing: 1.5px;line-height: 1.75em;\"><br/></p><section class=\"js_uneditable custom_select_card channels_iframe _135editor\"><mpvideosnap class=\"js_uneditable custom_select_card channels_iframe\" data-pluginname=\"videosnap\" data-id=\"export/UzFfAgtgekIEAQAAAAAAJpgjArrBjgAAAAstQy6ubaLX4KHWvLEZgBPEuoN4RARDZbr9zNPgMIvAMw0ixV-Z-9rud1ICsRjV\" data-url=\"https://findermp.video.qq.com/251/20304/stodownload?encfilekey=rjD5jyTuFrIpZ2ibE8T7Ym3K77SEULgkiaibYwRdxLeF0yrd0KxibOUzBFK2SLAib2ggfmXq5TiahUXib3mQ7OsIiaK2icYQib36ndAV29RMTdebv2MkQqq9unsPl03A&amp;adaptivelytrans=0&amp;bizid=1023&amp;dotrans=0&amp;hy=SZ&amp;idx=1&amp;m=&amp;scene=0&amp;token=AxricY7RBHdVb111BFP1FDrwSTZicF5iaVYhpkyu1Qlicc7gp7J898W2NR28RXetrUtFfMzCJTNYicSE\" data-headimgurl=\"http://wx.qlogo.cn/finderhead/PiajxSqBRaEJ0n1icpGfeAXLz9XtHKdFibwibSeExvN5vxBbQewCic7lJOQ/0\" data-username=\"v2_060000231003b20faec8c7e58819c0d4c906e83db077fec7f0138be9e0e29339f13373c368ef@finder\" data-nickname=\"Choseal秋叶原\" data-desc=\"为什么宽带升级了，网速还是很慢？#网线 #电脑知识 #路由器\n\" data-nonceid=\"17463811929548202617\" data-type=\"video\"></mpvideosnap></section></section><section data-role=\"title\" data-tools=\"135编辑器\" data-id=\"107008\" class=\"_135editor\"><section style=\"text-align: center;margin: 10px auto;\"><section style=\"display: flex;justify-content: center;align-items: center;\"><section style=\"box-sizing:border-box;width: 18px;height: 18px;background-color: rgb(249, 215, 85);border-radius: 50%;margin-right: -9px;flex-shrink: 0;transform: rotate(0deg);-webkit-transform: rotate(0deg);-moz-transform: rotate(0deg);-ms-transform: rotate(0deg);-o-transform: rotate(0deg);\"><section style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 1.5px;color: #fff;line-height: 18px;\"><p style=\"vertical-align: inherit;line-height: 1.75em;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;\"><strong data-original-title=\"\" title=\"\">1</strong></span></p></section></section><section style=\"display: inline-block;\"><section style=\"background-color: rgb(237, 77, 66); padding: 5px 20px; box-sizing: border-box;\"><section data-brushtype=\"text\" style=\"letter-spacing: 1.5px; color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\" hm_fix=\"336:437\"><p style=\"vertical-align: inherit;line-height: 1.75em;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;\">看光猫</span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section data-role=\"paragraph\"><p style=\"vertical-align:inherit;\"><br/></p></section><section data-role=\"paragraph\"><p style=\"text-align:justify;vertical-align: inherit;letter-spacing: 1.5px;line-height: 1.75em;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;\">一般的光猫都有千兆口和百兆口，<span style=\"color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; caret-color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">在升级千兆网络之后，想要跑出千兆网络的速度，就需要</span>检查网线是不是插在了千兆口上，才能支持千兆网络。</span></p><p style=\"text-align:justify;vertical-align: inherit;letter-spacing: 1.5px;line-height: 1.75em;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;\"><br/></span></p><p style=\"text-align: center; vertical-align: inherit; letter-spacing: 1.5px; line-height: 1.75em;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;\"><img src=\"/ueditor/php/upload/image/20211203/1638497356635059.jpg\" title=\"1638497356635059.jpg\" alt=\"00.jpg\"/></span></p></section><section data-role=\"paragraph\"><p style=\"vertical-align:inherit;\"><br/></p></section><section data-role=\"title\" data-tools=\"135编辑器\" data-id=\"107008\" class=\"_135editor\"><section style=\"text-align: center;margin: 10px auto;\"><section style=\"display: flex;justify-content: center;align-items: center;\"><section style=\"box-sizing:border-box;width: 18px;height: 18px;background-color: rgb(249, 215, 85);border-radius: 50%;margin-right: -9px;flex-shrink: 0;transform: rotate(0deg);-webkit-transform: rotate(0deg);-moz-transform: rotate(0deg);-ms-transform: rotate(0deg);-o-transform: rotate(0deg);\"><section style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 1.5px;color: #fff;line-height: 18px;\"><p style=\"vertical-align: inherit;line-height: 1.75em;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;\"><strong data-original-title=\"\" title=\"\" data-num=\"5\">2</strong><strong data-original-title=\"\" title=\"\" data-num=\"5\"></strong></span></p></section></section><section style=\"display: inline-block;\"><section style=\"background-color: rgb(237, 77, 66); padding: 5px 20px; box-sizing: border-box;\" hm_fix=\"366:438\"><section data-brushtype=\"text\" style=\"letter-spacing: 1.5px; color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><p style=\"vertical-align: inherit;line-height: 1.75em;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;\">看路由器</span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section data-role=\"paragraph\"><p style=\"vertical-align:inherit;\"><br/></p></section><section data-role=\"paragraph\"><p style=\"text-align:justify;vertical-align: inherit;letter-spacing: 1.5px;line-height: 1.75em;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;\">网络升级，设备也得跟上，千兆网络就需要使用千兆端口，才能支持千兆传输速率，所以必须确保<span style=\"color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 1.5px; caret-color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">家里的路由器是千兆端口的</span>。</span></p><p style=\"text-align:justify;vertical-align: inherit;letter-spacing: 1.5px;line-height: 1.75em;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;\"><br/></span></p><p style=\"text-align: center; vertical-align: inherit; letter-spacing: 1.5px; line-height: 1.75em;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;\"><img src=\"/ueditor/php/upload/image/20211203/1638497376859987.jpg\" title=\"1638497376859987.jpg\" alt=\"微信图片_20211130135850.jpg\"/></span></p></section><section data-role=\"paragraph\"><p style=\"vertical-align:inherit;\"><br/></p></section><section data-role=\"title\" data-tools=\"135编辑器\" data-id=\"107008\" class=\"_135editor\"><section style=\"text-align: center;margin: 10px auto;\"><section style=\"display: flex;justify-content: center;align-items: center;\"><section style=\"box-sizing:border-box;width: 18px;height: 18px;background-color: rgb(249, 215, 85);border-radius: 50%;margin-right: -9px;flex-shrink: 0;transform: rotate(0deg);-webkit-transform: rotate(0deg);-moz-transform: rotate(0deg);-ms-transform: rotate(0deg);-o-transform: rotate(0deg);\"><section style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 1.5px;color: #fff;line-height: 18px;\"><p style=\"vertical-align: inherit;line-height: 1.75em;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;\"><strong data-original-title=\"\" title=\"\" data-num=\"6\">3</strong></span></p></section></section><section style=\"display: inline-block;\"><section style=\"background-color: rgb(237, 77, 66); padding: 5px 20px; box-sizing: border-box;\"><section data-brushtype=\"text\" style=\"letter-spacing: 1.5px; color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><p style=\"vertical-align: inherit;line-height: 1.75em;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;\">看网卡</span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section data-role=\"paragraph\"><p style=\"vertical-align:inherit;\"><br/></p></section><section data-role=\"paragraph\"><p style=\"vertical-align: inherit;letter-spacing: 1.5px;line-height: 1.75em;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(63, 63, 63);\">如果家里电脑的网卡不</span><strong><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(63, 63, 63);\">支持千兆宽带</span></strong><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(63, 63, 63);\">，也是不能使用千兆网络的。</span></span></p><p style=\"vertical-align: inherit;letter-spacing: 1.5px;line-height: 1.75em;\"><br/></p><p style=\"vertical-align:inherit;\"><img src=\"/ueditor/php/upload/image/20211203/1638497392103293.png\" title=\"1638497392103293.png\" alt=\"微信图片_20211130162544.png\"/></p><p style=\"vertical-align:inherit;\"><br/></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><strong data-brushtype=\"text\">如何查看电脑的网卡</strong></span></p><p><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/JaFvPvvA2J3MKYVlmXC32WtRJEYsPM9zPnJkV1fTFuQHlp5RfDMTFYxuCuQwLSPIWsa9uaW9fnAqO9cEJg31eQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" data-type=\"png\" data-width=\"100%\" data-ratio=\"1.0344827586206897\" data-w=\"29\" style=\"vertical-align:inherit;\"/></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">一、打开设备管理器；</span></p><p><br/></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">二、点击展开网络适配器，如果为千兆网卡，会含有这些字符：Gigabit、GBE、10/100/1000M、RTL8169。</span></p><p><br/></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">如果是含Fast Ethernet、10/100、FE等字符，则为百兆网卡。</span></p></section><section data-role=\"paragraph\"><p style=\"vertical-align:inherit;\"><br/></p><section data-role=\"title\" data-tools=\"135编辑器\" data-id=\"107008\" class=\"_135editor\"><section style=\"text-align: center;margin: 10px auto;\"><section style=\"display: flex;justify-content: center;align-items: center;\"><section style=\"box-sizing:border-box;width: 18px;height: 18px;background-color: rgb(249, 215, 85);border-radius: 50%;margin-right: -9px;flex-shrink: 0;transform: rotate(0deg);-webkit-transform: rotate(0deg);-moz-transform: rotate(0deg);-ms-transform: rotate(0deg);-o-transform: rotate(0deg);\"><section style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 1.5px;color: #fff;line-height: 18px;\"><p style=\"vertical-align: inherit;line-height: 1.75em;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Emoji Symbols Font&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;\"><strong data-original-title=\"\" title=\"\">4</strong></span></p></section></section><section style=\"display: inline-block;\"><section style=\"background-color: rgb(237, 77, 66); padding: 5px 20px; box-sizing: border-box;\"><section data-brushtype=\"text\" style=\"letter-spacing: 1.5px; color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\" hm_fix=\"336:437\"><p style=\"vertical-align: inherit;line-height: 1.75em;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Emoji Symbols Font&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;\">看面板</span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><p style=\"vertical-align:inherit;\"><br/></p><p style=\"vertical-align:inherit;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"outline: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 1px; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;\"><strong style=\"outline: 0px;\"><span style=\"outline: 0px; caret-color: red; color: rgb(255, 76, 65);\">网络面板</span></strong><span style=\"outline: 0px; caret-color: red; color: rgb(63, 63, 63);\">是指应用于工作区布线子系统，<span style=\"outline: 0px; text-indent: 28px;\">适合多类型模块安装的一类布线产品，</span></span></span><span style=\"outline: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 1px; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;\">它的主要作用是用以固定模块，保护信息出口处的线缆。</span></span></p><p style=\"vertical-align:inherit;\"><span style=\"outline: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 1px; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;\"><br/></span></p><p style=\"vertical-align: inherit; text-align: center;\"><img src=\"/ueditor/php/upload/image/20211203/1638497494513168.jpg\" title=\"1638497494513168.jpg\" alt=\"微信图片_20210922161335.jpg\"/></p><p style=\"vertical-align:inherit;\"><br/></p><p style=\"vertical-align:inherit;\"><span style=\"outline: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 1px; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;\">在网络面板之下，它的正经搭配者——网络模块，会对整个布线系统的性能会起到重要影响，所以即使升级了千兆宽带也要注意选择相对应的千兆面板和模块。</span></p><p style=\"vertical-align:inherit;\"><br/></p></section><section data-role=\"title\" data-tools=\"135编辑器\" data-id=\"107008\" class=\"_135editor\"><section style=\"text-align: center;margin: 10px auto;\"><section style=\"display: flex;justify-content: center;align-items: center;\"><section style=\"box-sizing:border-box;width: 18px;height: 18px;background-color: rgb(249, 215, 85);border-radius: 50%;margin-right: -9px;flex-shrink: 0;transform: rotate(0deg);-webkit-transform: rotate(0deg);-moz-transform: rotate(0deg);-ms-transform: rotate(0deg);-o-transform: rotate(0deg);\"><section style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 1.5px;color: #fff;line-height: 18px;\"><p style=\"vertical-align: inherit;line-height: 1.75em;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;\"><strong data-original-title=\"\" title=\"\" data-num=\"7\">5</strong></span></p></section></section><section style=\"display: inline-block;\"><section style=\"background-color: rgb(237, 77, 66); padding: 5px 20px; box-sizing: border-box;\"><section data-brushtype=\"text\" style=\"letter-spacing: 1.5px; color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><p style=\"vertical-align: inherit;line-height: 1.75em;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;\">看网线</span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section data-role=\"paragraph\"><p style=\"vertical-align:inherit;\"><br/></p></section><section data-role=\"paragraph\"><p style=\"text-align:justify;vertical-align: inherit;letter-spacing: 1.5px;line-height: 1.75em;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.544px;\">网线作为网络设备之间的传输通道，也是影响网速的重要因素。目前市面上网线种类有很多，</span><span style=\"color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 2px; background-color: rgb(254, 254, 254);\">要想完美传输千兆网络</span>要看<strong>宽带光猫与路由器</strong>之间的连接网线是不是六类及以上网线。</span></p><p style=\"text-align:justify;vertical-align: inherit;letter-spacing: 1.5px;line-height: 1.75em;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;\"><br/></span></p><p style=\"text-align: center; vertical-align: inherit; letter-spacing: 1.5px; line-height: 1.75em;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;\"><img src=\"/ueditor/php/upload/image/20211203/1638497464727302.jpg\" title=\"1638497464727302.jpg\" alt=\"640.webp.jpg\"/></span></p></section><section data-role=\"paragraph\"><p style=\"text-align:center;vertical-align:inherit;\"><br/></p><p style=\"vertical-align: inherit;letter-spacing: 1.5px;line-height: 1.75em;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; outline: 0px; letter-spacing: 0.5px; color: rgb(255, 41, 65);\"><strong style=\"outline: 0px;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; caret-color: rgb(255, 0, 0); max-inline-size: 100%; cursor: text; outline: none 0px !important;\">六类网线</span></strong></span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0.5px; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); caret-color: rgb(255, 0, 0); outline: 0px; max-inline-size: 100%; cursor: text;\">的传输频率为250Mhz，适用于传输速率高于1Gbps的应用，它</span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; caret-color: red; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); letter-spacing: 0.5px; outline-style: initial;\">的传输速率能够提供高于超五类2.5倍的高速带宽，能“真正有保证”地运用于千兆以太网。</span></span></p><p style=\"vertical-align: inherit;letter-spacing: 1.5px;line-height: 1.75em;\"><span style=\"caret-color: red; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); letter-spacing: 0.5px; outline-style: initial; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;\"><br/></span></p><p style=\"vertical-align: inherit; letter-spacing: 1.5px; line-height: 1.75em; text-align: center;\"><img src=\"http://www.choseal.cn/ueditor/php/upload/image/20211203/1638497435292181.jpg\" title=\"1638497435292181.jpg\" alt=\"微信图片_20211130172213.jpg\" style=\"text-align: center; white-space: normal; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: 1px;\"/></p><p style=\"vertical-align: inherit;letter-spacing: 1.5px;line-height: 1.75em;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(76, 70, 70); letter-spacing: 0.544px; caret-color: red; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;\"><br/></span></p><p style=\"vertical-align: inherit;letter-spacing: 1.5px;line-height: 1.75em;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(76, 70, 70); letter-spacing: 0.544px; caret-color: red;\">网络设备不带劲，就像拖拉机上高速，做啥努力都是白搭！所以，家庭用户在升级了千兆网络后，</span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; caret-color: red; outline-style: initial; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">不论是</span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; caret-color: red; outline-style: initial; letter-spacing: 0.5px; color: rgb(255, 41, 65);\"><strong style=\"outline-style: initial;\">接插件、线缆到链路和信道</strong></span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; caret-color: red; outline-style: initial; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">全部满足千兆的性能要求，<span style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(76, 70, 70); letter-spacing: 0.544px;\">才能完美跑出千兆网络的速度。</span></span></span></p></section></section>', 1, 0, 10, 255, '2021-12-03 10:12:23', '2021-12-03 10:12:23', '2021-12-03 10:12:23', '2023-07-21 13:48:24', '/upload/image/20211203/61a97cec01df5.jpeg', 'null', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'PC', 'zh-CN'),
(228, 24, '秋叶原荣登中国物联网产业大会暨品牌盛会2021年度“十大音视频品牌”榜', '助人为乐、博爱奉献”--- 秋叶原爱心基金正式成立！', '<section data-role=\"outer\" label=\"Powered by 135editor.com\"><section data-role=\"paragraph\" class=\"_135editor\"><section data-role=\"paragraph\" data-mpa-powered-by=\"yiban.io\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 17px; text-align: justify; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;\"><p style=\"text-align:center;vertical-align: inherit; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 0px; clear: both; min-height: 1em; max-width: 100%; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><br/></p><p style=\"text-align:justify;margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 0px; clear: both; min-height: 1em; max-width: 100%; vertical-align: inherit; text-indent: 0em; letter-spacing: 1.5px; line-height: 1.75em; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;; font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; text-align: left; text-indent: 56px; caret-color: red; letter-spacing: 1.5px; font-size: 16px;\">12月8日，由中国B端企业服务商和行业门户慧聪物联网及慧聪电子网联合主办的2021年（第十八届）中国物联网产业大会暨品牌盛会，在深圳宝安希尔顿逸林酒店隆重举行，吸引了华为、海康威视、秋叶原、高新兴等业内知名企业参加。</span><span style=\"color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; text-align: left; text-indent: 56px; caret-color: red; letter-spacing: 1.5px;\"><br/></span></span></p><p style=\"text-align:justify;margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 0px; clear: both; min-height: 1em; max-width: 100%; vertical-align: inherit; text-indent: 0em; letter-spacing: 1.5px; line-height: 1.75em; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;; font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; text-align: left; text-indent: 56px; caret-color: red; letter-spacing: 1.5px; font-size: 16px;\"><br/></span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: center; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 0px; clear: both; min-height: 1em; max-width: 100%; vertical-align: inherit; text-indent: 0em; letter-spacing: 1.5px; line-height: 1.75em; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><img src=\"/ueditor/php/upload/image/20211209/1639033817431959.png\" title=\"1639033817431959.png\" alt=\"图片1.png\"/></p><p style=\"text-align:justify;margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 0px; clear: both; min-height: 1em; max-width: 100%; vertical-align: inherit; text-indent: 0em; letter-spacing: 1.5px; line-height: 1.75em; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; caret-color: red; text-align: left; text-indent: 56px; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;; font-size: 16px; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><span style=\"caret-color: red; text-align: left; text-indent: 56px; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; max-inline-size: 100%; cursor: text; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><br/></span></span></p><p style=\"text-align:justify;margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 0px; clear: both; min-height: 1em; max-width: 100%; vertical-align: inherit; text-indent: 0em; letter-spacing: 1.5px; line-height: 1.75em; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; caret-color: red; text-align: left; text-indent: 56px; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;; font-size: 16px; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><span style=\"caret-color: red; text-align: left; text-indent: 56px; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; max-inline-size: 100%; cursor: text; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; box-sizing: border-box !important;\">大会</span><span style=\"text-align: left; text-indent: 56px; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; max-inline-size: 100%; cursor: text; caret-color: red; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; box-sizing: border-box !important;\">以<strong style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; box-sizing: border-box !important;\">“物联芯生，数智世界”</strong>为主题，汇聚物联网、安防、智能家居等上下游产业精英，旨在打造产业前沿交流平台，加快推动行业高质量发展，促进变革时代企业的数智化转型。</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align:justify;margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 0px; clear: both; min-height: 1em; max-width: 100%; vertical-align: inherit; text-indent: 0em; letter-spacing: 1.5px; line-height: 1.75em; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><br/></p><p style=\"text-align: center; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 0px; clear: both; min-height: 1em; max-width: 100%; vertical-align: inherit; text-indent: 0em; letter-spacing: 1.5px; line-height: 1.75em; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><img src=\"/ueditor/php/upload/image/20211209/1639033833292478.png\" title=\"1639033833292478.png\" alt=\"微信图片_20211209110445.png\"/></p><p style=\"text-align:justify;margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 0px; clear: both; min-height: 1em; max-width: 100%; vertical-align: inherit; text-indent: 0em; letter-spacing: 1.5px; line-height: 1.75em; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><br/></p><p style=\"text-align:justify;margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 0px; clear: both; min-height: 1em; max-width: 100%; vertical-align: inherit; text-indent: 0em; letter-spacing: 1.5px; line-height: 1.75em; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;; font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; box-sizing: border-box !important;\">会上，备受关注的十大品牌榜单同步揭晓，</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(255, 76, 65); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><strong style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; box-sizing: border-box !important;\">秋叶原</strong></span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; box-sizing: border-box !important;\">凭借强劲的品牌影响力与产品创新研发实力，从千家参选企业中脱颖而出，</span><strong style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(255, 76, 65); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; box-sizing: border-box !important;\">荣登2021年度“十大音视频品牌”榜</span></strong><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; box-sizing: border-box !important;\">，荣耀加冕！深圳市秋叶原实业有限公司在音视频传输领域扎根30多年积累的优势与成果受到业界一致好评及充分肯定。</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align:justify;margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 0px; clear: both; min-height: 1em; max-width: 100%; vertical-align: inherit; text-indent: 0em; letter-spacing: 1.5px; line-height: 1.75em; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><br/></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"/ueditor/php/upload/image/20211209/1639033895555788.png\" style=\"\" title=\"1639033895555788.png\"/></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"/ueditor/php/upload/image/20211209/1639033895638229.png\" style=\"\" title=\"1639033895638229.png\"/></p><p style=\"text-align:justify;margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 0px; clear: both; min-height: 1em; max-width: 100%; vertical-align: inherit; text-indent: 0em; letter-spacing: 1.5px; line-height: 1.75em; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><br/></p><p style=\"text-align:justify;margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 0px; clear: both; min-height: 1em; max-width: 100%; vertical-align: inherit; text-indent: 0em; letter-spacing: 1.5px; line-height: 1.75em; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;; font-size: 16px; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; box-sizing: border-box !important;\">十大品牌盛会作为中国物联网产业大会着力打造的行业特色评选活动，已在安防、物联网、智能家居、音视频传输等相关行业形成了较大的影响力，获得了各界的普遍认可和肯定。2021中国物联网产业大会暨品牌盛会评选活动自9月启动报名以来，受到业内人士广泛关注和支持。千家参选企业同台竞技，通过微信投票、专家评审、用户评审、媒体宣传等四大维度综合权重得出排名，产生本届品牌盛会各奖项的最终10强。此次，秋叶原获评2021年度“十大音视频品牌”，有着行业与终端消费者对秋叶原品牌的肯定、支持与信赖，同时也有着行业与终端消费者对秋叶原的期许。</span></p><p style=\"text-align:justify;margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 0px; clear: both; min-height: 1em; max-width: 100%; vertical-align: inherit; text-indent: 0em; letter-spacing: 1.5px; line-height: 1.75em; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><br/></p><p style=\"text-align: center; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 0px; clear: both; min-height: 1em; max-width: 100%; vertical-align: inherit; text-indent: 0em; letter-spacing: 1.5px; line-height: 1.75em; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><img src=\"/ueditor/php/upload/image/20211209/1639033916291478.png\" title=\"1639033916291478.png\" alt=\"图片4.png\"/></p><p style=\"text-align:justify;margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 0px; clear: both; min-height: 1em; max-width: 100%; vertical-align: inherit; text-indent: 0em; letter-spacing: 1.5px; line-height: 1.75em; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><br/></p><p style=\"text-align: center; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 0px; clear: both; min-height: 1em; max-width: 100%; vertical-align: inherit; text-indent: 0em; letter-spacing: 1.5px; line-height: 1.75em; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><img src=\"/ueditor/php/upload/image/20211209/1639033946503721.jpg\" title=\"1639033946503721.jpg\" alt=\"微信图片_20211019173022.jpg\"/></p><p style=\"text-align:justify;margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 0px; clear: both; min-height: 1em; max-width: 100%; vertical-align: inherit; text-indent: 0em; letter-spacing: 1.5px; line-height: 1.75em; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;; font-size: 16px; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><br/></span></p><p style=\"text-align:justify;margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 0px; clear: both; min-height: 1em; max-width: 100%; vertical-align: inherit; text-indent: 0em; letter-spacing: 1.5px; line-height: 1.75em; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;; font-size: 16px; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; box-sizing: border-box !important;\">深耕行业30多年，秋叶原一直致力于研发与创造高标准、高性能的音视频传输产品，为消费者提供周到服务与优质体验。即使在疫情反复、原材料涨价缺货等多重因素的影响下，秋叶原仍坚定不移地打磨产品，始终以用户需求为核心，不断提高研发实力，在新硬件，新软件，新技术，新工艺，新材料等全方位多方面不断探索，推出多款集尖端技术与科技体验于一身的智音视频传输产品，高度契合当下年轻家居主流消费人群的生活理念与消费习惯，为消费者带来更智能、便捷、安全、高效的传输体验。</span></p><p style=\"text-align:justify;margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 0px; clear: both; min-height: 1em; max-width: 100%; vertical-align: inherit; text-indent: 0em; letter-spacing: 1.5px; line-height: 1.75em; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;; font-size: 16px; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><br/></span></p><p style=\"text-align: center; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 0px; clear: both; min-height: 1em; max-width: 100%; vertical-align: inherit; text-indent: 0em; letter-spacing: 1.5px; line-height: 1.75em; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 1.5px; text-indent: 0em; caret-color: red;\"><img src=\"http://www.choseal.cn/ueditor/php/upload/image/20211209/1639033974632970.jpg\" title=\"1639033974632970.jpg\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 17px; text-align: center; white-space: normal;\"/></span></p><p style=\"text-align:justify;margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 0px; clear: both; min-height: 1em; max-width: 100%; vertical-align: inherit; text-indent: 0em; letter-spacing: 1.5px; line-height: 1.75em; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 1.5px; text-indent: 0em; caret-color: red;\"></span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"/ueditor/php/upload/image/20211209/1639033974803764.jpg\" style=\"\" title=\"1639033974803764.jpg\"/></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><br/></p><p style=\"text-align:justify;margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 0px; clear: both; min-height: 1em; max-width: 100%; vertical-align: inherit; text-indent: 0em; letter-spacing: 1.5px; line-height: 1.75em; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 1.5px; text-indent: 0em; caret-color: red;\">不忘初心，砥砺前行！</span><span style=\"color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 1.5px; text-indent: 0em; caret-color: red;\">未来，秋叶原智能音视频传输产品将更加坚定不移地把产品新体验和客户满意度放首位，推出更多品类、更高品质、更加智能、更具性价比的智能音视频传输产品，不断提升和完善音视频智能传输服务体系，满足广大消费者需求，继续以科技和服务创造美好生活的美好愿景而不懈努力。</span><br/></p></section></section></section>', 1, 0, 10, 255, '2021-12-09 15:13:59', '2021-12-09 15:13:59', '2021-12-09 15:13:59', '2023-07-21 13:48:24', '/upload/image/20211209/61b1ac937e912.png', 'null', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'PC', 'zh-CN');
INSERT INTO `news` (`id`, `news_cate_id`, `title`, `short_title`, `content`, `admin_id`, `count`, `is_show`, `sort`, `start_time`, `end_time`, `create_at`, `update_at`, `pic`, `pics`, `seo_title`, `seo_keyword`, `seo_description`, `platform`, `lang`) VALUES
(229, 24, '【科普】想看8K电视需要满足哪些条件', '助人为乐、博爱奉献”--- 秋叶原爱心基金正式成立！', '<p data-track=\"1\" data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 1.5px;\"><span style=\"color: #3F3F3F; --tt-darkmode-color: #A3A3A3;\">电视作为日常化的一种用品，从黑白到彩色，从电子管、晶体管电视迅速发展到集成电路电视，到如今的智能化，从以前的2K到现在家庭常用的4K和逐渐走入大众视野的8K电视，这究竟是一段怎样的发展历程呢？</span></span></p><p data-track=\"2\"><br/></p><p data-track=\"3\"><strong>电视发展历程</strong></p><p data-track=\"4\"><br/></p><p data-track=\"5\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>1925年：电视机雏形</strong></p><p data-track=\"5\"><strong><br/></strong></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"/ueditor/php/upload/image/20211213/1639358793905111.jpg\" title=\"1639358793905111.jpg\" alt=\"1.webp.jpg\"/></p><div class=\"pgc-img\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><a></a></div><p data-track=\"6\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong><br/></strong></p><p data-track=\"6\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>1939-第一台黑白电视机</strong></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><br/></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"/ueditor/php/upload/image/20211213/1639358808751046.jpg\" title=\"1639358808751046.jpg\" alt=\"2.webp.jpg\"/></p><p><br/></p><div class=\"pgc-img\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><a></a></div><p data-track=\"7\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>1954年-第一台彩色电视</strong></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><br/></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"/ueditor/php/upload/image/20211213/1639358820894584.jpg\" title=\"1639358820894584.jpg\" alt=\"3.webp.jpg\"/></p><div class=\"pgc-img\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><a></a></div><p data-track=\"8\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 1px;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #333333; --tt-darkmode-color: #A3A3A3;\"><br/></span></strong></span></p><p data-track=\"8\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 1px;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #333333; --tt-darkmode-color: #A3A3A3;\">1958年：中国第一台黑白电视机</span></strong></span></p><p data-track=\"8\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 1px;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #333333; --tt-darkmode-color: #A3A3A3;\"><br/></span></strong></span></p><p data-track=\"8\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"/ueditor/php/upload/image/20211213/1639358830614934.jpg\" title=\"1639358830614934.jpg\" alt=\"4.webp.jpg\"/></p><div class=\"pgc-img\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><a></a></div><p data-track=\"9\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 1px;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #333333; --tt-darkmode-color: #A3A3A3;\"><br/></span></strong></span></p><p data-track=\"9\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 1px;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #333333; --tt-darkmode-color: #A3A3A3;\">2008年：现代在日本首次展出消费级3D电视，46寸的E465S</span></strong></span></p><p data-track=\"9\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 1px;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #333333; --tt-darkmode-color: #A3A3A3;\"><br/></span></strong></span></p><div class=\"pgc-img\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"/ueditor/php/upload/image/20211213/1639358837969656.jpg\" title=\"1639358837969656.jpg\" alt=\"5.webp.jpg\"/><span class=\"pgc-img-caption\"></span><a></a></div><p data-track=\"10\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong><br/></strong></p><p data-track=\"10\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>2012年火起来的4K电视</strong></p><p data-track=\"10\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong><br/></strong></p><div class=\"pgc-img\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"/ueditor/php/upload/image/20211213/1639358844968735.jpg\" title=\"1639358844968735.jpg\" alt=\"6.webp.jpg\"/><span class=\"pgc-img-caption\"></span><a></a></div><p data-track=\"11\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong><br/></strong></p><p data-track=\"11\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>2014年：世界首款105寸曲面UHD电视开辟新纪元</strong></p><p data-track=\"11\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong><br/></strong></p><div class=\"pgc-img\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"/ueditor/php/upload/image/20211213/1639358852959552.jpg\" title=\"1639358852959552.jpg\" alt=\"7.webp.jpg\"/><span class=\"pgc-img-caption\"></span><a></a></div><p data-track=\"12\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong><br/></strong></p><p data-track=\"12\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>如今热度有增无减的8K电视</strong></p><p data-track=\"12\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong><br/></strong></p><div class=\"pgc-img\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"/ueditor/php/upload/image/20211213/1639358859114156.jpg\" title=\"1639358859114156.jpg\" alt=\"8.webp.jpg\"/><a></a></div><p data-track=\"13\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 1.5px;\"><span style=\"color: #3F3F3F; --tt-darkmode-color: #A3A3A3;\"><br/></span></span></p><p data-track=\"13\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 1.5px;\"><span style=\"color: #3F3F3F; --tt-darkmode-color: #A3A3A3;\">8K 视频传输技术代表着如今视频画质发展的巅峰，也是国家大力扶持的项目。大型赛事转播、巨幕影院、家用彩电等场景近些年都逐步引入了 8K 技术，8K 超大分辨率视频，正在悄无声息<typo id=\"typo-360\" data-origin=\"的\" ignoretag=\"true\">的</typo>走进我们的生活。</span></span></p><p data-track=\"14\"><br/></p><p data-track=\"15\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 1.5px;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #3F3F3F; --tt-darkmode-color: #A3A3A3;\">那么，想看8K电视需要满足哪些条件呢？</span></strong></span></p><p data-track=\"16\"><br/></p><p data-track=\"17\"><strong>1. </strong>8K电视分辨率</p><p data-track=\"18\"><br/></p><p data-track=\"19\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 1px;\"><span style=\"color: #333333; --tt-darkmode-color: #A3A3A3;\">4K分辨率为3840x2160，</span>8K分辨率是7680x4320，也就是4K的4倍。电视屏幕分辨率越高意味着画面清晰度越高，可观察到的细节也更多，视觉观感就更好。</span></p><p data-track=\"20\"><br/></p><div class=\"pgc-img\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"/ueditor/php/upload/image/20211213/1639358895478995.jpg\" title=\"1639358895478995.jpg\" alt=\"640.webp.jpg\"/><span class=\"pgc-img-caption\"></span><a></a></div><p data-track=\"21\"><br/></p><p data-track=\"22\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 1px;\"><span style=\"color: #3F3F3F; --tt-darkmode-color: #A3A3A3;\">在2019年，美国消费者技术协会公布了8K电视的标准：</span></span>显示分辨率至少达到 7680 x 4320，提供至少一个支持 8K 分辨率的 HDMI 2.1 接口。<span style=\"color: #3F3F3F; --tt-darkmode-color: #A3A3A3;\">同时保证色彩深度为 10bit，支持 24P、30P 和 60P 三种帧速<typo id=\"typo-612\" data-origin=\"速率\" ignoretag=\"true\">速率</typo>等等要求</span>。</p><p data-track=\"23\"><br/></p><p data-track=\"24\"><strong>2. </strong>8K电视内容</p><p data-track=\"25\"><br/></p><p data-track=\"26\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 1px;\"><span style=\"color: #3F3F3F; --tt-darkmode-color: #A3A3A3;\">有了8K电视，想要看到真正的8K内容还是非常困难的。8K是一条完整的产业链，从上游8K片源拍摄到8K内容编辑存储传输、解码，到最终的8K内容播放，目前的8K更需要内容上的布局，有血有肉才能成为真正意义上的8K生态。</span></span></p><p data-track=\"27\"><br/></p><div class=\"pgc-img\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"/ueditor/php/upload/image/20211213/1639358924443326.jpg\" title=\"1639358924443326.jpg\" alt=\"O1CN01Dob2VF1n0PiYEx7Qp_!!398685027.jpg\"/><span class=\"pgc-img-caption\"></span><a></a></div><p data-track=\"28\"><br/></p><p data-track=\"29\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 1.5px;\"><span style=\"color: #3F3F3F; --tt-darkmode-color: #A3A3A3;\">如今很多数码设备均已支持8K,比如搭载RTX 30系显卡的笔记本电脑，佳能、索尼的相机/摄像机，创维、海信、三星等品牌8K电视，戴尔8K显示器等等。</span></span></p><p data-track=\"30\"><br/></p><p data-track=\"32\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 1.5px;\"><span style=\"color: #3F3F3F; --tt-darkmode-color: #A3A3A3;\">甚至在手机端，小米、一加等国产品牌手机都支持拍摄8K分辨率的视频内容，越来越多的行业从业者在进行创作8K内容，未来也会有更多的普通用户将在更大的屏幕上观看浏览8K内容。</span></span></p><p data-track=\"33\"><br/></p><p data-track=\"34\"><strong>3. </strong>8K电视传输线</p><p data-track=\"35\"><br/></p><p data-track=\"36\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 1.5px;\"><span style=\"color: #3F3F3F; --tt-darkmode-color: #A3A3A3;\">在 8K 视频终端播放中，高清视频</span><strong><span style=\"color: #3F3F3F; --tt-darkmode-color: #A3A3A3;\">传输线</span></strong><span style=\"color: #3F3F3F; --tt-darkmode-color: #A3A3A3;\">作为传输介质，也起到了决定性作用。</span></span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 1px;\"><span style=\"color: #3F3F3F; --tt-darkmode-color: #A3A3A3;\">目前常用的四种视频线：DP、HDMI、DVI、VGA，只有HDMI2.1和DP1.4版本的线是支持8K传输的。</span></span></p><p data-track=\"37\"><br/></p><p data-track=\"38\"><strong>HDMI2.1高清线</strong></p><p data-track=\"38\"><strong><br/></strong></p><p data-track=\"39\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"/ueditor/php/upload/image/20211213/1639359033663802.jpg\" title=\"1639359033663802.jpg\" alt=\"O1CN01dMrSkz1n0Pb52bJZi_!!398685027.jpg\"/></p><div class=\"pgc-img\"><span class=\"pgc-img-caption\"></span><a></a></div><p data-track=\"40\"><br/></p><p data-track=\"41\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 1px;\"><span style=\"color: #3F3F3F; --tt-darkmode-color: #A3A3A3;\">HDMI2.1版本是最新的HDMI规格，支持</span></span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 1.5px;\"><span style=\"color: #3F3F3F; --tt-darkmode-color: #A3A3A3;\">8K/60HZ</span></span><span style=\"color: #3F3F3F; --tt-darkmode-color: #A3A3A3;\">、4K/120HZ</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 1px;\"><span style=\"color: #3F3F3F; --tt-darkmode-color: #A3A3A3;\">分辨率传输，最大支持48Gbps的速率运行，同时还支持动态高动态范围HDR、自动低延迟模式(ALLM）、快速媒体切换(QMS）、快速画面传输(QFT）、增强音频回传(EARC）、</span></span><span style=\"color: #3F3F3F; --tt-darkmode-color: #A3A3A3;\">可变更新速率（VRR）等。</span></p><p data-track=\"42\"><br/></p><p data-track=\"43\"><strong>DP1.4高清线</strong></p><p data-track=\"44\"><br/></p><div class=\"pgc-img\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"/ueditor/php/upload/image/20211213/1639358965993597.jpg\" title=\"1639358965993597.jpg\" alt=\"O1CN01latyhh1n0PiV19OzU_!!398685027.jpg\"/><span class=\"pgc-img-caption\"></span><a></a></div><p data-track=\"45\"><br/></p><p data-track=\"46\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 1.5px;\"><span style=\"color: #3F3F3F; --tt-darkmode-color: #A3A3A3;\">32.4Gbps高带宽传输，</span></span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 1px;\"><span style=\"color: #3F3F3F; --tt-darkmode-color: #A3A3A3;\">满足8K@60Hz、4K@144Hz、2K@165Hz多种刷新率，消除画质撕裂，让画面清晰动人，玩游戏制霸全场。</span></span></p><p data-track=\"47\"><br/></p><p data-track=\"48\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 1.5px;\"><span style=\"color: #3F3F3F; --tt-darkmode-color: #A3A3A3;\">所以大家在选择 8K 视频时也不要买错传输线材啦~</span></span></p><p><br/></p><p><br/></p>', 1, 0, 10, 255, '2021-12-13 10:28:23', '2021-12-13 10:28:23', '2021-12-13 10:28:23', '2023-07-21 13:48:24', '/upload/image/20211213/61b6afc1dfb6e.jpeg', 'null', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'PC', 'zh-CN'),
(230, 24, '【科普】同屏和投屏有什么区别', '助人为乐、博爱奉献”--- 秋叶原爱心基金正式成立！', '<section data-role=\"outer\" label=\"Powered by 135editor.com\"><section style=\"outline: 0px; letter-spacing: 0.544px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); line-height: 1.75em; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Arial, sans-serif; height: 0px; overflow: hidden;\" data-mpa-powered-by=\"yiban.io\"></section><section data-role=\"paragraph\" style=\"font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, Arial, sans-serif;\" class=\"\"><section style=\"vertical-align: inherit; outline: 0px; line-height: 1.75em; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Arial, sans-serif;\" class=\"\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 1px; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Emoji Symbols Font&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;\">手机屏幕小娱乐不尽兴，日常<span style=\"caret-color: red;\">信息共享需求日趋增多，会议简便高效的分享方式成大势所趋，通过同屏或投屏的方式<span style=\"outline: 0px;\">将手机、平板的内容同步推送到大屏电视、投影仪等显示设备上</span><span style=\"outline: 0px; max-inline-size: 100%; cursor: text;\">，就可以<span style=\"outline: 0px;\">改写过往观看体验，共享</span>放大精彩。</span></span></span></section><section style=\"vertical-align: inherit; outline: 0px; line-height: 1.75em; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Arial, sans-serif;\" class=\"\"><p style=\"outline: 0px; max-inline-size: 100%; cursor: text; caret-color: red; letter-spacing: 1px; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Emoji Symbols Font&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;\"><br/></p></section><section style=\"vertical-align: inherit; outline: 0px; line-height: 1.75em; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Arial, sans-serif;\" class=\"\"><span style=\"caret-color: red; letter-spacing: 1px; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Emoji Symbols Font&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;\">那么同屏和投屏之间有什么区别呢？</span></section><p style=\"text-align:center;vertical-align:inherit;\"></p><p style=\"vertical-align:inherit;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Emoji Symbols Font&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;\"><strong>1.</strong><strong style=\"caret-color: red;\">同屏</strong></span></p><p style=\"vertical-align:inherit;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Emoji Symbols Font&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;\"><strong style=\"caret-color: red;\"><br/></strong></span></p><p style=\"vertical-align: inherit; outline: 0px; line-height: 1.75em; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Arial, sans-serif; text-align: center;\"><img src=\"/ueditor/php/upload/image/20211217/1639705713886843.jpg\" title=\"1639705713886843.jpg\" alt=\"5.jpg\"/></p><p style=\"vertical-align: inherit; outline: 0px; line-height: 1.75em; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Arial, sans-serif;\"><br/></p></section><section data-role=\"paragraph\" style=\"font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, Arial, sans-serif;\"><section style=\"vertical-align: inherit;line-height: 1.75em;\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; letter-spacing: 1px; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Emoji Symbols Font&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;\">同屏是手机和显示器播放的内容一样，手机显示什么界面，显示器就显示什么界面，手机的操作会对显示器投放的画面产生直接的影响。</span></section></section><section data-role=\"paragraph\" style=\"font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, Arial, sans-serif;\"><section style=\"vertical-align: inherit;line-height: 1.75em;\"><br/></section></section><section data-role=\"paragraph\" style=\"font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, Arial, sans-serif;\" class=\"\"><p style=\"vertical-align:inherit;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Emoji Symbols Font&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;\"><strong>2.</strong><strong style=\"caret-color: red;\">投屏</strong></span></p><p style=\"vertical-align: inherit;line-height: 1.75em;\"><br/></p><p style=\"vertical-align: inherit; line-height: 1.75em; text-align: center;\"><img src=\"/ueditor/php/upload/image/20211217/1639705731576368.jpg\" title=\"1639705731576368.jpg\" alt=\"4.jpg\"/></p><p style=\"vertical-align: inherit;line-height: 1.75em;\"><br/></p></section><section data-role=\"paragraph\" style=\"font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, Arial, sans-serif;\"><section style=\"vertical-align: inherit;line-height: 1.75em;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 1px; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Emoji Symbols Font&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">投屏是手机将需要分享的内容投射到显示设备<span style=\"max-inline-size: 100%; cursor: text; caret-color: red;\">后，</span><span style=\"max-inline-size: 100%; cursor: text; caret-color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">不影响发送端做其他操作，让你在</span></span><span style=\"caret-color: red;\">大屏观看电影的同时，</span><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">手机还可以进行</span>熄屏、聊天、浏览其它APP等操作，总之就是显示设备画面和手机画面可以分开。</span></section></section><section data-role=\"paragraph\" style=\"font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, Arial, sans-serif;\"><section style=\"vertical-align: inherit;line-height: 1.75em;\"><br/></section></section><section data-role=\"paragraph\" style=\"font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, Arial, sans-serif;\"><section data-role=\"title\" data-tools=\"135编辑器\" data-id=\"107847\" class=\"_135editor\"><section style=\"margin: 10px auto;\"><section style=\"display: flex;align-items: center;\"><section style=\"box-sizing:border-box;flex: 1 1 0%;background-color: rgb(227, 108, 9);width: 100%;height: 30px;\" data-width=\"100%\"><section style=\"letter-spacing: 1.5px; color: rgb(255, 255, 255); line-height: 30px; margin-left: 8px;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Emoji Symbols Font&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;\">什么样的设备可以满足投屏+同屏两种模式呢？</span></section></section><section style=\"box-sizing:border-box;width: 25px;height: 30px;background-color: rgb(227, 108, 9);flex-shrink: 0;overflow: hidden;\"><br/></section></section></section></section><section style=\"vertical-align: inherit;line-height: 1.75em;\"><br/></section></section><section data-role=\"paragraph\" style=\"font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, Arial, sans-serif;\"><p style=\"vertical-align: inherit; line-height: 1.75em; text-align: center;\"><img src=\"/ueditor/php/upload/image/20211217/1639705749169823.jpg\" title=\"1639705749169823.jpg\" alt=\"1.jpg\"/></p><p style=\"vertical-align: inherit;line-height: 1.75em;\"><br/></p></section><section data-role=\"paragraph\" style=\"font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, Arial, sans-serif;\" class=\"\"><section style=\"vertical-align: inherit;line-height: 1.75em;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Emoji Symbols Font&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;\"><strong><span style=\"letter-spacing: 1px; color: rgb(255, 76, 65);\">秋叶原无线同屏器</span></strong><span style=\"letter-spacing: 1px; color: rgb(63, 63, 63);\">，<span style=\"text-indent: 28px; caret-color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">4K高清画质，音画同步，全新的视觉体验，</span></span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 1px; color: rgb(255, 76, 65);\"><span style=\"text-indent: 28px; caret-color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"><strong>投</strong></span><strong>屏+同屏</strong></span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 1px; color: rgb(63, 63, 63);\">两种模式都能满足<span style=\"outline: 0px; caret-color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">。</span><strong><span style=\"outline: 0px; caret-color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"></span></strong></span></span></section><section style=\"vertical-align: inherit;line-height: 1.75em;\"><br/></section><p style=\"vertical-align:inherit;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Emoji Symbols Font&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;\">&nbsp;投屏+同屏二合一&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"vertical-align: inherit;line-height: 1.75em;\"><br/></p><p style=\"vertical-align: inherit; line-height: 1.75em; text-align: center;\"><img src=\"/ueditor/php/upload/image/20211217/1639705764943314.jpg\" title=\"1639705764943314.jpg\" alt=\"3.jpg\"/></p><p style=\"vertical-align: inherit;line-height: 1.75em;\"><br/></p><section style=\"vertical-align: inherit;line-height: 1.75em;\" class=\"\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 1px; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Emoji Symbols Font&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"outline: 0px; caret-color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">操作简单，<span style=\"outline: 0px; text-indent: 28px;\">可支持的设备和系统更多</span>，<span style=\"outline: 0px; text-indent: 28px;\">适用范围更广</span>，只需显示设备上有HDMI接口（如<span style=\"outline: 0px; text-indent: 28px;\">电视、显示器、投影仪</span>等），就能将手机、平板的内容无延迟、高清传输到显示器上</span><span style=\"max-inline-size: 100%; cursor: text; caret-color: rgb(255, 0, 0); text-indent: 28px;\">，汽车也能用。</span></span></section><section style=\"vertical-align: inherit;line-height: 1.75em;\" class=\"\"><br/></section><section style=\"vertical-align: inherit;line-height: 1.75em;\" class=\"\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 1px; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Emoji Symbols Font&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"max-inline-size: 100%; cursor: text; caret-color: rgb(255, 0, 0); text-indent: 28px;\">外观小巧精致，不论出差办公、家用玩游戏，<span style=\"outline: 0px;\">都可以随身携带进行投屏</span>。</span><span style=\"text-indent: 28px; caret-color: red;\">最重要的是手机连接同屏器自带的WIFI，可以保证投屏的高清画质和高稳定性。</span></span></section><section style=\"vertical-align: inherit;line-height: 1.75em;\" class=\"\"><br/></section><section style=\"vertical-align: inherit;line-height: 1.75em;\" class=\"\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 1px; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Emoji Symbols Font&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"caret-color: red;\">无线同屏器技术为用户生活增添了崭新的科技元素，在家庭智能化、办公智能化不断发展的今天，在手游遍地开花的年代，“游戏党”放纵不羁爱与众不同，小屏转大屏似乎成了潮流标配，</span>购置一台秋叶原无线同屏器，将快乐与分享融汇其中，全家共享！</span></section></section></section>', 1, 0, 10, 255, '2021-12-17 09:49:55', '2021-12-17 09:49:55', '2021-12-17 09:49:55', '2023-07-21 13:48:24', '/upload/image/20211217/61bbecbd2f2b2.jpeg', 'null', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'PC', 'zh-CN'),
(231, 27, '“数智新时代 安防新机遇”——热烈祝贺广东前海秋叶原集团董事长孙逸楷先生获评“安防工匠人物”', '助人为乐、博爱奉献”--- 秋叶原爱心基金正式成立！', '<section data-role=\"outer\" label=\"Powered by 135editor.com\" class=\"\"><section data-role=\"paragraph\" class=\"\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><p style=\"text-align:center;vertical-align: inherit;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"><strong>热烈祝贺</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center;vertical-align: inherit;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"><strong>广东前海秋叶原集团董事长孙逸楷先生</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center;vertical-align: inherit;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"><strong>荣获第三届“安防工匠人物”称号</strong></span></p><p style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"><strong><br/></strong></span></p><img src=\"/ueditor/php/upload/image/20211226/1640526618455475.jpg\" title=\"1640526618455475.jpg\" alt=\"11.jpg\"/><p style=\"vertical-align:inherit;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"><strong><br/></strong></span></p><p style=\"vertical-align:inherit;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"><strong>广东前海秋叶原集团</strong></span></p><p style=\"vertical-align:inherit;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"><strong>荣获第四届“智慧安防优秀解决方案”奖</strong></span></p><p style=\"vertical-align:inherit;\"><br/></p></section><p style=\"text-align:justify;vertical-align: inherit;letter-spacing: 1.5px;line-height: 1.5em;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\">2021年12月26日，全球第一安防展——第十八届中国国际公共安全博览会在深圳会展中心盛大开幕。大会同期举办了由<span style=\"letter-spacing: 2px;text-align: left;\">CPSE安博会组委会、国家安全防范报警系统产品质量监督检验中心(北京)、CPS中安网支持，深圳市安全防范行业协会、佛山市三水区经济和科技促进局、佛山市三水区淼才投资有限公司共同主办，</span></span><span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: rgb(255, 76, 65); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"><strong>广东前海秋叶原集团、</strong></span><span style=\"font-size: 14px; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\">广东兆邦智能科技股份有限公司等</span><span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); letter-spacing: 2px; text-align: left; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\">协办的</span><span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: rgb(255, 76, 65); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"><strong>“第五届中国安防系统集成商高峰会”。</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:justify;vertical-align: inherit;letter-spacing: 1.5px;line-height: 1.5em;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: rgb(255, 76, 65); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"><strong><br/></strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align: center; vertical-align: inherit; letter-spacing: 1.5px; line-height: 1.5em;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: rgb(255, 76, 65); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"><strong><img src=\"/ueditor/php/upload/image/20211226/1640526632152530.jpg\" title=\"1640526632152530.jpg\" alt=\"22.jpg\"/></strong></span></p><section data-role=\"title\" data-tools=\"135编辑器\" data-id=\"106342\" class=\"_135editor\"><section style=\"text-align: center;margin: 10px auto;\"><section style=\"display: inline-block;\"><section data-brushtype=\"text\" style=\"letter-spacing: 1.5px; color: rgb(248, 69, 65); padding-right: 10px; padding-left: 10px; box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"vertical-align: inherit;line-height: 1.5em;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Emoji Symbols Font&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;\"><strong>安防工匠人物</strong></span></p></section><section style=\"box-sizing:border-box;width: 100%;height: 1px;background-color: #f96a67;margin-top: 3px;margin-bottom: 3px;overflow: hidden;\" data-width=\"100%\"><br/></section><section data-brushtype=\"text\" style=\"font-size: 12px;letter-spacing: 3.1px;color: #f84541;\" hm_fix=\"354:446\"><p style=\"vertical-align:inherit;letter-spacing: 1.5px;line-height: 1.5em;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Emoji Symbols Font&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;\">广东前海秋叶原集团董事长孙逸楷树立典范</span></p></section></section></section></section><p style=\"text-align:justify;vertical-align: inherit;letter-spacing: 1.5px;line-height: 1.5em;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\">会上颁布了第三届“安防工匠人物”、第四届“智慧安防优秀解决方案”、以及首届“中国安防创新力企业”获奖名单。</span><span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: rgb(255, 76, 65); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"><strong>广东前海秋叶原集团董事长孙逸楷先生荣获第三届“安防工匠人物”称号、<strong>广东前海秋叶原集团</strong>荣获第四届“智慧安防优秀解决方案”奖。</strong></span><span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\">广东前海秋叶原集团副总裁庞云杰先生、广东前海秋叶原集团董事长助理罗明亮先生应邀分别代表广东前海秋叶原集团董事长孙逸楷先生出席作主题演讲并接收奖项。</span><br/></p><p style=\"text-align:justify;vertical-align: inherit;letter-spacing: 1.5px;line-height: 1.5em;\"><br/></p><p style=\"text-align: center; vertical-align: inherit; letter-spacing: 1.5px; line-height: 1.5em;\"><img src=\"/ueditor/php/upload/image/20211226/1640526659465037.jpg\" title=\"1640526659465037.jpg\" alt=\"33.jpg\"/></p><p style=\"text-align:center;vertical-align:inherit;white-space: normal;\"><br/></p><section style=\"white-space: normal;text-align: center;vertical-align: inherit;letter-spacing: 1.5px;line-height: normal;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12px; color: rgb(255, 76, 65); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\">广东前海秋叶原集团董事长助理罗明亮先生上台</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12px;color: #FF4C41;\">代领奖</span></strong></section><section style=\"white-space: normal;text-align: center;vertical-align: inherit;letter-spacing: 1.5px;line-height: normal;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12px;color: #FF4C41;\">（左三）</span></strong></section><section style=\"white-space: normal;text-align: center;vertical-align: inherit;letter-spacing: 1.5px;line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(248, 69, 65); font-size: 12px; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"></span></section><p style=\"text-align:justify;vertical-align: inherit;letter-spacing: 1.5px;line-height: 1.5em;\"><br/></p><p style=\"text-align:justify;vertical-align: inherit;letter-spacing: 1.5px;line-height: 1.5em;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\">工匠精神一词，于2016年李克强总理在《政府工作报告》中首次提出，并随着近年来在习近平总书记和党中央的倡导下，逐渐形成热潮，这也让安防行业重新思考工匠精神真实意义。</span></p><p style=\"vertical-align:inherit;\"><br/></p><p style=\"text-align:justify;vertical-align: inherit;letter-spacing: 1.5px;line-height: 1.5em;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\">为了树立典范、培育工匠人才，深圳市安全防范行业协会从“责任担当”、“精益求精”、“执着坚守”、“创新突破”等四个维度进行评选。</span></p><p style=\"text-align:justify;vertical-align: inherit;letter-spacing: 1.5px;line-height: 1.5em;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"><br/></span></p><p style=\"vertical-align: inherit; text-align: center;\"><img src=\"http://www.choseal.cn/ueditor/php/upload/image/20211226/1640526681244443.jpg\" title=\"1640526681244443.jpg\" alt=\"44.jpg\" style=\"white-space: normal;\"/></p><p style=\"text-align:justify;vertical-align: inherit;letter-spacing: 1.5px;line-height: 1.5em;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"><br/></span></p><p style=\"text-align:justify;vertical-align: inherit;letter-spacing: 1.5px;line-height: 1.5em;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\">广东前海秋叶原集团董事长孙逸楷先生作为致敬改革改革开放40年·中国安防卓越人物、<span style=\"caret-color: red;\">“中国兵工学会军工安防安防研究院”深圳分院院长、“军工安防产业联盟”副理事长、中国公共安全行业协会副会长、中国电线电缆行业协会副会长，在<span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.544px;text-indent: 30px;\">本次评选中凭借卓越的创新能力和对项目精益求精的品质脱颖而出，荣获</span></span></span><strong><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.544px; text-indent: 30px; caret-color: red; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(255, 76, 65); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\">“安防工匠人物”</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px; caret-color: red; letter-spacing: 0.544px; text-indent: 30px; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\">荣誉称号。</span></p><p style=\"text-align:justify;vertical-align: inherit;letter-spacing: 1.5px;line-height: 1.5em;\"><br/></p><p style=\"vertical-align: inherit; text-align: center;\"><img src=\"/ueditor/php/upload/image/20211226/1640526696543622.jpg\" title=\"1640526696543622.jpg\" alt=\"55.jpg\"/></p><p style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><br/></p><section data-role=\"title\" data-tools=\"135编辑器\" data-id=\"106342\" class=\"_135editor\"><section style=\"text-align: center;margin: 10px auto;\"><section style=\"display: inline-block;\"><section data-brushtype=\"text\" style=\"letter-spacing: 1.5px; color: rgb(248, 69, 65); padding-right: 10px; padding-left: 10px; box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"vertical-align: inherit;line-height: 1.5em;\"><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"><strong>智慧安防优秀解决方案</strong></span></p></section><section style=\"box-sizing:border-box;width: 100%;height: 1px;background-color: rgb(249, 106, 103);margin-top: 3px;margin-bottom: 3px;overflow: hidden;\" data-width=\"100%\"><br/></section><section data-brushtype=\"text\" style=\"font-size: 12px;letter-spacing: 3.1px;color: rgb(248, 69, 65);\" hm_fix=\"354:446\"><p style=\"vertical-align:inherit;letter-spacing: 1.5px;line-height: 1.5em;\"><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\">秋叶原打造智慧城市新生态</span></p></section></section></section></section><section data-role=\"paragraph\"><p style=\"vertical-align:inherit;\"><br/></p><p style=\"vertical-align: inherit; text-align: center;\"><img src=\"/ueditor/php/upload/image/20211226/1640526715882382.jpg\" title=\"1640526715882382.jpg\" alt=\"669.jpg\"/></p><p style=\"vertical-align:inherit;\"><br/></p><p style=\"vertical-align:inherit;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: 1.5px; text-indent: 0em; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\">广东前海秋叶原集团是一家以线缆生态链、产业园投资运营与互联网+布局，集研发、生产、销售及园区运营服务于一体的国家级高新技术企业集团，“Choseal秋叶原”是中国驰名商标，主营智能工程线缆、高品质影音线缆、IT数码周边配套智能连接产品，为“现代品味生活、智能家居以及智慧城市”用户提供工程项目系统集成解决方案以及上下游产品供应服务，旗下深圳市秋叶原实业有限公司2021年入选深圳500强企业榜单第96位！</span><br/></p></section><section data-role=\"paragraph\"><p style=\"text-align:justify;vertical-align: inherit;text-indent: 0em;letter-spacing: 1.5px;line-height: 1.5em;\"><br/></p></section><section data-role=\"paragraph\"><p style=\"text-align:center;vertical-align:inherit;\"><br/></p><p style=\"vertical-align: inherit; text-align: center;\"><img src=\"/ueditor/php/upload/image/20211226/1640526729432873.jpg\" title=\"1640526729432873.jpg\" alt=\"77.jpg\"/></p></section><section data-role=\"paragraph\"><p style=\"text-align:justify;vertical-align: inherit;letter-spacing: 1.5px;line-height: 1.5em;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"><br/></span></p><p style=\"text-align:justify;vertical-align: inherit;letter-spacing: 1.5px;line-height: 1.5em;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\">在此次评选中，秋叶原</span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: rgb(255, 76, 65); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\">“工程项目系统集成解决方案”</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\">成功斩获</span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: rgb(255, 76, 65); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\">“智慧安防优秀解决方案”</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\">大奖，扩大了对安防行业应用解决方案宣传推广，为行业用户选择产品、方案提供决策依据。</span></p></section><section data-role=\"paragraph\"><p style=\"vertical-align:inherit;\"><br/></p><p style=\"vertical-align: inherit; text-align: center;\"><img src=\"/ueditor/php/upload/image/20211226/1640526742719680.jpg\" title=\"1640526742719680.jpg\" alt=\"88.jpg\"/></p><p style=\"vertical-align:inherit;\"><br/></p><p style=\"text-align:center;vertical-align:inherit;\"><br/></p><section style=\"white-space: normal;text-align: center;vertical-align: inherit;letter-spacing: 1.5px;line-height: normal;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12px; color: rgb(255, 76, 65); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\">广东前海秋叶原集团董事长助理罗明亮先生上台</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12px;color: #FF4C41;\">领奖</span></strong></section><section style=\"white-space: normal;text-align: center;vertical-align: inherit;letter-spacing: 1.5px;line-height: normal;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12px;color: #FF4C41;\">（右二）</span></strong></section><p style=\"vertical-align:inherit;\"><br/></p></section><section data-role=\"paragraph\"><p style=\"text-align:justify;vertical-align: inherit;letter-spacing: 1.5px;line-height: 1.5em;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 1.8px; text-indent: 28px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\">这两项荣誉的获得是安防行业对秋叶原综合实力、自主研发能力和匠心精神的高度认可。接下来，秋叶原将<span style=\"outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;text-align: left;text-indent: 34px;letter-spacing: 1px;background: #FFFFFF;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">全力</span><span style=\"outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;text-align: left;text-indent: 34px;letter-spacing: 1px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">加强</span><span style=\"outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;text-align: left;text-indent: 2em;letter-spacing: 1px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">前沿科技领域研发，持续</span><span style=\"outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;text-align: left;text-indent: 2em;letter-spacing: 1px;background: #FFFFFF;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">为全球用户提供智慧安防、智慧城市、智能家居、大数据和互联网运营产品及解决方案，<span style=\"letter-spacing: 1.8px;text-align: justify;caret-color: #FF0000;\">紧跟前沿科技，积极拓展安防领域多样化解决方案，持续为客户提供更优质的安防服务。</span></span></span></p><p style=\"text-align:justify;vertical-align: inherit;letter-spacing: 1.5px;line-height: 1.5em;\"><br/></p><p style=\"text-align:center;vertical-align:inherit;\"><br/></p><p style=\"text-align: center; vertical-align: inherit; letter-spacing: 1.5px; line-height: 1.5em;\"><img src=\"/ueditor/php/upload/image/20211226/1640526750318244.jpg\" title=\"1640526750318244.jpg\" alt=\"99.jpg\"/></p></section><section data-role=\"paragraph\"><section style=\"vertical-align: inherit;text-align: center;line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"color: #FF4C41;letter-spacing: 0.5px;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\"><span style=\"outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; text-align: left; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Emoji Symbols Font&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;\">广东前海秋叶原集团副总裁</span><span style=\"text-align: left; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Emoji Symbols Font&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;\">庞云杰先生</span></span></strong></span></section><section style=\"vertical-align: inherit;text-align: center;line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"color: #FF4C41;letter-spacing: 0.5px;\"><strong><span style=\"letter-spacing: 2px; text-align: left; font-size: 12px; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Emoji Symbols Font&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;\">作主题演讲</span></strong></span></section></section><section data-role=\"paragraph\"><p style=\"text-align:justify;vertical-align: inherit;letter-spacing: 1.5px;line-height: 1.5em;\"><br/></p></section><section data-role=\"paragraph\"><p style=\"text-align:justify;vertical-align: inherit;letter-spacing: 1.5px;line-height: 1.5em;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\">会上，<span style=\"outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;letter-spacing: 2px;text-align: left;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">广东前海秋叶原集团副总裁</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 2px;text-align: left;\">庞云杰先生作了《秋叶原“产业科技+科创服务”&amp;双轮驱动 — 迎接新机遇》主题演讲。表示在</span></span><strong><span style=\"letter-spacing: 2px; text-align: left; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(255, 76, 65); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\">产业科技</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 2px;text-align: left;\">总体战略方面<span style=\"caret-color: #FF0000;\">秋叶原</span>将</span><span style=\"caret-color: red;\">以声光视讯连接线产品专业化优势发展为核心，以组织相关多元化扩张，充分发挥营销全渠道优势及创新，通过价值链一体化的成本优化和效率提升，品牌和全场景连接业务创新战略牵引，以“减法、加法、乘法、变法”四位一体业务模式来构建行业领导品牌地位。通过数字化建设搭建企业组织综合运营平台。</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align:justify;vertical-align: inherit;letter-spacing: 1.5px;line-height: 1.5em;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"caret-color: red;\"><br/></span></span></p></section><section data-role=\"paragraph\"><p style=\"vertical-align:inherit;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: 1.5px; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\">在</span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: 1.5px; color: rgb(255, 76, 65); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\">科创服务</span></strong><span style=\"color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: 1.5px; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\">方面将</span><span style=\"color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: 2px; white-space: pre-wrap; caret-color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\">重点打造新的现代化智慧工业园区，进行产业园投资、运营管理及服务于实体经济的平台打造，运营 “梦科园”系列新兴产业园及产业综合体项目。</span><br/></p></section><section data-role=\"paragraph\"><p style=\"vertical-align:inherit;\"><br/></p><h1 title=\"↑↓←→箭头符号怎么打出来↗\" style=\"font-size: 30px; text-align: center; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: &quot;Microsoft Yahei&quot;, 微软雅黑, arial, 宋体, sans-serif;\">↓↓↓</h1></section><section data-role=\"paragraph\"><p style=\"text-align:center; vertical-align: inherit; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; line-height: 1.5em; letter-spacing: 1.5px; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-size: 15px; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"><strong style=\"outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">湾区智造梦工厂</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center; vertical-align: inherit; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; line-height: 1.5em; letter-spacing: 1.5px; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-size: 15px; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"><strong style=\"outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><span style=\"outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">约</span></strong><strong style=\"outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><span style=\"outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">20</span></strong><strong style=\"outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><span style=\"outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">00—3</span></strong><strong style=\"outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><span style=