07.jpg\"/></p></section></section>', 1, 0, 10, 255, '2021-12-26 21:55:06', '2021-12-26 21:55:06', '2021-12-26 21:55:06', '2023-07-21 13:48:24', '/upload/image/20211226/61c8741d7e3c5.jpeg', '[]', '', '', '', 'PC', 'zh-CN');
INSERT INTO `news` (`id`, `news_cate_id`, `title`, `short_title`, `content`, `admin_id`, `count`, `is_show`, `sort`, `start_time`, `end_time`, `create_at`, `update_at`, `pic`, `pics`, `seo_title`, `seo_keyword`, `seo_description`, `platform`, `lang`) VALUES
(232, 27, '秋叶原实力吸睛安博展与高交会两大盛会！', '助人为乐、博爱奉献”--- 秋叶原爱心基金正式成立！', '<section data-role=\"outer\" label=\"Powered by 135editor.com\"><section data-role=\"paragraph\" style=\"font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, Arial, sans-serif;\" data-mpa-powered-by=\"yiban.io\"><p style=\"text-align: justify; vertical-align: inherit; line-height: 1.5em; letter-spacing: 1.5px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: 2px;\">12月29日，备受关注和期待的第十八届中国国际公共安全博览会（安博会）和</span><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: 1.5px;\">第二十三届中国国际高新技术成果交易会（高交会）</span><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: 2px;\">，在全面保障防疫安全的前提下，</span><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: 2px; text-indent: 34px; caret-color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">于深圳</span><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: 2px;\">圆满落幕！</span></p></section><section data-role=\"paragraph\" style=\"font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, Arial, sans-serif;\"><p style=\"text-align:center; vertical-align: inherit; outline: 0px; letter-spacing: 1.5px; line-height: 1.5em; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Arial, sans-serif;\"><br/></p><p style=\"text-align: center; vertical-align: inherit; outline: 0px; line-height: 1.5em; letter-spacing: 1.5px; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 2px; font-size: 14px; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"><img src=\"/ueditor/php/upload/image/20211230/1640828391501993.jpg\" title=\"1640828391501993.jpg\" alt=\"1.webp.jpg\"/></span></p><section style=\"text-align: center; vertical-align: inherit; outline: 0px; letter-spacing: 1.5px; line-height: normal; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"><strong><span style=\"letter-spacing: 2px; color: rgb(255, 76, 65);\">安博会（深圳会展中心)现场</span></strong></span></section><section style=\"text-align: center; vertical-align: inherit; outline: 0px; letter-spacing: 1.5px; line-height: normal; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"><strong><span style=\"letter-spacing: 2px; color: rgb(255, 76, 65);\">12月26日-29日</span></strong></span></section><p style=\"text-align:center; vertical-align: inherit; outline: 0px; letter-spacing: 1.5px; line-height: 1.5em; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Arial, sans-serif;\"><br/></p><p style=\"text-align:center;vertical-align: inherit;line-height: 1.5em;letter-spacing: 1.5px;\"><img src=\"/ueditor/php/upload/image/20211230/1640828383229078.jpg\" title=\"1640828383229078.jpg\" alt=\"2.webp.jpg\"/></p><section style=\"text-align: center; vertical-align: inherit; outline: 0px; letter-spacing: 1.5px; line-height: normal; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Arial, sans-serif;\"><strong><span style=\"letter-spacing: 2px; font-size: 12px; color: rgb(255, 76, 65); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\">高交会(<span style=\"letter-spacing: 1.5px; background-color: rgb(255, 249, 245);\">深圳国际会展中心)</span>现场</span></strong></section><section style=\"text-align: center; vertical-align: inherit; outline: 0px; letter-spacing: 1.5px; line-height: normal; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Arial, sans-serif;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12px;color: #FF4C41;\">12月27<strong style=\"font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 1.5px; white-space: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">日</span></strong>-29日</span></strong><br/></section><p style=\"text-align:center; vertical-align: inherit; outline: 0px; letter-spacing: 1.5px; line-height: 1.5em; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Arial, sans-serif;\"><br/></p></section><p style=\"text-align:justify; vertical-align: inherit; line-height: 1.5em; letter-spacing: 1.5px; font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\">“全球安防第一展”——安博会与“中国科技第一展”——高交会，<span style=\"letter-spacing: 1px;\">两场高科技盛会第一次合体，全球瞩目，是一场精彩纷呈的高科技盛宴。在<span style=\"caret-color: #FF0000;\">这交相辉映的两场盛会中，</span><span style=\"caret-color: #FF0000;outline-style: initial;letter-spacing: 2px;\">秋叶原“硬核”科技创新产品</span><span style=\"caret-color: red;letter-spacing: 2px;\">“组团”亮相，实力“吸睛”。</span></span></span></p><p style=\"text-align:justify; outline: 0px; vertical-align: inherit; letter-spacing: 1.5px; line-height: 1.5em; font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-Light, 微软雅黑;\"><br/></p><section data-tools=\"135编辑器\" data-id=\"102380\" style=\"font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, Arial, sans-serif;\" class=\"_135editor\"><section style=\"margin: 10px auto;text-align: center;line-height: 1.5em;\"><section style=\"display: flex;justify-content: center;align-items: center;\"><section style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin-right: -10px;width: 50px;transform: rotate(0deg);-webkit-transform: rotate(0deg);-moz-transform: rotate(0deg);-ms-transform: rotate(0deg);-o-transform: rotate(0deg);\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/FIBZec7ucCiaw9iaSycyVAgWgzsOrYYsxiaGDQtGa9ClXcZRQPImhqz2XHn7fXvuXrGnlYsqYzetbmE00YTkiaPic7A/640?wx_fmt=gif\" data-type=\"gif\" data-width=\"100%\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;vertical-align: inherit;width: 100%;display: block;\" data-ratio=\"0.6865079365079365\" data-w=\"252\"/></section><section data-brushtype=\"text\" style=\"padding: 6px 1em; letter-spacing: 1.5px; color: rgb(255, 255, 255); background: rgb(252, 98, 56); border-bottom: 2px solid rgb(255, 216, 114);\"><p style=\"vertical-align: inherit;line-height: 1.5em;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 2px; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\">展会直击</span></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"vertical-align: inherit; letter-spacing: 1.5px; line-height: 1.5em; font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, Arial, sans-serif;\"><br/></section><section data-role=\"title\" data-tools=\"135编辑器\" data-id=\"107847\" style=\"font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, Arial, sans-serif;\" class=\"_135editor\"><section style=\"margin: 10px auto;\"><section style=\"display: flex;align-items: center;\"><section data-width=\"100%\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;flex: 1 1 0%;background-color: rgb(227, 108, 9);width: 100%;height: 30px;\"><section hm_fix=\"323:492\" style=\"margin-left: 8px; letter-spacing: 1.5px; color: rgb(255, 255, 255); line-height: 30px;\"><p style=\"vertical-align: inherit;line-height: 1.5em;\"><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"><strong data-brushtype=\"text\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 2px;\">第十八届中国国际公共安全博览会</span></strong></span></p></section></section><section style=\"box-sizing:border-box;width: 25px;height: 30px;background-color: rgb(227, 108, 9);flex-shrink: 0;overflow: hidden;\"><br/></section></section></section></section><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"/ueditor/php/upload/image/20211230/1640828366698570.jpg\" style=\"\" title=\"1640828366698570.jpg\"/></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"/ueditor/php/upload/image/20211230/1640828366314582.jpg\" style=\"\" title=\"1640828366314582.jpg\"/></p><p style=\"text-align:justify; vertical-align: inherit; line-height: 1.5em; letter-spacing: 1.5px; font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 2px; text-indent: 34px; caret-color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-size: 14px; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\">本届安博会以“让世界看见您”为主题，共计</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 2px; color: rgb(255, 76, 65); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"><strong><span style=\"text-indent: 34px; caret-color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-size: 14px;\">10</span></strong></span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 2px; text-indent: 34px; caret-color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-size: 14px; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\">个展馆，面积</span><span style=\"text-indent: 34px; caret-color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: 2px; color: rgb(255, 76, 65); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"><strong>11</strong></span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 2px; text-indent: 34px; caret-color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-size: 14px; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\">万平方米，</span><span style=\"text-indent: 34px; caret-color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: 2px; color: rgb(255, 76, 65); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"><strong>5736</strong></span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 2px; text-indent: 34px; caret-color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-size: 14px; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\">个标准展位，有</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 2px; color: rgb(255, 76, 65); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"><strong><span style=\"text-indent: 34px; caret-color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-size: 14px;\">1263</span></strong></span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 2px; text-indent: 34px; caret-color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-size: 14px; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\">家企业参加展览，涉及智慧城市、智能安防、大数据、人工智能、无人系统等多个领域。</span></p><p style=\"text-align:justify; outline: 0px; vertical-align: inherit; letter-spacing: 1.5px; line-height: 1.5em; font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-Light, 微软雅黑;\"><br/></p><p style=\"text-align:center; outline: 0px; vertical-align: inherit; line-height: 1.5em; letter-spacing: 1.5px; font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-Light, 微软雅黑;\"><img src=\"/ueditor/php/upload/image/20211230/1640828346940399.jpg\" title=\"1640828346940399.jpg\" alt=\"5.webp.jpg\"/></p><p style=\"text-align:justify; outline: 0px; vertical-align: inherit; letter-spacing: 1.5px; line-height: 1.5em; font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-Light, 微软雅黑;\"><br/></p><p style=\"text-align:justify; outline: 0px; vertical-align: inherit; line-height: 1.5em; letter-spacing: 1.5px; font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-Light, 微软雅黑;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: 2px; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\">预计有超过6万多种安全防范类产品，包含了智能交通、智能家居、5G、安防监控、芯片、生物识别、无人机、防盗报警、消防应急救援等20个行业。这<span style=\"caret-color: #FF0000;\">是集中展示全球安防高端智造产业发展态势的一次盛会，也是中国智造迈向国际化走向世界</span><span style=\"max-inline-size: 100%;cursor: text;caret-color: red;\">一流</span><span style=\"caret-color: #FF0000;\">的一次重要检阅。</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align:justify; outline: 0px; vertical-align: inherit; line-height: 1.5em; letter-spacing: 1.5px; font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-Light, 微软雅黑;\"><br/></p><section style=\"vertical-align: inherit; letter-spacing: 1.5px; line-height: 1.5em; font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, Arial, sans-serif;\"><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"/ueditor/php/upload/image/20211230/1640828328976384.jpg\" style=\"\" title=\"1640828328976384.jpg\"/></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"/ueditor/php/upload/image/20211230/1640828328973614.jpg\" style=\"\" title=\"1640828328973614.jpg\"/></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"/ueditor/php/upload/image/20211230/1640828328199807.jpg\" style=\"\" title=\"1640828328199807.jpg\"/></p><p style=\"text-align:center;vertical-align: inherit;line-height: 1.5em;\"><br/></p></section><section style=\"vertical-align: inherit; letter-spacing: 1.5px; line-height: 1.5em; font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, Arial, sans-serif;\"><p style=\"text-align:left;vertical-align: inherit; line-height: 1.5em;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: 2px; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\">本次展会秋叶原•梦科园智谷同步亮相，项目占位博罗沿东江经济带之核，得益于沿东江经济带千亿产业配套，畅享深圳都市圈主中心优越的区位，周边齐全的市政、产业园、学校、医院、公园、高铁、快速路配套。</span></p><p style=\"text-align:left;vertical-align: inherit; line-height: 1.5em;\"><br/></p></section><section style=\"vertical-align: inherit; letter-spacing: 1.5px; line-height: 1.5em; font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, Arial, sans-serif; text-align: center;\"><img src=\"/ueditor/php/upload/image/20211230/1640828309639099.jpg\" title=\"1640828309639099.jpg\" alt=\"9.webp.jpg\"/></section><section style=\"vertical-align: inherit; letter-spacing: 1.5px; line-height: 1.5em; font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, Arial, sans-serif;\"><br/></section><section style=\"vertical-align: inherit; letter-spacing: 1.5px; line-height: 1.5em; font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: 0.544px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.544px;\">作</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.544px;\">为秋叶原集团重</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.544px;\">点打造的代表性智能制造产业基地，力争成为粤港澳大湾区现代化科技产业园IP，以信息产业以及“智慧园区”为主导的国际工业4.0标准智能制造产业园。</span>园区构筑50年红本产权全生态产业载体，尽享秋叶原集团产业生态运营服务体系，为企业</span><span style=\"font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: 0.544px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;\">高速发展的不同时期，提供全周期解决方案，助力企业快速成长。</span><span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: 0.544px; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;\"></span></section><section style=\"vertical-align: inherit; letter-spacing: 1.5px; line-height: 1.5em; font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, Arial, sans-serif;\"><p style=\"vertical-align: inherit; font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: 0.544px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;\"><br/></p></section><p style=\"vertical-align: inherit; letter-spacing: 1.5px; line-height: 1.5em; font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, Arial, sans-serif; text-align: center;\"><img src=\"/ueditor/php/upload/image/20211230/1640828296231397.jpg\" title=\"1640828296231397.jpg\" alt=\"10.webp.jpg\"/></p><section style=\"vertical-align: inherit; letter-spacing: 1.5px; line-height: 1.5em; font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: 0.544px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;\"></span><br/></section><section style=\"vertical-align: inherit; letter-spacing: 1.5px; line-height: 1.5em; font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, Arial, sans-serif;\"><p style=\"vertical-align: inherit;line-height: 1.5em;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 2px; text-indent: 34px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\">秋叶原针对国际公共安防发展挑战，以大容量、高速率、低时延信息传输为当前传输问题核心，配套万兆高速率5G专用网线、颠覆式革新--石墨烯屏蔽HDMI线、第三代光纤复合HDMI线、系统集成配套等拳头产品及应用解决方案参加本次安防盛会，<span style=\"caret-color: #FF0000;\">面向行业客户、专业观众展示秋叶原创新领先的技术和扎实优秀的落地经验。</span></span></p></section><section style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1.5em; font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, Arial, sans-serif;\"><br/></section><section style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1.5em; font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, Arial, sans-serif;\"><p style=\"text-align:center;vertical-align: inherit; line-height: 1.5em; letter-spacing: 1.5px;\"><img src=\"/ueditor/php/upload/image/20211230/1640828287467758.jpg\" title=\"1640828287467758.jpg\" alt=\"11.webp.jpg\"/></p></section><section style=\"vertical-align: inherit; letter-spacing: 1px; line-height: 1.5em; font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, Arial, sans-serif;\"><br/></section><section style=\"vertical-align: inherit; letter-spacing: 1.5px; line-height: 1.5em; font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, Arial, sans-serif;\"><p style=\"vertical-align: inherit;line-height: 1.5em;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); letter-spacing: 2px; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\">展会现场，秋叶原凭借创新成果的领先优势以及成熟的应用解决方案，吸引众多观展者驻足，<span style=\"text-align: justify;text-indent: 30px;\">众多业内专家也到访并提出宝贵意见。</span></span></p></section><section style=\"vertical-align: inherit; letter-spacing: 1.5px; line-height: 1.5em; font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, Arial, sans-serif;\"><br/></section><section style=\"vertical-align: inherit; letter-spacing: 1.5px; line-height: 1.5em; font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, Arial, sans-serif;\"><p style=\"text-align:center;vertical-align: inherit;line-height: 1.5em;\"><img src=\"/ueditor/php/upload/image/20211230/1640828273837573.jpg\" title=\"1640828273837573.jpg\" alt=\"12.webp.jpg\"/></p></section><section style=\"vertical-align: inherit; letter-spacing: 1.5px; line-height: 1.5em; font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, Arial, sans-serif;\"><br/></section><section style=\"vertical-align: inherit; letter-spacing: 1.5px; line-height: 1.5em; font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, Arial, sans-serif;\"><p style=\"vertical-align: inherit;line-height: 1.5em;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); letter-spacing: 2px; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\">与此同时，为全面提升观展体验，在整个展位安排了专业的产品技术讲解员，及时为观众答疑解惑。</span></p></section><section data-role=\"paragraph\" style=\"font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, Arial, sans-serif;\"><section style=\"vertical-align: inherit;line-height: 1.5em;\"><br/></section></section><section data-role=\"paragraph\" style=\"font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, Arial, sans-serif;\"><section style=\"vertical-align: inherit;letter-spacing: 1.5px;line-height: 1.5em;\"><p style=\"text-align:center;vertical-align: inherit;line-height: 1.5em;\"><img src=\"/ueditor/php/upload/image/20211230/1640828255605378.jpg\" title=\"1640828255605378.jpg\" alt=\"13.webp.jpg\"/></p></section><section style=\"vertical-align: inherit;letter-spacing: 1.5px;line-height: 1.5em;\"><br/></section></section><section data-role=\"title\" data-tools=\"135编辑器\" data-id=\"107847\" style=\"font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, Arial, sans-serif;\" class=\"_135editor\"><section style=\"margin: 10px auto;\"><section style=\"display: flex;align-items: center;\"><section data-width=\"100%\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;flex: 1 1 0%;background-color: rgb(227, 108, 9);width: 100%;height: 30px;\"><section hm_fix=\"323:492\" style=\"margin-left: 8px; letter-spacing: 1.5px; color: rgb(255, 255, 255); line-height: 30px;\"><p style=\"vertical-align: inherit;line-height: 1.5em;\"><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"><strong data-brushtype=\"text\">第二十三届中国国际高交会</strong><strong data-brushtype=\"text\"></strong></span></p></section></section><section style=\"box-sizing:border-box;width: 25px;height: 30px;background-color: rgb(227, 108, 9);flex-shrink: 0;overflow: hidden;\"><br/></section></section></section></section><p style=\"text-align:center;vertical-align:inherit;\"><img src=\"/ueditor/php/upload/image/20211230/1640828163286825.jpg\" title=\"1640828163286825.jpg\" alt=\"14.webp.jpg\"/></p><section data-role=\"paragraph\" style=\"font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, Arial, sans-serif;\"><p style=\"vertical-align: inherit;line-height: 1.5em;letter-spacing: 1.5px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 2px;\">本届高交会汇聚创新资源，围绕“十三五”规划成果、“十四五”规划布局和重点发展领域，</span></span><span style=\"color: #FF4C41;\"><span style=\"outline: 0px; letter-spacing: 0.544px; font-size: 14px; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"><strong style=\"outline: 0px;\">“新时代、新经济”“碳达峰、碳中和”“专精特新‘小巨人’”“中国‘智’造”“后疫情时代”“元宇宙</strong></span><span style=\"font-size: 14px; outline: 0px; letter-spacing: 0.544px; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"><strong style=\"outline: 0px;\">”</strong></span></span><span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); letter-spacing: 0.544px; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\">等时下最热门的关键词，全面展示各类硬核科技创新产品与技术。</span></p><p style=\"vertical-align: inherit;line-height: 1.5em;letter-spacing: 1.5px;\"><br/></p></section><section data-role=\"paragraph\" style=\"font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, Arial, sans-serif;\"><p style=\"text-align:center;vertical-align: inherit;line-height: 1.5em;letter-spacing: 1.5px;\"><img src=\"/ueditor/php/upload/image/20211230/1640828154992864.jpg\" title=\"1640828154992864.jpg\" alt=\"15.webp.jpg\"/></p></section><section data-role=\"paragraph\" style=\"font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, Arial, sans-serif;\"><p style=\"text-align:center;vertical-align: inherit;line-height: 1.5em;letter-spacing: 1.5px;\"><br/></p></section><section data-role=\"paragraph\" style=\"font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, Arial, sans-serif;\"><p style=\"vertical-align: inherit;line-height: 1.5em;letter-spacing: 1.5px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); letter-spacing: 0.544px; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\">共有</span><span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: rgb(255, 76, 65); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"><strong><span style=\"outline: 0px;\">39</span></strong></span><span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); letter-spacing: 0.544px; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\">个国家参展，其中</span><span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: rgb(255, 76, 65); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"><strong><span style=\"outline: 0px; letter-spacing: 0.544px;\">13</span></strong></span><span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); letter-spacing: 0.544px; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\">个国家现场参展，</span><span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: rgb(255, 76, 65); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"><strong><span style=\"outline: 0px;\">26</span></strong></span><span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); letter-spacing: 0.544px; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\">个国家线上参展，共有超</span><span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: rgb(255, 76, 65); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"><strong><span style=\"outline: 0px; letter-spacing: 0.544px;\">1900</span></strong></span><span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); letter-spacing: 0.544px; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\">多家海内外企业同时亮相高交会线上展会，为推动高新技术国际化、共谋国际交流合作良策搭建了重要平台，也为全球科技创新注入了澎湃动力。</span></p></section><section data-role=\"paragraph\" style=\"font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, Arial, sans-serif;\"><p style=\"text-align:center;vertical-align: inherit;line-height: 1.5em;letter-spacing: 1.5px;\"><br/></p><p style=\"text-align:center;vertical-align: inherit;\"><img src=\"/ueditor/php/upload/image/20211230/1640828145384774.jpg\" title=\"1640828145384774.jpg\" alt=\"16.webp.jpg\"/></p></section><section data-role=\"paragraph\" style=\"font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, Arial, sans-serif;\"><p style=\"vertical-align: inherit;line-height: 1.5em;letter-spacing: 1.5px;\"><br/></p><p style=\"vertical-align: inherit;line-height: 1.5em;letter-spacing: 1.5px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); outline: 0px; letter-spacing: 1px; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\">秋叶原<span style=\"text-indent: 28px;caret-color: #FF0000;\">展馆</span>以</span><span style=\"caret-color: rgb(255, 0, 0); text-indent: 28px; max-inline-size: 100%; cursor: text; letter-spacing: 1px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(255, 76, 65); outline: none 0px !important; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\">“活力橙”为主调色</span><span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); caret-color: rgb(255, 0, 0); text-indent: 28px; max-inline-size: 100%; cursor: text; letter-spacing: 1px; outline: none 0px !important; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\">，馆内整齐罗列着以5G智能连接应用为首的众多智能传输领域高新科技和最新产品。超高的展区“颜值”配上极富科技感、时尚感的高科技产品，赚足眼球。</span></p></section><section data-role=\"paragraph\" style=\"font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, Arial, sans-serif;\"><p style=\"text-align:center;vertical-align: inherit;\"><br/></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"/ueditor/php/upload/image/20211230/1640828130191505.jpg\" style=\"\" title=\"1640828130191505.jpg\"/></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"/ueditor/php/upload/image/20211230/1640828130590016.jpg\" style=\"\" title=\"1640828130590016.jpg\"/></p><p style=\"vertical-align: inherit; line-height: 1.5em; letter-spacing: 1.5px;\"><br/></p></section><section data-role=\"paragraph\" style=\"font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, Arial, sans-serif;\" class=\"\"><p style=\"vertical-align: inherit;line-height: 1.5em;letter-spacing: 1.5px;\"><span style=\"caret-color: red; letter-spacing: 0px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"caret-color: red;max-inline-size: 100%;cursor: text;letter-spacing: 1px;text-indent: 34px;\">在这场高端产品云集，科技之光闪耀，创新成果丰厚的盛会中，秋叶原2.1版8K</span><span style=\"caret-color: red;max-inline-size: 100%;cursor: text;letter-spacing: 1px;text-indent: 2em;\">高清</span><span style=\"caret-color: red;max-inline-size: 100%;cursor: text;letter-spacing: 1px;text-indent: 30px;\">HDMI</span><span style=\"caret-color: red;max-inline-size: 100%;cursor: text;letter-spacing: 1px;text-indent: 2em;\">、5G系列6A、7类、7A、八类网线、</span>颠覆式革新--石墨烯屏蔽HDMI线、第三代光纤复合HDMI线、<span style=\"caret-color: red;max-inline-size: 100%;cursor: text;letter-spacing: 1px;text-indent: 30px;\">3C数码周边</span>等<span style=\"caret-color: red;max-inline-size: 100%;cursor: text;letter-spacing: 0px;text-align: center;\">一批行业领先、技术先进，具有前瞻性、先导性的科技产品</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0px;max-inline-size: 100%;cursor: text;caret-color: red;\">及应用解决方案一经展出，便不断吸引着往来参观人员。</span></span></p></section><section data-role=\"paragraph\" style=\"font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, Arial, sans-serif;\" class=\"\"><p style=\"text-align:center;vertical-align: inherit;line-height: 1.5em;letter-spacing: 1.5px;\"><br/></p><p style=\"text-align:center;vertical-align: inherit;line-height: 1.5em;letter-spacing: 1.5px;\"><img src=\"/ueditor/php/upload/image/20211230/1640828102648282.jpg\" title=\"1640828102648282.jpg\" alt=\"19.webp.jpg\"/></p><p style=\"text-align:justify;vertical-align: inherit;line-height: 1.5em;letter-spacing: 1.5px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 1.8px;text-indent: 28px;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 1px;\">两大盛会圆满落幕，秋叶原为参展商、观众、采购商等带来非同寻常的参展体验。</span>感谢从全国各地远道而来的新老客户对秋叶原的支持与认可。未来，秋叶原将继续</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.5px;caret-color: red;\">聚焦业务，深入场景，持续迭代，不断落地实践</span><span style=\"caret-color: red;outline-style: initial;text-indent: 2em;letter-spacing: 1px;\">，打好核心技术攻坚战，加大创新产品研发，<span style=\"letter-spacing: 2px;\">为推动高质量发展、建设创新型国家、构建新发展格局贡献新的力量！</span></span></span></p></section></section><p><br/></p>', 1, 0, 10, 255, '2021-12-30 09:50:40', '2021-12-30 09:50:40', '2021-12-30 09:50:40', '2023-07-21 13:48:24', '/upload/image/20211230/61cd0df433936.jpeg', '[]', '', '', '', 'PC', 'zh-CN'),
(233, 27, '【喜讯】秋叶原再次荣膺2021年广东省制造业企业500强！升达第290位！', '助人为乐、博爱奉献”--- 秋叶原爱心基金正式成立！', '<section data-role=\"outer\" label=\"Powered by 135editor.com\"><section data-role=\"outer\" label=\"Powered by 135editor.com\" data-mpa-powered-by=\"yiban.io\" class=\"\"><section data-role=\"paragraph\" class=\"\"><p style=\"text-align:center;vertical-align:inherit;margin-left: 8px;margin-right: 8px;line-height: 1.75em;\"><br/></p></section><section data-role=\"paragraph\"><section data-tools=\"135编辑器\" data-id=\"95946\" class=\"_135editor\"><section style=\"padding-bottom: 30px; margin: 10px auto; box-sizing: border-box;\" class=\"\"><p style=\"text-align:center;vertical-align:inherit;font-size: 18px;margin: 10px 8px;-webkit-box-reflect: below -10px -webkit-gradient(linear, 0% 0%, 0% 100%, from(transparent), color-stop(0.04, transparent), to(rgba(255, 252, 252, 0.4)));color: rgb(223, 3, 3);line-height: 1.75em;\"><span style=\"font-size: 22px;caret-color: red;letter-spacing: 2px;\"><strong>强势发布&nbsp; 荣登290名</strong></span></p></section></section></section><section data-role=\"paragraph\"><section><section style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1.75em; height: 0px; overflow: hidden;\" class=\"\"></section><section style=\"vertical-align: inherit; letter-spacing: 1.5px; line-height: 1.75em; text-align: center;\"><img src=\"/ueditor/php/upload/image/20211230/1640860612364402.jpg\" title=\"1640860612364402.jpg\" alt=\"1.webp.jpg\"/></section><p style=\"vertical-align: inherit;letter-spacing: 1.5px;line-height: 1.75em;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"caret-color: red;letter-spacing: 0.544px;\"><br/></span></span></p><p style=\"vertical-align: inherit;letter-spacing: 1.5px;line-height: 1.75em;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"caret-color: red;letter-spacing: 0.544px;\">12月30日，由广东省制造业协会、广东省发展和改革研究院、暨南大学产业经济研究院共同主办的“2021广东省制造业发展年会暨广东省制造业 500 强企业峰会”在广州隆重举行。</span><span style=\"caret-color: red;letter-spacing: 2px;\">广东前海秋叶原集团董事长助理罗明亮先生作为集团代表应邀出席，与政府协会领导、资本大咖、企业代表、主流媒体等约500人共聚一堂。</span></span></p><p style=\"vertical-align: inherit;letter-spacing: 1.5px;line-height: 1.75em;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"caret-color: red;letter-spacing: 2px;\"><br/></span></span></p><p style=\"vertical-align: inherit; letter-spacing: 1.5px; line-height: 1.75em; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"caret-color: red;letter-spacing: 2px;\"><img src=\"/ueditor/php/upload/image/20211230/1640860624407779.jpg\" title=\"1640860624407779.jpg\" alt=\"2.webp.jpg\"/></span></span></p><section style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1.75em; height: 0px; overflow: hidden;\" class=\"\"></section><section style=\"text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;\"><br/></section><section style=\"vertical-align: inherit;letter-spacing: 1.5px;line-height: 1.75em;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"caret-color: red;letter-spacing: 0.544px;\"></span></span></section><section style=\"vertical-align: inherit;letter-spacing: 1.5px;line-height: 1.75em;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"caret-color: red;letter-spacing: 0.544px;\"></span></span></section><section style=\"vertical-align: inherit;letter-spacing: 1.5px;line-height: 1.75em;\" class=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"caret-color: red;letter-spacing: 0.544px;\">在此次大会上，秋叶原与华为科技、美的电器、比亚迪汽车、立白洗衣粉、联塑管业、欧派家居、海天味业等众多知名广东企业一起入选广东省制造业企业500强榜单。<strong><span style=\"caret-color: red;letter-spacing: 0.544px;color: #FF0000;\">秋叶原</span></strong></span><span style=\"color: #FF0000;caret-color: red;letter-spacing: 0.544px;\"><strong>生产制造实力位列广东省制造业500强第290名。</strong></span></span></section><p style=\"vertical-align: inherit;letter-spacing: 1.5px;line-height: 1.75em;\"><br/></p><p style=\"vertical-align: inherit; letter-spacing: 1.5px; line-height: 1.75em; text-align: center;\"><img src=\"/ueditor/php/upload/image/20211230/1640860633897886.jpg\" title=\"1640860633897886.jpg\" alt=\"3.webp.jpg\"/></p><section style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1.75em; height: 0px; overflow: hidden;\" class=\"\"></section><section style=\"vertical-align: inherit;letter-spacing: 1.5px;line-height: 1.75em;\"><br/></section><p style=\"vertical-align: inherit;letter-spacing: 1.5px;line-height: 1.75em;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.544px; text-indent: 28px; widows: 1; caret-color: red; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\">2021年“广东省制造业500强”企业排序评选，秉承“科学、权威、专业、公正、广泛”的评选原则，由评审专家委员会参照国际通行的方式，以2020年企业营业收入以及其他相关指标、数据为依据，对企业进行评审遴选，最终确定2021年广东省制造业500强企业。</span></p><p style=\"vertical-align: inherit;letter-spacing: 1.5px;line-height: 1.75em;\"><br/></p><p style=\"vertical-align: inherit; letter-spacing: 1.5px; line-height: 1.75em; text-align: center;\"><img src=\"/ueditor/php/upload/image/20211230/1640860768206331.jpg\" title=\"1640860768206331.jpg\" alt=\"4.webp.jpg\"/></p><p style=\"vertical-align: inherit;letter-spacing: 1.5px;line-height: 1.75em;\"><br/></p><section data-role=\"paragraph\" style=\"max-inline-size: 100%;outline: none 0px !important;\"><section style=\"max-inline-size: 100%;outline: none 0px !important;\"><section style=\"max-inline-size: 100%;cursor: text;vertical-align: inherit;letter-spacing: 1.5px;line-height: 1.75em;outline: none 0px !important;\" class=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"max-inline-size: 100%;outline: 0px;cursor: text;caret-color: red;letter-spacing: 1px;text-indent: 34px;\">秋叶原一直致力于<span style=\"max-inline-size: 100%;cursor: text;text-indent: 28px;\">打好核心技术攻坚战，加大创新产品研发，</span>2.1版8K</span><span style=\"max-inline-size: 100%;outline: 0px;cursor: text;caret-color: red;letter-spacing: 1px;text-indent: 2em;\">高清</span><span style=\"max-inline-size: 100%;outline: 0px;cursor: text;caret-color: red;letter-spacing: 1px;text-indent: 30px;\">HDMI</span><span style=\"max-inline-size: 100%;outline: 0px;cursor: text;caret-color: red;letter-spacing: 1px;text-indent: 2em;\">、5G系列6A、7类、7A、八类网线、</span><span style=\"max-inline-size: 100%;cursor: text;caret-color: #FF0000;outline: none 0px !important;\">颠覆式革新--石墨烯屏蔽HDMI线、第三代光纤复合HDMI线、</span><span style=\"max-inline-size: 100%;outline: 0px;cursor: text;caret-color: red;letter-spacing: 1px;text-indent: 30px;\">3C数码周边</span><span style=\"max-inline-size: 100%;cursor: text;caret-color: #FF0000;outline: none 0px !important;\">等</span><span style=\"max-inline-size: 100%;outline: 0px;cursor: text;letter-spacing: 0px;caret-color: red;text-align: center;\">一批行业领先、技术先进，具有前瞻性、先导性的科技产品</span><span style=\"max-inline-size: 100%;outline: 0px;cursor: text;letter-spacing: 0px;caret-color: red;\">及应用解决方案</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 2px;white-space: pre-wrap;\">为行业提供了一个高质量发展的智造、质造样本。</span></span></section><section style=\"max-inline-size: 100%;cursor: text;vertical-align: inherit;letter-spacing: 1.5px;line-height: 1.75em;outline: none 0px !important;\" class=\"\"><br/></section><section style=\"max-inline-size: 100%; cursor: text; vertical-align: inherit; letter-spacing: 1.5px; text-align: center; line-height: 1.75em; outline: none 0px !important; height: 0px; overflow: hidden;\" class=\"\"></section><p style=\"max-inline-size: 100%; cursor: text; vertical-align: inherit; letter-spacing: 1.5px; line-height: 1.75em; outline: none 0px !important; text-align: center;\"><img src=\"/ueditor/php/upload/image/20211230/1640860656733897.jpg\" title=\"1640860656733897.jpg\" alt=\"5.webp.jpg\"/></p><p style=\"max-inline-size: 100%;cursor: text;vertical-align: inherit;letter-spacing: 1.5px;line-height: 1.75em;outline: none 0px !important;\"><br/></p><section style=\"max-inline-size: 100%;cursor: text;vertical-align: inherit;letter-spacing: 1.5px;line-height: 1.75em;outline: none 0px !important;\" class=\"\"><span style=\"color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-size: 14px; text-indent: 28px; widows: 1; letter-spacing: 2px; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\">逐鹿市场问鼎荣耀，实力品牌铸就辉煌。秋叶原再次入选</span><span style=\"color: #FF0000;font-size: 14px;\"><strong><span style=\"text-indent: 28px; widows: 1; letter-spacing: 2px;\">“广东省制造业企业500强”</span><span style=\"text-indent: 28px; widows: 1; letter-spacing: 2px; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\">， </span></strong></span><span style=\"color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-size: 14px; text-indent: 28px; widows: 1; letter-spacing: 2px; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\">是广东省政府、行业专家对秋叶原的充分肯定和高度认可！</span></section><section style=\"max-inline-size: 100%;cursor: text;vertical-align: inherit;letter-spacing: 1.5px;line-height: 1.75em;outline: none 0px !important;\" class=\"\"><br/></section><section style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1.75em; height: 0px; overflow: hidden;\" class=\"\"></section><section style=\"max-inline-size: 100%;cursor: text;vertical-align: inherit;letter-spacing: 1.5px;line-height: 1.75em;outline: none 0px !important;\"><p style=\"vertical-align: inherit; caret-color: red; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: 2px; white-space: pre-wrap; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; text-align: center;\"><img src=\"/ueditor/php/upload/image/20211230/1640860666811071.jpg\" title=\"1640860666811071.jpg\" alt=\"6.webp.jpg\"/></p><p style=\"vertical-align: inherit; caret-color: red; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: 2px; white-space: pre-wrap; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"><br/></p></section><section style=\"max-inline-size: 100%;cursor: text;vertical-align: inherit;letter-spacing: 1.5px;line-height: 1.75em;outline: none 0px !important;\" class=\"\"><span style=\"caret-color: red; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: 2px; white-space: pre-wrap; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\">未来</span><span style=\"caret-color: red; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: 2px; white-space: pre-wrap; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\">，秋叶原将继续进行全方位的升级，重点打造新的现代化工业园区，履行“制造业立省”使命担当，探索广东制造业高质量发展的有效路径，为广东制造业高质量发展助力赋能、建言献策，奋力开创新时代广东改革发展新局面。</span></section></section></section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1.75em; height: 0px; overflow: hidden;\" class=\"\"></section></section><p><br/></p>', 1, 0, 10, 255, '2021-12-30 18:38:32', '2021-12-30 18:38:32', '2021-12-30 18:38:32', '2023-07-21 13:48:24', '/upload/image/20211230/61cd8c247529c.jpeg', '[]', '', '', '', 'PC', 'zh-CN');
INSERT INTO `news` (`id`, `news_cate_id`, `title`, `short_title`, `content`, `admin_id`, `count`, `is_show`, `sort`, `start_time`, `end_time`, `create_at`, `update_at`, `pic`, `pics`, `seo_title`, `seo_keyword`, `seo_description`, `platform`, `lang`) VALUES
(234, 27, '秋叶原线缆助力“冰丝带”国家速滑馆，预祝冬奥会胜利举办！', '助人为乐、博爱奉献”--- 秋叶原爱心基金正式成立！', '<p style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; clear: both; min-height: 1em; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 17px; letter-spacing: 0.544px; text-align: justify; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-indent: 2em; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: 1px; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">新年伊始，习近平总书记心系2022年冬奥会、冬残奥会筹办备赛工作，开启今年第1次国内考察。</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: 1px; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">他强调，办好北京冬奥会、冬残奥会，是我们向国际社会作出的庄严承诺。</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: 1px; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">经过几年努力，各项筹备工作基本就绪，我们完全有信心、有能力为世界奉献一届精彩、非凡、卓越的奥运盛会。</span></p><p style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; clear: both; min-height: 1em; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 17px; letter-spacing: 0.544px; text-align: justify; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-indent: 2em; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: 1px; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><br/></span></p><p style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; clear: both; min-height: 1em; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 17px; letter-spacing: 0.544px; text-align: justify; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); line-height: 1.5em; text-indent: 2em; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; letter-spacing: 1px; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;\"></span><strong style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; letter-spacing: 1px; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(255, 76, 65);\">考察的国家速滑馆又称“冰丝带”，是本届赛事唯一新建冰上竞赛场馆，也是2022年北京冬奥会北京主赛区标志性场馆。</span></strong><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; letter-spacing: 1px; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;\">3360块曲面玻璃单元、世界跨度最大的单层双向正交马鞍形索网屋面、全球首个采用二氧化碳跨临界直冷制冰技术的冬奥速滑场馆、亚洲最大的冰面、“超级大脑”……在设计理念、技术工艺、材料选取、场馆运营等方面，场馆充分体现绿色、环保、节能、低碳、可持续性等特点。</span></span></p><p style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; clear: both; min-height: 1em; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 17px; letter-spacing: 0.544px; text-align: justify; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); line-height: 1.5em; text-indent: 2em; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; letter-spacing: 1px; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; clear: both; min-height: 1em; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 17px; letter-spacing: 0.544px; text-align: center; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); line-height: 1.5em; text-indent: 2em; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; letter-spacing: 1px; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\"><img src=\"/ueditor/php/upload/image/20220107/1641548058980007.jpg\" title=\"1641548058980007.jpg\" alt=\"微信图片_20220106113820.jpg\"/></span></p><p style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; clear: both; min-height: 1em; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 17px; letter-spacing: 0.544px; text-align: justify; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); line-height: 1.5em; text-indent: 2em; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; letter-spacing: 1px; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\"><br/></span></p><p><br/></p><section style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 17px; letter-spacing: 0.544px; text-align: justify; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); line-height: 1.5em; text-indent: 2em; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; font-size: 14px;\"><strong style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; color: rgb(255, 76, 65); letter-spacing: 1px; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;\">秋叶原品牌作为2022北京冬奥会国家速滑馆核心音响工程的合作品牌，其关键音响工程选定了秋叶原线缆。</span></strong><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; letter-spacing: 1px; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;\">2022北京冬奥会国家速滑馆音响工程施工复杂，对选用的高品质影音线缆有极高的要求。由于是在巨大的冰面场馆内，各界面围合起来的空间中，有声源发声就会有辐射传递，接受的声场并各具特性,大型体育场馆因其容量多，容积大，其声场特性的复杂程度并不亚于大型的音乐厅和剧院，只是它们对音质的要求各有不同而已。</span></span></section><section style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 17px; letter-spacing: 0.544px; text-align: justify; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); line-height: 1.5em; text-indent: 2em; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word 