ow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; letter-spacing: 1px; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\"><br/></span></section><section style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 17px; letter-spacing: 0.544px; text-align: justify; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); line-height: 1.5em; text-indent: 2em; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; letter-spacing: 1px; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\">当前，北京冬奥筹办已经到了跑秒计时、压线冲刺的关键时刻，秋叶原作为音视频智能连接领域的知名品牌，将以性能卓越的产品、精湛的技术、高品质的服务，持续为国家速滑馆各项冰雪赛事作出积极贡献，为举办一届精彩、非凡、卓越的冬奥运盛会贡献力量！</span></section><p><br/></p><p><br/></p>', 1, 0, 10, 255, '2022-01-07 17:36:01', '2022-01-07 17:36:01', '2022-01-07 17:36:01', '2023-07-21 13:48:24', '/upload/image/20220107/61d8097b283b6.jpeg', '[]', '', '', '', 'PC', 'zh-CN');
INSERT INTO `news` (`id`, `news_cate_id`, `title`, `short_title`, `content`, `admin_id`, `count`, `is_show`, `sort`, `start_time`, `end_time`, `create_at`, `update_at`, `pic`, `pics`, `seo_title`, `seo_keyword`, `seo_description`, `platform`, `lang`) VALUES
(235, 27, '【分析】采用劣质线缆会造成哪些危害', '助人为乐、博爱奉献”--- 秋叶原爱心基金正式成立！', '<section data-role=\"outer\" label=\"Powered by 135editor.com\"><section data-role=\"paragraph\" data-mpa-powered-by=\"yiban.io\" class=\"\"><p style=\"text-align:center; max-inline-size: 100%; cursor: text; caret-color: rgb(255, 0, 0); vertical-align: inherit; letter-spacing: 1.5px; line-height: 1.5em; font-family: 微软雅黑, sans-serif; outline: none 0px !important;\"><span style=\"max-inline-size: 100%; cursor: text; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); letter-spacing: 1px; outline: none 0px !important; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;\">不久前中国消防曾发布一段视频显示</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center; max-inline-size: 100%; cursor: text; caret-color: rgb(255, 0, 0); vertical-align: inherit; letter-spacing: 1.5px; line-height: 1.5em; font-family: 微软雅黑, sans-serif; outline: none 0px !important;\"><span style=\"max-inline-size: 100%; cursor: text; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); letter-spacing: 1px; outline: none 0px !important; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;\">用破损的充电数据线给手机充电</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center; max-inline-size: 100%; cursor: text; caret-color: rgb(255, 0, 0); vertical-align: inherit; letter-spacing: 1.5px; line-height: 1.5em; font-family: 微软雅黑, sans-serif; outline: none 0px !important;\"><span style=\"max-inline-size: 100%; cursor: text; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); letter-spacing: 1px; outline: none 0px !important; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;\">从小火星到全屋燃烧，仅用了3分钟时间！</span></p></section><section data-role=\"paragraph\" class=\"\"><p style=\"vertical-align: inherit;line-height: 1.5em;\"><br/></p></section><section data-role=\"paragraph\"><p style=\"text-align:center;vertical-align: inherit;line-height: 1.5em;\"><img src=\"/ueditor/php/upload/image/20220112/1641953172201741.gif\" title=\"1641953172201741.gif\" alt=\"微信图片_20220111110000.gif\"/></p></section><section data-role=\"paragraph\"><p style=\"vertical-align: inherit;line-height: 1.5em;\"><br/></p></section><p style=\"text-align:justify;vertical-align: inherit;letter-spacing: 1.5px;line-height: 1.5em;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(63, 63, 63); letter-spacing: 1px; font-size: 14px; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;\">现在，越来越多的电子产品都会用到数据线充电，<span style=\"caret-color: red;\">小小的一根数据线虽然外表相似，但如果买到劣质的或是反复使用老旧充电数据线，不仅容易损坏手机晶片，减少电池使用寿命<span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.544px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: 等线;\">，</span>可能还会存在很大的安全隐患。</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align:justify;vertical-align: inherit;letter-spacing: 1.5px;line-height: 1.5em;\"><br/></p><p style=\"text-align: center; vertical-align: inherit; letter-spacing: 1.5px; line-height: 1.5em;\"><img src=\"/ueditor/php/upload/image/20220112/1641953196705977.jpg\" title=\"1641953196705977.jpg\" alt=\"2.webp.jpg\"/></p><p style=\"text-align:justify;vertical-align: inherit;letter-spacing: 1.5px;line-height: 1.5em;\"><br/></p><p style=\"text-align:justify;vertical-align: inherit;letter-spacing: 1.5px;line-height: 1.5em;\"><br/></p><p style=\"text-align:justify;vertical-align: inherit;letter-spacing: 1.5px;line-height: 1.5em;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">如果你的数据线外观出现破损、充电接触不良、充电终端接口处过热时可能会造成短路，导致明火发生，当数据线金属外露时，在充电过程中还极有可能发生漏电的情况。</span></p><section style=\"text-align: center;vertical-align: inherit;letter-spacing: 1.5px;line-height: 1.5em;\"></section><section style=\"text-align: center; max-inline-size: 100%; cursor: text; caret-color: rgb(255, 0, 0); vertical-align: inherit; letter-spacing: 1.5px; line-height: 1.5em; font-family: 微软雅黑, sans-serif; outline: none 0px !important;\"><br/></section><section style=\"text-align: center; max-inline-size: 100%; cursor: text; caret-color: rgb(255, 0, 0); vertical-align: inherit; letter-spacing: 1.5px; line-height: 1.5em; font-family: 微软雅黑, sans-serif; outline: none 0px !important;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #FF4C41;\">充电线坏了就一定要更换</span></strong></span></section><section style=\"text-align: center; max-inline-size: 100%; cursor: text; caret-color: rgb(255, 0, 0); vertical-align: inherit; letter-spacing: 1.5px; line-height: 1.5em; font-family: 微软雅黑, sans-serif; outline: none 0px !important;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong><span style=\"max-inline-size: 100%; cursor: text; letter-spacing: 1px; color: rgb(255, 76, 65); outline: none 0px !important; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;\"><strong style=\"max-inline-size: 100%;cursor: text;outline: none 0px !important;\">即使将其修复成功</strong></span></strong></span></section><section style=\"text-align: center; max-inline-size: 100%; cursor: text; caret-color: rgb(255, 0, 0); vertical-align: inherit; letter-spacing: 1.5px; line-height: 1.5em; font-family: 微软雅黑, sans-serif; outline: none 0px !important;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong><span style=\"max-inline-size: 100%; cursor: text; letter-spacing: 1px; color: rgb(255, 76, 65); outline: none 0px !important; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;\"><strong style=\"max-inline-size: 100%;cursor: text;outline: none 0px !important;\">安全隐患也一定会存在</strong></span></strong></span></section><section style=\"text-align: center; max-inline-size: 100%; cursor: text; caret-color: rgb(255, 0, 0); vertical-align: inherit; letter-spacing: 1.5px; line-height: 1.5em; font-family: 微软雅黑, sans-serif; outline: none 0px !important;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong><span style=\"max-inline-size: 100%; cursor: text; letter-spacing: 1px; color: rgb(255, 76, 65); outline: none 0px !important; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;\"><strong style=\"max-inline-size: 100%;cursor: text;outline: none 0px !important;\">切勿继续使用！</strong></span></strong></span></section><section style=\"text-align: center; max-inline-size: 100%; cursor: text; caret-color: rgb(255, 0, 0); vertical-align: inherit; letter-spacing: 1.5px; line-height: 1.5em; font-family: 微软雅黑, sans-serif; outline: none 0px !important;\"><br/></section><section style=\"text-align: justify;vertical-align: inherit;letter-spacing: 1.5px;line-height: 1.5em;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: 1px; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;\">另外，<span style=\"max-inline-size: 100%; outline: 0px; cursor: text; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); caret-color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">大家在选购数据线时</span><span style=\"color: rgb(63, 63, 63); caret-color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">一定要选择符合标准及专业认证的优质产品：</span></span></section><section style=\"text-align: justify;vertical-align: inherit;letter-spacing: 1.5px;line-height: 1.5em;\"><br/></section><section style=\"text-align: justify;vertical-align: inherit;letter-spacing: 1.5px;line-height: 1.5em;\"></section><p style=\"text-align: center; vertical-align: inherit; letter-spacing: 1.5px; line-height: 1.5em;\"><img src=\"/ueditor/php/upload/image/20220112/1641953234925186.jpg\" title=\"1641953234925186.jpg\" alt=\"3.webp.jpg\"/></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;vertical-align: inherit;letter-spacing: 1.5px;line-height: 1.5em;\"><br/></p><section style=\"text-align: justify;vertical-align: inherit;letter-spacing: 1.5px;line-height: 1.5em;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 1px; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-size: 14px; caret-color: red; outline-style: initial; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;\">一是要</span><span style=\"caret-color: red; outline-style: initial; font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: 1px; color: rgb(255, 76, 65); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;\"><strong>看材质</strong></span><span style=\"color: rgb(63, 63, 63); letter-spacing: 1px; font-size: 14px; caret-color: red; outline-style: initial; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;\">，选阻燃性强的pvc和tpe材质；二是</span><strong><span style=\"caret-color: red; outline-style: initial; font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: 1px; color: rgb(255, 76, 65); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;\">充电线、终端和充电器</span></strong><span style=\"color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: 1px; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"caret-color: red; outline-style: initial;\">三者间，要</span><span style=\"outline-style: initial;\">保持</span></span><span style=\"outline-style: initial; font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: 1px; color: rgb(255, 76, 65); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;\"><strong>输出规格一致</strong></span><span style=\"color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: 1px; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"caret-color: red; outline-style: initial;\">，以免出现过载；第三要</span><span style=\"outline-style: initial;\">采购由</span></span><strong><span style=\"outline-style: initial; font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: 1px; color: rgb(255, 76, 65); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;\">正规厂家</span></strong><span style=\"letter-spacing: 1px; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-size: 14px; outline-style: initial; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;\">出产的产品。</span></section><section style=\"text-align: justify;vertical-align: inherit;letter-spacing: 1.5px;line-height: 1.5em;\"><br/></section><section style=\"text-align: justify;vertical-align: inherit;letter-spacing: 1.5px;line-height: 1.5em;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 1px; color: rgb(255, 76, 65); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;\"><strong><span style=\"outline: 0px; font-size: 14px;\">在使用时</span></strong></span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 1px; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-size: 14px; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"outline: 0px;\">不要肆意拉扯线身，插拔时握住线头，</span><span style=\"text-align: center; caret-color: red;\">最好不要在过热、过冷的环境中及床边、枕头旁充电。</span></span></section><section style=\"text-align: justify;vertical-align: inherit;letter-spacing: 1.5px;line-height: 1.5em;\"></section><section data-role=\"paragraph\" style=\"max-inline-size: 100%; border-width: 0px; border-style: none; border-color: initial; z-index: 0; caret-color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-family: 微软雅黑, sans-serif; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none 0px !important;\"><section style=\"text-align: justify;max-inline-size: 100%;cursor: text;vertical-align: inherit;letter-spacing: 1.5px;line-height: 1.5em;outline: none 0px !important;\"><br/></section><p style=\"text-align: justify;max-inline-size: 100%;cursor: text;vertical-align: inherit;letter-spacing: 1.5px;line-height: 1.5em;outline: none 0px !important;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 1px; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: rgb(63, 63, 63);\">其实不只是数据线，其他线缆也要注意</span><span style=\"color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-size: 14px; text-indent: 28px;\">质量问题，</span><span style=\"caret-color: red; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-size: 14px; text-indent: 28px;\">产品质量的好坏直接影响到我们的使用体验，威胁到我们的生命安全。</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;max-inline-size: 100%;cursor: text;vertical-align: inherit;letter-spacing: 1.5px;line-height: 1.5em;outline: none 0px !important;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 1px; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"caret-color: red; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-size: 14px; text-indent: 28px;\"><br/></span></span></p><section style=\"text-align: center; max-inline-size: 100%; cursor: text; vertical-align: inherit; letter-spacing: 1.5px; line-height: 1.5em; outline: none 0px !important;\"><img src=\"/ueditor/php/upload/image/20220112/1641953257359096.gif\" title=\"1641953257359096.gif\" alt=\"5.gif\"/></section></section><section data-role=\"paragraph\" style=\"max-inline-size: 100%; border-width: 0px; border-style: none; border-color: initial; z-index: 0; caret-color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-family: 微软雅黑, sans-serif; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none 0px !important;\"><p style=\"text-align:justify; max-inline-size: 100%; outline: 0px; cursor: text; vertical-align: inherit; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: 1.5px; line-height: 1.75em; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 1px; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); max-inline-size: 100%; cursor: text; caret-color: red; text-indent: 28px; outline: none 0px !important; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;\"><br/></span></p><p style=\"text-align:justify; max-inline-size: 100%; outline: 0px; cursor: text; vertical-align: inherit; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: 1.5px; line-height: 1.75em; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 1px; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); max-inline-size: 100%; cursor: text; caret-color: red; text-indent: 28px; outline: none 0px !important; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;\">比如使用</span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 76, 65); letter-spacing: 1px; max-inline-size: 100%; cursor: text; caret-color: red; text-indent: 28px; outline: none 0px !important; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;\">【<strong>劣质电源</strong></span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 1px; max-inline-size: 100%; cursor: text; caret-color: red; text-indent: 28px; color: rgb(255, 76, 65); outline: none 0px !important; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;\"><strong><span style=\"max-inline-size: 100%; cursor: text; text-indent: 32px; outline: none 0px !important;\">线</span></strong></span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 76, 65); letter-spacing: 1px; max-inline-size: 100%; cursor: text; caret-color: red; text-indent: 28px; outline: none 0px !important; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;\"><strong>】</strong></span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 1px; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); max-inline-size: 100%; cursor: text; caret-color: red; text-indent: 28px; outline: none 0px !important; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;\">容易造成</span><strong><span style=\"letter-spacing: 1px; color: rgb(255, 76, 65); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"caret-color: red; text-indent: 28px; max-inline-size: 100%; cursor: text; outline: none 0px !important;\">破损漏电</span><span style=\"outline-style: initial; text-indent: 28px;\">、短路<span style=\"outline-style: initial;\">引发火灾</span></span></span></strong><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 76, 65); letter-spacing: 1px; outline-style: initial; text-indent: 28px; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;\">。</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 1px; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"outline-style: initial; text-indent: 28px;\">要知道</span><span style=\"caret-color: red; text-align: center;\">因电气原因引发的火灾，在我国火灾事故中长期居于首位。而在火灾中，我们需应对的除了大火之外，还有浓烟，它才是火灾致死的主要因素！</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align:justify; max-inline-size: 100%; outline: 0px; cursor: text; vertical-align: inherit; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: 1.5px; line-height: 1.75em; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 1px; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"caret-color: red; text-align: center;\"><br/></span></span></p><section style=\"text-align: center; max-inline-size: 100%; outline: 0px; cursor: text; vertical-align: inherit; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: 1.5px; line-height: 1.5em; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Arial, sans-serif;\"><img src=\"/ueditor/php/upload/image/20220112/1641953270639630.jpg\" title=\"1641953270639630.jpg\" alt=\"4.webp.jpg\"/></section></section><section style=\"text-align: center;vertical-align: inherit;letter-spacing: 1.5px;line-height: 1.5em;\"></section><section style=\"text-align: justify;vertical-align: inherit;letter-spacing: 1.5px;line-height: 1.5em;\"><br/></section><section style=\"text-align: justify;vertical-align: inherit;letter-spacing: 1.5px;line-height: 1.5em;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); letter-spacing: 1px; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"outline: 0px; text-indent: 32px;\">所以不论是<span style=\"outline: 0px; text-indent: 34px;\">大型公共场所还是</span>家装，</span><span style=\"outline: 0px; caret-color: red;\">为</span><span style=\"outline: 0px; text-indent: 32px; caret-color: red;\">降低火灾的发生率，低烟、无卤、阻燃、环保型电线电缆成为最佳选择。</span></span></section><section style=\"text-align: justify;vertical-align: inherit;letter-spacing: 1.5px;line-height: 1.5em;\"><br/></section><section style=\"text-align: justify;vertical-align: inherit;line-height: 1.5em;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: 1px; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;\"><strong><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">如秋叶原低烟无卤阻燃线缆采用辐照交联工艺</span></strong>，一级阻燃，<span style=\"text-align: left;\">使电线具有了环保，安全，寿命长等等特点，是国际上最理想的建筑用线之一。</span></span></section><section style=\"text-align: justify;vertical-align: inherit;line-height: 1.5em;\"><br/></section><section data-role=\"outer\" label=\"Powered by 135editor.com\"><section data-role=\"paragraph\"><section style=\"text-align: center;vertical-align: inherit;line-height: 1.5em;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 1px; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;\"><strong>国家防火建材级</strong></span></section><section style=\"text-align: center;vertical-align: inherit;line-height: 1.5em;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 1px; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 41, 65);\"><strong>低烟、无卤、阻燃</strong></span><strong>检测报告</strong></span></section><p style=\"text-align: center;vertical-align: inherit;line-height: 1.5em;\"><br/></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"/ueditor/php/upload/image/20220112/1641953315402223.jpg\" style=\"\" title=\"1641953315402223.jpg\"/></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"/ueditor/php/upload/image/20220112/1641953316552388.jpg\" style=\"\" title=\"1641953316552388.jpg\"/></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"/ueditor/php/upload/image/20220112/1641953316843206.jpg\" style=\"\" title=\"1641953316843206.jpg\"/></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"/ueditor/php/upload/image/20220112/1641953316104275.jpg\" style=\"\" title=\"1641953316104275.jpg\"/></p><section style=\"text-align: center;vertical-align: inherit;line-height: 1.5em;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 1px; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;\"><strong><br/></strong></span></section></section></section><p style=\"text-align: justify;vertical-align: inherit;letter-spacing: 1.5px;line-height: 1.5em;\"><span style=\"outline: 0px; text-indent: 32px; caret-color: red; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: 1px; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;\">如果使用了</span><span style=\"color: #FF4C41;\"><span style=\"outline: 0px; text-indent: 32px; caret-color: red; font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: 1px; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;\">【</span><strong><span style=\"outline: 0px; text-indent: 32px; caret-color: red; font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: 1px; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;\">劣质的网</span></strong></span><strong><span style=\"outline: 0px; text-indent: 32px; caret-color: red; font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: 1px; color: rgb(255, 76, 65); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;\">线】</span></strong><span style=\"outline: 0px; text-indent: 32px; caret-color: red; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: 1px; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;\">会造成网络信号衰减，沿路干扰增加，使传输数据容易出错，因而会造成网速变慢、上网卡住、网页出错等情况。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;vertical-align: inherit;letter-spacing: 1.5px;line-height: 1.5em;\"><span style=\"outline: 0px; text-indent: 32px; caret-color: red; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: 1px; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;\"><br/></span></p><p style=\"text-align: center; vertical-align: inherit; letter-spacing: 1.5px; line-height: 1.5em;\"><span style=\"outline: 0px; text-indent: 32px; caret-color: red; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: 1px; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;\"><img src=\"/ueditor/php/upload/image/20220112/1641953376542933.jpg\" title=\"1641953376542933.jpg\" alt=\"跳线.jpg\"/></span></p><section style=\"text-align: justify;vertical-align: inherit;letter-spacing: 1.5px;line-height: 1.5em;\"><br/></section><section style=\"text-align: justify;vertical-align: inherit;letter-spacing: 1.5px;line-height: 1.5em;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: 1px; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"outline: 0px; text-indent: 32px; caret-color: red;\">除此之外，劣质网线的使用寿命很短，需</span><span style=\"text-align: left; text-indent: 32px; caret-color: red;\">要经常重复购买，替换使用，<span style=\"text-align: justify;\">会给维修工作带来很大的困难，甚至在发生火灾时<span style=\"text-align: left;\">一旦烧着就会一直烧下去，</span></span></span><span style=\"widows: 1; caret-color: red;\">不仅<span style=\"text-indent: 28px;\">造成经济损失</span>，还危害到了我们的生命安全！</span></span></section><section style=\"text-align: justify;vertical-align: inherit;letter-spacing: 1.5px;line-height: 1.5em;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: 1px; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"widows: 1; caret-color: red;\"><br/></span></span></section><section style=\"text-align: justify;vertical-align: inherit;letter-spacing: 1.5px;line-height: 1.5em;\"><span style=\"color: #FF4C41;\"><strong><span style=\"widows: 1; font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: 1px; text-indent: 32px; caret-color: rgb(255, 0, 0); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;\">总之，不论大家挑选什么线缆，都要充分发挥你那火眼金睛，</span></strong></span><span style=\"color: #FF4C41;\"><strong><span style=\"widows: 1; font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: 1px; text-indent: 32px; caret-color: rgb(255, 0, 0); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 2px;\">寻找靠谱的商家，买质量过硬的产品。</span></span></strong></span></section><p style=\"text-align:center;vertical-align:inherit;\"><br/></p><section style=\"text-align: justify;vertical-align: inherit;text-indent: 0em;line-height: 1.5em;\" class=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"outline: 0px; text-indent: 32px; caret-color: red; letter-spacing: 1px; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(63, 63, 63); caret-color: red; outline: 0px; text-indent: 34px;\">一个好的品牌有一个优质企业的支撑，</span><span style=\"outline: 0px; caret-color: red; color: rgb(255, 76, 65);\"><strong>秋叶原专注线缆制造30+年，</strong></span><span style=\"caret-color: red; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); outline: 0px; text-indent: 34px;\">产品在</span><span style=\"color: rgb(63, 63, 63); letter-spacing: 0.544px; caret-color: red; outline: 0px; text-indent: 34px; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\">生产过程中严格执行质量管理标准，<span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.544px;\">品质有保</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.544px;\">障</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.544px;\">，</span>使用年限长，<span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.544px;\">市场占有率也较大，</span></span></span><span style=\"color: rgb(63, 63, 63); outline: 0px; text-indent: 32px; caret-color: red; letter-spacing: 1px; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;\"><strong style=\"outline: 0px;color: #333333;font-size: 17px;letter-spacing: 2px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: 1px; caret-color: red; outline: 0px; text-align: left; color: rgb(255, 76, 65);\">是购线首选！</span></strong></span></span></section></section>', 1, 0, 10, 255, '2022-01-12 10:10:29', '2022-01-12 10:10:29', '2022-01-12 10:10:29', '2023-07-21 13:48:24', '/upload/image/20220112/61de3890941be.jpeg', '[]', '', '', '', 'PC', 'zh-CN');
INSERT INTO `news` (`id`, `news_cate_id`, `title`, `short_title`, `content`, `admin_id`, `count`, `is_show`, `sort`, `start_time`, `end_time`, `create_at`, `update_at`, `pic`, `pics`, `seo_title`, `seo_keyword`, `seo_description`, `platform`, `lang`) VALUES
(236, 27, '五新战略开启新征程！秋叶原集团“2021年度总结表彰暨2022年度经营规划大会”胜利召开', '助人为乐、博爱奉献”--- 秋叶原爱心基金正式成立！', '<section data-role=\"outer\" label=\"Powered by 135editor.com\"><section data-tools=\"135编辑器\" data-id=\"108441\" class=\"_135editor\"><section style=\"text-align: justify; margin: 10px auto;\"><p style=\"text-align:center;vertical-align:inherit;\"><strong data-brushtype=\"text\">总结表彰 展望未来</strong></p><p style=\"vertical-align:inherit;\"><br/></p><p style=\"text-align:justify;vertical-align: inherit;\">征程万里风正劲，继往开来逐梦行。1月18日，为全面总结2021年工作情况，表彰年度先进集体和个人，明确2022年的工作重点与工作目标，广东前海秋叶原集团<strong style=\"caret-color: red; outline-style: initial; font-size: 17px; letter-spacing: 1px; text-indent: 34px; background-color: rgb(250, 231, 231); color: rgb(123, 12, 0); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;\">“2021年度总结表彰暨2022年度经营规划大会”</strong>在集团公司下属惠州产业园区胜利召开。</p><p style=\"vertical-align:inherit;\"><br/></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"/ueditor/php/upload/image/20220120/1642646411460174.jpg\" title=\"1642646411460174.jpg\" alt=\"1.webp.jpg\"/></p><p><br/></p><p>广东前海秋叶原集团董事长孙逸楷先生与集团公司、下属控股公司副经理以上管理人员及受表彰对象参加了本次会议。</p><p style=\"text-align:justify;vertical-align: inherit;\"><br/></p></section></section><section data-role=\"paragraph\" style=\"height: 0px; overflow: hidden;\"></section><section data-role=\"paragraph\"><section data-role=\"paragraph\" style=\"white-space: normal;\"><section style=\"vertical-align: inherit;line-height: 1.5em;text-align: center;\"><img src=\"/ueditor/php/upload/image/20220120/1642646395547136.jpg\" title=\"1642646395547136.jpg\" alt=\"2.webp.jpg\"/></section></section><section data-role=\"paragraph\" style=\"white-space: normal;\"><section style=\"text-align: center;vertical-align: inherit;letter-spacing: 1.5px;line-height: 1.5em;\"><strong style=\"outline: 0px; font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: 1px; caret-color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"outline: 0px;text-align: justify;color: #FF0000;\">广东前海秋叶原集团董事长孙逸楷先生发表重要讲话</span></strong></section></section><section style=\"vertical-align: inherit;line-height: 1.5em;\"><br/></section></section><section data-role=\"paragraph\"><section style=\"text-align: justify;vertical-align: inherit;line-height: 1.5em;\" class=\"\"><span style=\"color: rgb(63, 63, 63);\"><span style=\"max-inline-size: 100%; cursor: text; caret-color: rgb(255, 0, 0); letter-spacing: 1px; text-indent: 34px; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; outline: none 0px !important;\">2021年，秋叶原<span style=\"max-inline-size: 100%; cursor: text; caret-color: red; text-indent: 12px; outline: none 0px !important;\">在董事会的英明领导下、在全体同仁及合作伙伴的共同努力</span><span style=\"max-inline-size: 100%; cursor: text; caret-color: red; text-indent: 37px; outline: none 0px !important;\">下，</span></span><span style=\"max-inline-size: 100%; cursor: text; letter-spacing: 1.5px; caret-color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; outline: none 0px !important;\">克服艰难险阻<span style=\"max-inline-size: 100%; cursor: text; letter-spacing: 1px; text-indent: 34px;\">，</span>全面完成了年度经营规划各项任务，在“塑造秋叶原百年品牌”的大道上建立了又一光辉的里程碑！</span><span style=\"max-inline-size: 100%; cursor: text; caret-color: rgb(255, 0, 0); letter-spacing: 1px; text-indent: 34px; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; outline: none 0px !important;\">2022，我们壮志在胸、继续携手并肩、奋勇前行，激荡新时代，阔步新征程。</span></span></section></section><section data-role=\"paragraph\"><section style=\"vertical-align: inherit;line-height: 1.5em;\"><br/></section></section><section data-role=\"paragraph\"><section data-role=\"paragraph\" style=\"white-space: normal;\"><section style=\"vertical-align: inherit;line-height: 1.5em;text-align: center;\"><img src=\"/ueditor/php/upload/image/20220120/1642646387451238.jpg\" title=\"1642646387451238.jpg\" alt=\"3.webp.jpg\"/></section></section><section data-role=\"paragraph\" style=\"white-space: normal;\"><p style=\"text-align:center;vertical-align: inherit;letter-spacing: 1.5px;line-height: normal;\"><strong style=\"font-size: 12px; caret-color: rgb(255, 0, 0); max-inline-size: 100%; cursor: text; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; outline: none 0px !important;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 1px;max-inline-size: 100%;cursor: text;color: #FF0000;outline: none 0px !important;\">广东前海秋叶原集团运营总监&amp;行政人力中心总监</span></strong></p><p style=\"text-align:center;vertical-align: inherit;letter-spacing: 1.5px;line-height: normal;\"><strong style=\"font-size: 12px; caret-color: rgb(255, 0, 0); max-inline-size: 100%; cursor: text; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; outline: none 0px !important;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 1px;max-inline-size: 100%;cursor: text;color: #FF0000;outline: none 0px !important;\">廖军平先生主持召开大会</span></strong></p></section><section style=\"vertical-align: inherit;line-height: 1.5em;\"><br/></section></section><section data-role=\"paragraph\"><section style=\"text-align: justify;vertical-align: inherit;line-height: 1.5em;\" class=\"\"><span style=\"color: rgb(63, 63, 63);\"><span style=\"max-inline-size: 100%; outline-style: initial; cursor: text; caret-color: red; letter-spacing: 1px; text-indent: 34px; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; outline-color: initial !important; outline-width: 0px !important;\">会上，各控股公司、职能部门及各事业部</span><span style=\"max-inline-size: 100%; cursor: text; caret-color: rgb(255, 0, 0); letter-spacing: 1px; text-indent: 34px; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; outline: none 0px !important;\">负责人围绕本部门职责和年初确定的工作目标，回顾总结了2021年工作成绩，<span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.544px; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Arial, sans-serif;\">剖析了存在的问题和不足，提出了具体的改进措施，并</span>对2022的工作进行了新的展望和部署。<span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.544px; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Arial, sans-serif;\">报告层次分明，措施改进有力，目标制定清晰。</span></span></span></section><section style=\"text-align: justify;vertical-align: inherit;line-height: 1.5em;\"><br/></section><section data-role=\"paragraph\"><section style=\"vertical-align: inherit;line-height: 1.5em;text-align: center;\" class=\"\"><img src=\"/ueditor/php/upload/image/20220120/1642646380535582.jpg\" title=\"1642646380535582.jpg\" alt=\"4.webp.jpg\"/></section></section><section data-role=\"paragraph\"><section style=\"text-indent: 0em; caret-color: rgb(255, 0, 0); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-align: center; max-inline-size: 100%; cursor: text; letter-spacing: 1.5px; line-height: 1.5em; font-family: 微软雅黑, Arial, sans-serif; outline: none 0px !important;\"><p style=\"vertical-align: inherit;line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"outline: 0px; font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: 1px; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"><strong style=\"max-inline-size: 100%;cursor: text;outline: none 0px !important;\"><span style=\"max-inline-size: 100%;cursor: text;text-align: justify;text-indent: 24px;color: #FF0000;outline: none 0px !important;\">广东前海秋叶原集团董事长孙逸楷先生</span></strong></span></p></section><section style=\"text-indent: 0em; caret-color: rgb(255, 0, 0); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-align: center; max-inline-size: 100%; cursor: text; letter-spacing: 1.5px; line-height: 1.5em; font-family: 微软雅黑, Arial, sans-serif; outline: none 0px !important;\"><p style=\"vertical-align: inherit;line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"outline: 0px; font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: 1px; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"><strong style=\"max-inline-size: 100%;cursor: text;outline: none 0px !important;\"><span style=\"max-inline-size: 100%;cursor: text;text-align: justify;text-indent: 24px;color: #FF0000;outline: none 0px !important;\">听取各中心工作汇报</span></strong></span></p></section><section style=\"vertical-align: inherit;line-height: 1.5em;\"><br/></section></section></section><section data-role=\"paragraph\" class=\"\"><section style=\"text-align: justify;vertical-align: inherit;letter-spacing: 1.5px;text-indent: 0em;line-height: 1.5em;\" class=\"\"><span style=\"color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\">各中心工作汇报完毕后，广东前海秋叶原集团董事长孙逸楷先生发表重要讲话。他表示：</span><span style=\"text-indent: 40px; caret-color: red; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\">2021年，全球经济环境错综复杂，世界格局风云变幻。例如：贸易对抗-疫情频发-房地产严控等等。值得欣慰的是，面对如此种种不利因素，集团适时调整经营策略，各位同仁齐心协力、众志成城，总体完成了预定的规划目标。</span></section><section style=\"text-align: justify;vertical-align: inherit;letter-spacing: 1.5px;text-indent: 0em;line-height: 1.5em;\" class=\"\"><p style=\"vertical-align: inherit; text-indent: 40px; caret-color: red; font-size: 14px; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"><br/></p></section><p style=\"text-align:center;vertical-align:inherit;\"><img src=\"/ueditor/php/upload/image/20220120/1642646373154777.jpg\" title=\"1642646373154777.jpg\" alt=\"5.webp.jpg\"/></p><section style=\"text-align: center; max-inline-size: 100%; cursor: text; text-indent: 0em; caret-color: rgb(255, 0, 0); vertical-align: inherit; letter-spacing: 1.5px; line-height: 1.5em; font-family: 微软雅黑, sans-serif; outline: none 0px !important;\"><span style=\"max-inline-size: 100%; cursor: text; font-size: 14px; outline: none 0px !important; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"><strong style=\"max-inline-size: 100%; cursor: text; font-size: 12px; outline: none 0px !important; font-family: 微软雅黑, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"max-inline-size: 100%;cursor: text;color: #ff0000;outline: none 0px !important;\">各中心、分子公司领导作工作汇报</span></strong></span><span style=\"text-indent: 0em;\"></span></section><section style=\"text-align: justify;vertical-align: inherit;letter-spacing: 1.5px;text-indent: 0em;line-height: 1.5em;\"><br/></section><section style=\"text-align: justify;vertical-align: inherit;letter-spacing: 1.5px;text-indent: 0em;line-height: 1.5em;\" class=\"\"><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\">2021年，“秋叶原”获得了深圳500强企业榜单第96位，广东制造业企业500强第290位，第三届“安防工匠人物”、第四届“智慧安防优秀解决方案”奖，中国物联网产业品牌盛会“十大音视频品牌”榜、广东省电线电缆行业协会企业标准“领跑者”证书等嘉奖和荣誉，对各位同仁的辛勤付出和巨大努力表示衷心的感谢！</span></section><section style=\"text-align: justify;vertical-align: inherit;letter-spacing: 1.5px;text-indent: 0em;line-height: 1.5em;\"><br/></section><section style=\"text-indent: 0em; white-space: normal; max-inline-size: 100%; cursor: text; caret-color: rgb(255, 0, 0); vertical-align: inherit; letter-spacing: 1.5px; line-height: 1.5em; text-align: center; font-family: 微软雅黑, sans-serif; outline: none 0px !important;\"><img src=\"/ueditor/php/upload/image/20220120/1642646366129171.jpg\" title=\"1642646366129171.jpg\" alt=\"6.webp.jpg\"/></section><section style=\"text-indent: 0em; white-space: normal; text-align: center; max-inline-size: 100%; cursor: text; caret-color: rgb(255, 0, 0); vertical-align: inherit; letter-spacing: 1.5px; line-height: 1.5em; font-family: 微软雅黑, sans-serif; outline: none 0px !important;\"><strong style=\"max-inline-size: 100%; outline: 0px; cursor: text; letter-spacing: 1px; font-size: 13px; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"max-inline-size: 100%;outline: 0px;cursor: text;font-size: 12px;color: #ff0000;\">与会人员认真听取报告</span></strong></section><section style=\"text-align: justify;vertical-align: inherit;letter-spacing: 1.5px;text-indent: 0em;line-height: 1.5em;\"><br/></section><section style=\"text-align: justify;vertical-align: inherit;letter-spacing: 1.5px;text-indent: 0em;line-height: 1.5em;\" class=\"\"><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\">数智新时代到来了，2021年10月份我们以“连接数智时代 新塑秋叶原”为主题召开的全国营销大会取得了成功，顺利拉开了数字新时代“秋叶原”品牌拓展的营销深化的序幕。<span style=\"caret-color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">秋叶原作为一个有30多年历史的企业，要抓住数智时代的巨大机遇，</span></span><span style=\"caret-color: rgb(255, 0, 0); color: rgb(255, 76, 65); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"><strong>以新形象、新起点、新定位、新模式、新战术，（五新战略）开启“秋叶原”发展新征程</strong></span><span style=\"caret-color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-size: 14px; color: rgb(255, 76, 65); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"><strong>！</strong></span></section><section style=\"text-align: justify;vertical-align: inherit;letter-spacing: 1.5px;text-indent: 0em;line-height: 1.5em;\"><span style=\"caret-color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-size: 14px; color: rgb(255, 76, 65); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"><strong><br/></strong></span></section><section style=\"text-indent: 0em; white-space: normal; text-align: center; max-inline-size: 100%; cursor: text; caret-color: rgb(255, 0, 0); vertical-align: inherit; letter-spacing: 1.5px; line-height: 1.5em; font-family: 微软雅黑, sans-serif; outline: none 0px !important;\"><img src=\"/ueditor/php/upload/image/20220120/1642646359397305.jpg\" title=\"1642646359397305.jpg\" alt=\"7.webp.jpg\"/></section><section style=\"text-indent: 0em; white-space: normal; text-align: center; max-inline-size: 100%; cursor: text; caret-color: rgb(255, 0, 0); vertical-align: inherit; letter-spacing: 1.5px; line-height: 1.5em; font-family: 微软雅黑, sans-serif; outline: none 0px !important;\"><strong style=\"max-inline-size: 100%;cursor: text;outline: none 0px !important;\"><span style=\"max-inline-size: 100%; cursor: text; color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-size: 12px; outline: none 0px !important; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\">与会人员认真听取报告</span></strong></section><section style=\"text-align: center; max-inline-size: 100%; cursor: text; text-indent: 0em; caret-color: rgb(255, 0, 0); vertical-align: inherit; letter-spacing: 1.5px; line-height: 1.5em; font-family: 微软雅黑, sans-serif; outline: none 0px !important;\"><span style=\"max-inline-size: 100%;cursor: text;font-size: 12px;outline: none 0px !important;\"><strong style=\"max-inline-size: 100%;cursor: text;outline: none 0px !important;\"><span style=\"max-inline-size: 100%;cursor: text;color: #ff0000;outline: none 0px !important;\"></span></strong></span></section><section style=\"text-align: justify;vertical-align: inherit;letter-spacing: 1.5px;text-indent: 0em;line-height: 1.5em;\" class=\"\"><br/></section><section style=\"text-align: justify;vertical-align: inherit;letter-spacing: 1.5px;text-indent: 0em;line-height: 1.5em;\" class=\"\"><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\">面对数智时代的巨大机遇，秋叶原要改变过去围绕房地产为主展开的主体战略，确立以数字经济、智慧城市为重心，抓住5G、工业互联网、物联网与大数据、新基建、大湾区、经济圈的市场契机，加强线上线下融合、一体化协同发展的全新总体战略部署。</span></section><section style=\"text-align: center; max-inline-size: 100%; cursor: text; text-indent: 0em; caret-color: rgb(255, 0, 0); vertical-align: inherit; letter-spacing: 1.5px; line-height: 1.5em; font-family: 微软雅黑, sans-serif; outline: none 0px !important;\"><strong style=\"max-inline-size: 100%;cursor: text;outline: none 0px !important;\"><span style=\"max-inline-size: 100%; cursor: text; color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; outline: none 0px !important;\"></span></strong></section><section style=\"text-align: justify;vertical-align: inherit;letter-spacing: 1.5px;text-indent: 0em;line-height: 1.5em;\"><br/></section><section style=\"text-align: justify;vertical-align: inherit;letter-spacing: 1.5px;text-indent: 0em;line-height: 1.5em;\" class=\"\"><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\">1、在品牌方面，品牌是企业永续经营基业长青的百年大计，是企业最硬的底。各分子公司、各部门都要高度重视品牌建设与维护工作，严格按照全新的VI要求规范品牌形象传播。</span></section><section style=\"text-align: center; max-inline-size: 100%; cursor: text; text-indent: 0em; caret-color: rgb(255, 0, 0); vertical-align: inherit; letter-spacing: 1.5px; line-height: 1.5em; font-family: 微软雅黑, sans-serif; outline: none 0px !important;\"><br/></section><section style=\"text-align: justify;vertical-align: inherit;letter-spacing: 1.5px;text-indent: 0em;line-height: 1.5em;\"><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\">2、在营销方面：以线上、线下及工程大客户“2+1”模式为运营主轴，对电商、营销与工程的发展定位全面规划、团队组织架构进行新调整。</span></section><section style=\"text-align: justify;vertical-align: inherit;letter-spacing: 1.5px;text-indent: 0em;line-height: 1.5em;\" class=\"\"><br/></section><section style=\"text-align: justify;vertical-align: inherit;letter-spacing: 1.5px;text-indent: 0em;line-height: 1.5em;\" class=\"\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 1.5px; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\">3、在制造与研发方面：加强智能连接场景系列产品的开发，强化由集采中心统筹开发集成配套与消费类产品。</span></section><section style=\"text-align: justify;vertical-align: inherit;letter-spacing: 1.5px;text-indent: 0em;line-height: 1.5em;\" class=\"\"><br/></section><section style=\"text-align: justify;vertical-align: inherit;letter-spacing: 1.5px;text-indent: 0em;line-height: 1.5em;\" class=\"\"><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\">4、在产业升级方面：秋叶原梦科园智谷与汕尾产业园正在建设，为未来发展20亿元产值奠定坚实基础。&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></section><section style=\"text-align: justify;vertical-align: inherit;letter-spacing: 1.5px;text-indent: 0em;line-height: 1.5em;\" class=\"\"><br/></section><section style=\"text-align: justify;vertical-align: inherit;letter-spacing: 1.5px;text-indent: 0em;line-height: 1.5em;\" class=\"\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"><strong><strong>综上所述：就是要抓住数智时代、做好数字经济、奏响</strong><strong>“新塑秋叶原”时代强音！</strong></strong></span></section><section style=\"text-align: justify;vertical-align: inherit;letter-spacing: 1.5px;text-indent: 0em;line-height: 1.5em;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"><strong><strong><br/></strong></strong></span></section><p style=\"text-align:center;vertical-align:inherit;\"><img src=\"/ueditor/php/upload/image/20220120/1642646351839101.jpg\" title=\"1642646351839101.jpg\" alt=\"8.webp.jpg\"/></p><section style=\"text-align: center; max-inline-size: 100%; cursor: text; text-indent: 0em; caret-color: rgb(255, 0, 0); vertical-align: inherit; letter-spacing: 1.5px; line-height: 1.5em; font-family: 微软雅黑, sans-serif; outline: none 0px !important;\"><strong style=\"max-inline-size: 100%;cursor: text;outline: none 0px !important;\"><span style=\"max-inline-size: 100%; cursor: text; color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-size: 12px; outline: none 0px !important; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"></span></strong></section><section style=\"text-align: justify;vertical-align: inherit;letter-spacing: 1.5px;text-indent: 0em;line-height: 1.5em;\" class=\"\"><br/></section><section style=\"text-align: justify;vertical-align: inherit;letter-spacing: 1.5px;text-indent: 0em;line-height: 1.5em;\" class=\"\"><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\">数智新时代到来了，伴随着新机遇、新挑战迎面而来。在<span style=\"letter-spacing: 0px; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Emoji Symbols Font&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;\">新的一年里，集团将制定更加务实精准的经营政策，加大品牌投入，加强线下形象体验店建设和线上全面推广。故此，</span>希望大家快速转变旧思维，学习新理念、使用新工具、实施新方法、贯彻新策略，与时俱进；以更加昂扬的姿态开拓进取、奋力拼搏，携手共创、共享秋叶原的美好未来！</span></section><section style=\"text-align: justify;vertical-align: inherit;letter-spacing: 1.5px;text-indent: 0em;line-height: 1.5em;\"><p style=\"vertical-align: inherit; font-size: 14px; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"><br/></p></section></section><section data-role=\"paragraph\"><section style=\"text-indent: 0em; caret-color: rgb(255, 0, 0); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-align: center; max-inline-size: 100%; cursor: text; letter-spacing: 1.5px; line-height: 1.5em; font-family: 微软雅黑, Arial, sans-serif; outline: none 0px !important;\"><section style=\"vertical-align: inherit;line-height: 1.5em;\"><span style=\"outline: 0px; font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: 1px; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"><strong style=\"max-inline-size: 100%;cursor: text;outline: none 0px !important;\"><span style=\"max-inline-size: 100%;cursor: text;text-align: justify;text-indent: 24px;color: #FF0000;outline: none 0px !important;\"></span></strong></span></section></section></section><section data-role=\"title\" data-tools=\"135编辑器\" data-id=\"108733\" style=\"max-inline-size: 100%; border-width: 0px; border-style: none; border-color: initial; z-index: 0; caret-color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-family: 微软雅黑, sans-serif; box-sizing: b