rsor: text; outline: none 0px !important; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\">深秋财务中心总监林贵平先生</span></strong></p><p style=\"max-inline-size: 100%;cursor: text;vertical-align: inherit;line-height: normal;outline: none 0px !important;\"><span style=\"max-inline-size: 100%; cursor: text; color: rgb(255, 76, 65); font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: 1px; outline: none 0px !important; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"><strong style=\"max-inline-size: 100%;cursor: text;outline: none 0px !important;\">为优秀员工获得者颁奖并合影留念</strong></span></p></section></section><section data-role=\"paragraph\"><section style=\"vertical-align: inherit;line-height: 1.5em;\" class=\"\"><br/></section></section><section data-role=\"paragraph\"><section style=\"vertical-align: inherit;line-height: 1.5em;\" class=\"\"><span style=\"color: rgb(63, 63, 63); letter-spacing: 0.544px; caret-color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\">获奖人员笑脸洋溢，台下掌声不断，气氛热烈，全体秋叶原人深受鼓舞，将以先进为榜样，以昂扬姿态、奋发精神建功新时代、奋进新征程。</span></section><section style=\"vertical-align: inherit;line-height: 1.5em;\"><p style=\"text-align:left;vertical-align: inherit; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: 0.544px; caret-color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"><br/></p></section></section><section data-role=\"title\" data-tools=\"135编辑器\" data-id=\"108733\" class=\"_135editor\"><section style=\"text-align: center;margin: 10px auto;line-height: 1.5em;\"><section style=\"display: flex;justify-content: center;align-items: flex-end;\" hm_fix=\"426:501\"><section style=\"box-sizing:border-box;width: 55px;transform: rotate(0deg);-webkit-transform: rotate(0deg);-moz-transform: rotate(0deg);-ms-transform: rotate(0deg);-o-transform: rotate(0deg);\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/JaFvPvvA2J063TNzibibGfI89U9UaWNPqYHNxrW98mVobN4nh4Oe03ZYY0iavpnxfd16iclXRckIe6BCTSXVbwlKrw/640?wx_fmt=gif\" data-type=\"gif\" data-width=\"100%\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;vertical-align:inherit;width: 100%;display: block;\" data-ratio=\"1\" data-w=\"55\"/></section><section style=\"background-color: rgb(224, 5, 11); padding: 2px; border-radius: 20px; margin-left: -35px; box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"border-width: 1px; border-style: dashed; border-color: rgb(253, 182, 75); border-radius: 20px; padding: 7px 12px 7px 33px; box-sizing: border-box;\"><section data-brushtype=\"text\" style=\"letter-spacing: 2px; color: rgb(255, 252, 226);\"><p style=\"vertical-align:inherit;line-height: 1.5em;letter-spacing: 1.5px;\">&nbsp;签订2022目标责任状&nbsp;</p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section data-role=\"paragraph\"><section style=\"vertical-align: inherit;line-height: 1.5em;\"><br/></section><section style=\"text-align: center;line-height: 1.5em;\"><img src=\"/ueditor/php/upload/image/20220120/1642646299442159.jpg\" title=\"1642646299442159.jpg\" alt=\"14.webp.jpg\"/></section><section style=\"vertical-align: inherit;line-height: 1.5em;\"><br/></section></section><section data-role=\"paragraph\"><section style=\"text-align: justify; vertical-align: inherit; outline: 0px; text-indent: 0em; letter-spacing: 1.5px; line-height: 1.5em; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Arial, sans-serif;\" class=\"\"><span style=\"outline: 0px; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\">目标在心，责任在肩。大会最后，孙董事长逐一与<span style=\"outline: 0px; letter-spacing: 1px; text-indent: 34px;\">各控股公司、职能部门及各事业部负责人签署了</span></span><span style=\"outline: 0px; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"outline: 0px; color: #262626; letter-spacing: 1px; text-indent: 34px;\"></span><strong style=\"outline: 0px;color: #262626;letter-spacing: 1px;text-indent: 34px;\"><span style=\"outline: 0px; color: #FF0000;\">“2022年经营计划和目标责任书”。</span></strong><span style=\"outline: 0px; color: #3F3F3F;\">深入贯彻落实集团公司2022年度工作会议精神，进一步认清形势，强化任务分解，层层落实责任，</span><span style=\"outline: 0px; color: #3F3F3F;\">使之成为秋叶原2022年度完成全年目标任务的重要手段。</span></span></section></section><section data-role=\"paragraph\"><section style=\"vertical-align: inherit;line-height: 1.5em;\"><br/></section></section><section data-role=\"paragraph\"><section style=\"text-align: center;line-height: 1.5em;\" class=\"\"><img src=\"/ueditor/php/upload/image/20220120/1642646288134760.jpg\" title=\"1642646288134760.jpg\" alt=\"15.webp.jpg\"/></section><section style=\"vertical-align: inherit;line-height: 1.5em;\" class=\"\"><br/></section></section><section style=\"text-align: justify;vertical-align: inherit;letter-spacing: 1.5px;line-height: 1.5em;\" class=\"\"><span style=\"color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\">数智时代到来了，秋叶原将顺应国家发展战略、<span style=\"letter-spacing: 1.5px; caret-color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">革新技术，</span><span style=\"caret-color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">超前规划、精准对标、同时代并行，抓住数智时代、</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.5px; caret-color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">做好数字经</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.5px; caret-color: #ff0000;\">济，</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">在数字化浪潮中助推公司高质量发展，奏响“新塑秋叶原”时代强音！</span></span></section></section>', 1, 0, 10, 255, '2022-01-20 10:40:42', '2022-01-20 10:40:42', '2022-01-20 10:40:42', '2023-07-21 13:48:24', '/upload/image/20220513/28393fbef267080f906a3848b6422c0b.png', '[]', '', '', '', 'PC', 'zh-CN'),
